 Be \r\nit in L.A., be it in \r\nAustin.</p>',1,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(455,359,'2001-05-04 19:41:22',0,'<B>wicked california temptress</B>, genetically related to Barbie','come to los angeles, where the \r\nwoman are all surgically \r\nresized for your enjoyment, \r\nthe median iq is several steps \r\nlower than you may be \r\naccustomed to (well, not if \r\nyou\\\'re from texas),  the \r\ndrinks more exotic, the drugs \r\nmore deadly and the jobs more \r\nglamourous.  On behalf of \r\nsatan\\\'s minions, i welcome \r\nyou.',0,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(456,359,'2002-03-08 04:52:53',65,'le','LA != california. please \r\nspecify SOUTHERN california. \r\ni could try and lure people \r\nto SF, where the rents are \r\ngoing down and the gay boys \r\nare well groomed...',3,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(460,359,'2002-10-06 17:40:35',261,'sine','<P>As owner of the chest \r\nabove, I can assure you there \r\nis NOTHING SURGICALLY \r\nMODIFIED about it. So you can \r\njust fuck off, you stupid \r\nfuck. Fuck you. \r\n(GREETINGS FROM SF)',1,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(458,359,'2001-05-04 19:41:22',0,'w.c.t.','as i was saying, surgically \r\nresized for truck drivers \r\nenjoyment.',0,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(459,359,'2001-05-04 19:41:22',0,'<B>DAD</B>','<P>Son, this is your dad.</P> \r\n<P>now boy, don\\\'t let those\r\ncalifornia women get their\r\nhooks in ya.  we want you to\r\ncome back to texas now, ya\r\nhear?  you\\\'re momma and i miss\r\nyou.</P><P>yer sister\\\'s\r\nhusband\\\'s cousin sally misses\r\nyou!</P>',4,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(457,359,'2001-05-04 19:41:22',0,'<TT>robotec9</TT>','<P><B><TT>one such california\r\ncriminal:</TT></B></P>\r\n<A\r\nHREF=\\\"http://fonem.org/cam/\\\"><IMG\r\nSRC=\\\"http://swinney.org/art/galleries/sine/sine15.jpg\\\"></A>\r\n<h1><TT>CALIFORNIA GOLD\r\n(SF)</TT></H1>',2,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(461,359,'2002-03-08 04:52:53',65,'le','yeah, i\\\'ve felt the fleshy \r\nreality of sine\\\'s tits and i \r\ncan vouch.',1,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(462,359,'2002-10-06 17:40:35',261,'sine','<P>hmm, he