") \\\"seen\\\".  ;)',2,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(701,435,'2001-05-04 19:41:22',0,'bmg','it is quite ok, joanna. i \r\nremember a time when aus10 \r\n(grumpy high school aus10) \r\npronounced \\\"lepard\\\", \\\"fe-lch \r\nboy\\\" or \\\"phat-ty cakes.\\\" Now \r\nhe just calls me bmg, i am \r\nmore comfortable with that. \r\naust10\\\'s nickname used to \r\nbe \\\"buster.\\\"',1,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(702,435,'2001-05-04 19:41:22',0,'dj1luna','we used to call him \\\"the \r\nweirdo boy in the room next \r\ndoor\\\" at first.',2,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(703,437,'2001-05-04 19:41:22',0,'jeffrey','hrm.. that would be me (the \r\ntopic). dunno what it is \r\nabout that picture...  \r\nsomething, that\\\'s for sure.',1,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(704,436,'2002-09-01 23:16:03',57,'weeb','awww chia, i don\\\'t know you, \r\nand i\\\'m already taken so i \r\ncan\\\'t even take you out and \r\nshow you a good time, but you \r\ngotta either go for a long \r\nlong walk, or sleep this off. \r\neveryone has periods of \r\nloneliness, you\\\'ll get over \r\nit- you might even like it \r\ntomorrow, who knows? but \r\nanyway, you get a virtual hug \r\nand a pat on the head. \r\n*pet*</p>',1,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(705,436,'2001-05-04 19:41:22',0,'kiks','i\\\'m sorry you feel so bad.  \r\nyou maybe feel better \r\ntommorow.  i don\\\'t know how \r\nold you are but i promise it \r\ngets easier after the mid-\r\ntwenties existential phase. \r\nbe nice to yourself. eat your \r\nveggies--the fresh ones.  \r\nvegetables love you.  you \r\nthink i\\\'m joking.  they are \r\nfilled with sunlight, and \r\nthat sunlight hits the cells \r\nyou feel so much better.  hot \r\ndogs and cigarrettes make \r\npeople depressed.  puppies \r\nlove you too.  go find some \r\nand hang out.  ',0,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(706,437,'2004-07-27 05:14:09',63,'olivia sez','<img \r\nsrc=\\\"http://oxy.gen.nz/images/\r\nolivia/teengoddess.jpg\\\" \r\nborder=\\\"1\\\"><br>\r\n<p>yeah, sometimes i think \r\nabout growing my hair out \r\ntoo.</p>',3,0,0,0,NU