ing really \r\namazing raunchy thoughts \r\nabout peter. \r\n<li> sleep\r\n<li> eat non vegan cookies \r\nfrom gas station. feign \r\ninnocence.\r\n</ol>',4,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(1148,539,'2002-06-27 20:39:15',240,'xep','hey elly, you forgot \\\"sleep\\\".\r\n<br>\r\nmew.\r\n',0,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(1149,533,'2001-05-04 19:41:22',0,'Joanna','Both my hands and knees are \r\nstinging from falling over, \r\nbut luckily, that was many \r\nmany hours after the actual \r\ngraduation ceremony.  And now \r\nI\\\'m crying from good will \r\nmessages from Olivia and you \r\nall, but thank you so much, \r\nyou have no idea how much \r\nthis degree means to me, and \r\nthe fact that  I\\\'m still \r\nalive, and just thank you, I \r\nlove you all.  ',1,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(1150,534,'2001-05-04 19:41:22',0,'joanna@hubris.co.nz','Months later, you hear a \r\nsong, and you remember that \r\nyou fucked to it.  You put on \r\nclothes, and you remember him \r\npulling them off of you.  \r\nMusic, movies, whatever, \r\nthey\\\'re memories t hat don\\\'t \r\nfade, and I\\\'m sorry.  And I \r\nmiss, and I know I am so \r\nmany  times better off \r\nwithout,  and I still feel \r\nall sad without, but \r\nremember, there are healthy \r\npeople to support you.  Like \r\nus, here, okay?  Good?  Good!',2,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(1151,539,'2001-05-04 19:41:22',0,'auntie','<ol>\r\n	<li>sleep</li>\r\n	<li>try not to obsess \r\nover incision that is scaring \r\nme</li>\r\n	<li>try harder to \r\nkeep not smoking</li>\r\n	<li>eat grapes</li>\r\n	<li>have a nap</li>\r\n	<li>play spider \r\nsolitaire for hours</li>\r\n	<li>make some more \r\nnekkid sim skins</li>\r\n	<li>watch lifetime \r\nteevee for women</li>\r\n	<li>order pay per \r\nview of toystory 2 which is \r\nthe only one i didn\\\'t see \r\nyet</li>\r\n	<li>sleep some \r\nmore</li>\r\n	<li>read trashy \r\nromance</li>\r\n	<li>plan another \r\namazingly complex web project \r\ni will never implement</li>\r\n	<li>email elly and \r\nmandy and peter and hang ou