\r\nhair from stuff like \r\nthis.<br><br>',1,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(1208,554,'2001-05-04 19:41:22',0,'auntie','lovely',1,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(1209,555,'2003-05-10 16:09:14',79,'yeti','<p>This is my fault. I \r\nsuggested that short cut to \r\ns5. The thing I find weird is \r\nthat in the 2.25 years I\\\'ve \r\nwalked down those tracks, \r\nnearly every day, I\\\'ve never \r\nhad that happen.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>So much for my confident \r\nadvice on that short cut.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>s5, I\\\'m sorry to have \r\ncaused you that much pain and \r\nemarassment.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I think God has reserved a \r\nspecial place for me in Hell \r\nover this.</p>',1,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(1210,555,'2001-05-04 19:41:22',0,'Joanna','In Japan, train drivers are \r\nnot allowed to stop if \r\nthere\\\'s someone on the \r\ntracks, because they might \r\ninjure the passengers.  Also, \r\nthe families of people who \r\ncommit suicide by train are \r\nfined something like 1 \r\nmillion yen for every minute \r\nthe trains are  delayed \r\ncleaning up the mess.  ',1,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(1211,553,'2001-05-04 19:41:22',0,'chaya','oh okay.  a little blurry \r\nthanks to caffeine handshake, \r\nbut here:<br><img \r\nsrc=\\\"http://daintycore.com/boo\r\nts.jpg\\\" alt=\\\"HARDFUCKINGCORE\\\">',6,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(1212,553,'2001-05-04 19:41:22',0,'auntie','those are pretty good boots!  \r\nthey are probably right up \r\nthere with elly\\\'s orange \r\ngiant martian person boots.  \r\ni used to have some boot that \r\nlaced up and they were hot \r\nand i wore them with navy \r\nblue satin hot pants and it \r\nwas the early seventies and i \r\nwent to see ike and tina \r\nturner at curtis hixon \r\nconvention hall, but my boots \r\nwere not as good as yours. i \r\nam humbled in their \r\npresence.  do something \r\nreally good when you wear \r\nthem next.',1,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(1213,555,'2002-09-01 23:16:03',57,'weeb','<p>wow, poor 5. i can just \r\nimagine that \\\'curse under \r\nyour breath and walk a little \r\nfaster\\\