. are we helping you \r\nchoose which of your books to \r\ntake or what books you should \r\nBUY? this makes a big \r\ndifference.<BR>\r\ni just had doritos for \r\nbreakfast. yum.',1,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(1272,572,'2001-05-04 19:41:22',0,'jo','cross fingers.<BR>\r\nwhat an amazing person you \r\nare! best wishes to you!',1,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(1273,572,'2001-05-04 19:41:22',0,'bmg','jeb... That is so kick ass \r\nbrother. I have much faith in \r\nyou, as does the rest of us... \r\ni will be thinking of you, \r\nwishing you the best of \r\nluck... i would love to come \r\nout there and help out! ',1,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(1274,571,'2001-05-04 19:41:22',0,'kat','<p>beg, borrow, buy, \r\nsteal...i have no qualms when \r\nit comes to aquiring \r\nbooks.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>so my first selection is \r\ndefinitely going to be \r\nTolkein. i had meant to read \r\nthose last Summer and never \r\ndid. the fact that the \r\ntrilogy isnt a trilogy means \r\ni can still choose four \r\nothers right? woohoo!</P>\r\n\r\n<p>my momma always \r\nsaid...book lernin is good \r\nfer ya.</p>',6,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(1275,571,'2001-05-04 19:41:22',0,'auntie','Helen Hooven Santmyer was \r\nborn in 1895 and wrote the \r\nbook And Ladies of the Club \r\nwhen she was in her 80s.  \r\nIt\\\'s a book about a group of \r\nwomen from diverse \r\nbackgrounds who start a \r\nliterary group that meets \r\nonce weekly on their \r\ngraduation from high school \r\nand follows them over 60 \r\nyears or so.  It was \r\nbrilliant!  It inspired me in \r\nmany ways. You can often find \r\nit in used bookstores for \r\nalmost no money, and it\\\'s a \r\nfat big book with like 1000 \r\npages or so.  It covers \r\neverything from politics to \r\nlove and marriage to men\\\'s \r\nissues to poverty and wealth \r\nand illness and all the human \r\nconditions for this one small \r\nohio town.',1,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(1276,573,'2003-05-10 16:09:14',79,'yeti','Hang in there! Things will \r\ncome to you. I have faith.',1,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(1