re not into \r\nsatirical looks at kinky sex, you might not dig this), and \r\nit\\\'s hysterical and has a certain beauty.  \r\n\r\ni\\\'m writing a ten-minute play based on a short story in \r\nwhich she meets and falls in love with lester bangs, which \r\nis why this came immediately to mind.  \r\n\r\n--c.',3,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(1555,631,'2002-03-05 20:16:36',214,'darwin','NOTHIN TO DO NOWHERE TO GOO-OOOH-OOH<P>\r\n<p>\r\nI WANNA BE',5,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(1556,632,'2002-06-12 21:13:52',93,'chiamattt','Â© Swinney.org, 1999-2001',6,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(1557,633,'2002-06-12 21:13:52',93,'chiamattt','Â© Swinney.org, 1999-2001',6,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(1558,635,'2001-05-04 19:41:22',0,'jo','i hate ass bruises! the only thing worse is when the doctor \r\ngives you a shot in your ass. dammit. i hate that.',1,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(1559,632,'2001-05-04 19:41:22',0,'auntie','you have been the victim of a test on what sort of entries \r\nget the most comments.  i am sorry to manipulate you, but \r\ndelighted that it worked.<br><br>\r\n\r\nkat is most correct.  but steve\\\'s answer(s) was/are my \r\nfavorite.<br><br>\r\n\r\nle should lighten up now.<br><br>\r\n\r\nmothers prefer doggy style on days when they don\\\'t prefer \r\nmissionary style or another variation.<br><br>\r\n\r\nsex gets more comments than sweeping generalizations of an \r\ninflammatory nature for those interested in this sort of \r\nmanipulation.<br><br>',4,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(1560,632,'2001-05-04 19:41:22',0,'mike','I think it depends on the context',1,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(1561,636,'2001-05-04 19:41:22',0,'vega','with over population, pollution, foreign politcs, two income\r\nfamilies, daycare, school shootings, is it really a wonder\r\npeople are getting away from the whole \\\"happy family\\\" with\r\n2.5 kids and a dog. too many people. too much corporate\r\npower. not enough community. too much greed. and really, if\r\ni am in a sorry state of the world right now, why would i\r\nwant to create something from love, that i love and leave\r\nhim/her to this place that i am disgusted with?',3,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(1562,632,'2002-09-01 23:16:03',57,'weeb','i think auntie needs some boundaries set.\r\n',1,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(1563,632,'2002-03-08 04:52:53',65,'le','totally.',4,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(1587,637,'2001-05-04 19:41:22',0,'kat','i use to hate needles...until last week. thats when i \r\nstarted getting acupuncture. it does amaze me tho to look \r\ndown and see my body....looking like pinhead.',3,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(1588,638,'2001-05-04 19:41:22',0,'kat','i like working for myself, cause i can wear my slippers. i \r\nlove my slippers more than anything else in my closet. oh \r\nwait....sometimes the cat sleeps in the closet. i think i \r\ncould give up the slippers for her. ive noticed that no \r\nmatter how hard i work for myself people still want to know \r\nwhen im going to get a job. ',1,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(1565,636,'2001-05-04 19:41:22',0,'observer','html O.K. Sometimes loving a child is the one experience that \r\noffsets all the other stuff. Why not just love all children?  \r\nBecause that\\\'s much too hard for most people. Having more \r\nthan an academic interest in the future and being aware of \r\nthe aspirations and worries of those younger than ourselves \r\nis also more intense when someone you love is one of them. Do \r\nnot attempt to parse the previous sentence. How about --  it \r\njust plain feels good to have the little guys in the family.   \r\n',2,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(1566,633,'2004-08-24 18:01:43',83,'adamajah','i plan to have a #666666 or #000000 bkground because it \r\nprovides the most neutral backdrop when posting artwork.  i \r\nam a boy.',3,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(1567,636,'2001-05-04 19:41:22',0,'jo','my mom, too, has had relationships with my boys. in fact, \r\none christmas, she started weeping because she missed jeff \r\nso much. \\\"he wasn\\\'t so good to me, mom.\\\" \\\"i know, i just. i \r\nloved the way he looked at you.\\\"<BR>\r\nit\\\'s easy to fall in love with someone who is in love with \r\nsomeone that you love. because they understand why that \r\nperson is so special. just like you always hoped someone \r\nwould.',1,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(1568,633,'2001-05-04 19:41:22',0,'kat','i had black for about a year. and i used black on some \r\nother people\\\'s sites. i like black. i may use it again. now \r\nim blue on blue. just like my heart.',2,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(1569,633,'2001-05-04 19:41:22',0,'kat','course, i admit...i always was a tomboy. sometimes i even \r\nwear guys underwear.',0,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(1570,632,'2001-05-04 19:41:22',0,'auntie','<a href=\\\"http://auntie.diaryland.com/76.html\\\">no \r\nboundaries</a><br><br>',4,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(1571,633,'2001-05-04 19:41:22',0,'auntie','all of these are good and interesting comments.  i have a \r\nfondness for bright colors when i make things for myself \r\nthat nobody will see, like red and orange and lime green \r\nand hot pink.  i think i will make my <a \r\nhref=\\\"http://auntie.diaryland\\\">diaryland</a> change into \r\nsomething more beautiful when i think of it some \r\nmore.<br><br>\r\n\r\nthank you for your support and comments. i love you each \r\nand every one.<br><br>',1,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(1572,617,'2001-05-04 19:41:22',0,'auntie','the most interesting thing about having a hysterectomy a \r\ncouple weeks ago is the hormone therapy.  it takes a while \r\nfor things to work properly and i am sometimes having pms \r\nseveral times a day and the reverse -- the end of pms, \r\ntoo.  it is very weird.<br><br>\r\n\r\nmoving is something i can relate to.  i have moved a \r\nzillion times and every time i do it is like a tiny little \r\ndeath of life as you know it.  i am all for having a place \r\nthat has my name on the deed, but it makes no difference, \r\neven when you do buy the place, you might still have to \r\nmove.  best plan for moving is to buy new sheets.  it makes \r\nsleeping in the new space easier for some reason.<br>',1,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(1573,632,'200