,'en'),(1605,639,'2001-05-04 19:41:22',0,'chaya','auntie, i continue to heart you a lot.  my personal \r\nfavorites to sling:<ul><li>cumdumpster<li>syphilitic \r\nwhore<li>bitchass hobag<li>hussy<li>bootlicking \r\ntrollop</ul><br>and i\\\'ve always wanted a good excuse to use \r\nthe word \\\"sycophant\\\" in conversation though it\\\'s not so \r\nfitting given this particular context.',1,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(1606,638,'2002-03-04 07:14:25',185,'orion','<p>parking tickets ... in your driveway?!?   that blows\r\nmonkey phallus.</p>',1,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(1607,639,'2004-07-27 05:14:09',63,'olivia sez','<br>\r\n<font face=\\\"verdana\\\" size=\\\"20\\\" \r\ncolor=\\\"#FF0000\\\">CUMDUMPSTER</font><br>\r\n<Br>\r\n',1,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(1608,632,'2004-07-27 05:14:09',63,'olivia sez','<br>\r\nmillican family #1',1,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(1609,637,'2001-05-04 19:41:22',0,'auntie','i also have preferences, rather than hatred.  the only \r\nexception would be that i prefer not to know people who are \r\nintentionally unkind.<br><br>  i rather like some of the \r\nthings you hate.  i think it is a wondrous thing that there \r\nis room enough in the world for both our points of view!',1,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(1610,633,'2002-03-04 07:14:25',185,'orion','<p>Guilty as charged on the unix part.  :-)  But I loath\r\nnetscape, part of me wants to fly to San Francisco to sneak\r\naround the AOL-Netscape building surrepticiously (sp?)\r\nkicking people in the nads (\\\"and that\\\'s for CSS support, ya\r\nlittle turd!\\\").</p>\r\n<p>I use netscape because for some reason M$ hasn\\\'t come out\r\nwith IE for Linux yet... ;-)</p>',2,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(1611,639,'2001-05-04 19:41:22',0,'auntie','cumdumpster is a good word, but it implies that the \r\ndescribed person is good enough to have been on the \r\nreceiving end of someone\\\'s affection, however momentary it \r\nmay have been.  however, this is such a good word i am \r\ngoing to immediately add it my vocabulary and perhaps write \r\na song about i