38,'2001-05-04 19:41:22',0,'ben','her short stories blew my mind away. Left nothing for the \r\nrest of the world, but I was happy for days. ',6,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(2339,786,'2002-06-27 20:39:15',240,'xep','seen on a bumper sticker recently: the best things in life\r\naren\\\'t things.\r\n',0,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(2340,787,'2002-06-27 20:39:15',240,'xep','heard among the female motorcycle riding elite: does this\r\nbike make my butt look fast?',0,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(2341,785,'2002-09-01 23:16:03',57,'weeb','ok! country station is at mission and sycamore, (between\r\n17th/18th st) and it\'s a in a sketchy hood. but once you\r\nenter the magic of country station it is time to rock out. i work every night\r\nbut wednesday night and the weekends, because we are\r\nclosed on weekends. end transmission!\r\n<p>\r\n\r\n',1,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(2342,789,'2001-05-04 19:41:22',0,'bmg','<p>geez... you took the words right out of my \r\nmouth.</p>',1,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(2343,610,'2002-09-16 21:29:19',82,'simon','is cafe flore the one you are talking about?\r\nhome of many of my high school girl-related dramatic scenes.\r\n',1,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(2344,789,'2002-06-12 21:13:52',93,'chiamattt','swinney.org group picture i think. ',6,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(2345,789,'2003-03-07 17:56:26',69,'starlajo','<BR>\r\nwow...\r\nexactly why i didn\\\'t see my friends for a few months while \r\ni was unemployed and feeling kind of shitty last year.',0,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(2346,787,'2001-05-04 19:41:22',0,'Danielle','Don\\\'t forgot about Canadians =)',1,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(2347,789,'2002-03-04 07:14:25',185,'orion','\\\"the security of being a student\\\"  ????  dude, in case\r\npeople are getting overly nostalgic: Being In School Sucks. \r\nIt\\\'s like being poor with the added benefit of people\r\ntelling you that you\\\'re stupid every day.',4,0,0,0,NULL,'en'),(2348,787,'2002-03-04 07:14:25',185,'orion','ain\\\'t nothin\\\' wrong wit\\\' a little <em>ghet-to boo-tay</em>,\r\nif you know what I\\\'m sayin\\\'  ;-)'