my advice: it\\\'s really better to have never \r\nloved at all than to have loved and have to listen to \r\nsomeone\\\'s shrill voice accusing you of being a LIAR/WHORE/\r\nCAPITALIST/SLUT/POSER, etc. years later. \r\n',0,0,0,0,'4.18.197.3','en'),(3637,1044,'2004-07-27 05:13:48',63,'o','i have no idea about the rest of texas, but austin is #1. \r\ni\\\'d live there in a flash.  i\\\'ve never been anywhere else\r\nwhere they\\\'ll bring you beer and pizza in the movies.  oh,\r\nexcept gold class here.  but there it was $4 and here it\\\'s\r\n$35.  so.',1,0,0,0,'203.45.52.132','en'),(3638,1044,'2002-03-08 04:50:11',86,'egg','you dork, they bring you beer and pizza at the movies in \r\nOakland. \r\n',0,0,0,0,'4.18.197.3','en'),(3639,1044,'2001-06-06 23:56:13',0,'jo','i\\\'m glad that alamo draft left such a good impression upon \r\nyou, liv.<BR>\r\n(come visit! we\\\'ll go again! YAY for getting shitty at the \r\nmovie theater.)',1,0,0,0,'216.141.109.62','en'),(3640,1050,'2002-06-27 20:39:15',240,'xep','ALERT! there is no turquoise in the house.  REPEAT: there is\r\nno turquoise in the house!  the window frame that looks\r\ntuquoise in the picture is white.  weird camera thing.  the\r\ndoor jam that looks brown is firetruck red.  the wall that\r\nlooks red is pumpkin insanely bright orange.  OK!\r\n\r\n',0,0,0,0,'209.228.7.6','en'),(3641,1052,'2002-09-16 21:29:19',82,'simon','they above about relationships/affairs. welcome to my life! \r\nhi, i\\\'m special.\r\n',1,0,0,0,'63.195.92.218','en'),(3642,1052,'2002-09-16 21:29:19',82,'simon','the unrealistic part\r\n',1,0,0,0,'63.195.92.218','en'),(3643,1050,'2001-06-07 00:12:19',0,'fashion homo','s5! oh please! girl, you wish.\r\n',1,0,0,0,'63.195.92.218','en'),(3644,1052,'2001-06-07 01:28:40',0,'lulu','you said \\\"retarded\\\"\r\n',0,0,0,0,'64.14.248.62','en'),(3645,1052,'2002-03-08 04:50:11',86,'egg','FUUUUUUUUk that is shitty of me. someone, how do I edit this? \r\ncan you guys take out the word \\\"retarded\\\". it is