esnt know shit about how to treat a \r\nlady\\\" is that it implies that someone who is mentally \r\nhandicapped, ie retarded, should share the same \r\nconnotation with someone who is a donkey dick.\r\n<p>\r\nis anyone out there? can you just take the word out? ',0,0,0,0,'216.175.103.38','en'),(3654,1044,'2001-06-07 03:38:27',0,'eoj','yes, come to sf.  everyone else is leaving, i hear. :)\r\n<P>\r\nbut, i suggest wyoming.  there is just something about being \r\nso far out there in the middle of nowhere, storms so far \r\naway that light up the entire sky yet you are not in the \r\nstorm, then you are in it, then there are double rainbows \r\nthat go ALL THE WAY AROUND.  so simple.  so nice.\r\n',1,0,0,0,'64.3.15.93','en'),(3655,1052,'2004-07-27 05:13:48',63,'o','i thought the use of the word retarded was fine.  \r\nemotionally unavailable/retarded.  that sounds correct.  \r\nwhat\\\'s the problem?',1,0,0,0,'210.8.201.242','en'),(3656,1052,'2001-06-07 04:20:27',0,'lulu','retarded retarded retarded. \r\nyou\\\'re all retarded.\r\n',0,0,0,0,'64.14.248.62','en'),(3657,1052,'2001-06-07 04:30:14',0,'eoj the pedant','Main Entry:	<b>reÂ·tardÂ·ed</b><br>\r\nPronunciation:	<tt>ri-\\\'t&auml;r-d&amp;d</tt><br>\r\nFunction:	<i>adjective</i><br>\r\nDate:	1895<br>\r\n<b>:</b> slow or limited in intellectual or emotional \r\ndevelopment or academic progress<P>\r\n\r\ni think egg\\\'s problem here is more with the \r\n(non-pc) connotation of <b>retarded</b>, versus the strict \r\ndenotation of the word.  everyone who seems to be okay with \r\nit is focusing more on the denotation.<P>\r\n\r\nand yes, i\\\'m retarded.',4,0,0,0,'64.3.15.93','en'),(3658,1054,'2001-06-07 18:53:44',0,'hi','my name is austin',4,0,0,1,'209.228.7.6','en'),(3659,1052,'2001-06-07 04:54:25',0,'lulu','wow.  egg, i\\\'m so proud of you.\r\n',0,0,0,0,'64.14.248.62','en'),(3660,1046,'2001-06-07 04:56:09',0,'lulu','quinn, was that english?\r\n',0,0,0,0,'64.14.248.62','en'),(3661,1052,'2002-03-08 04:50:11',86,'egg