ie?<br>\r\n    It\\\'s rated ARRR.<br>  </p>',0,0,0,0,'216.171.37.54','en'),(4082,1107,'2001-06-14 16:27:13',0,'jeff','you could wax your head.\r\n',0,0,0,0,'4.18.197.3','en'),(4083,1099,'2002-03-08 04:50:11',86,'egg','cmon people, theres a war on, get it together and pick up a \r\ngun! and there will always be, until we can learn to \r\nreproduce asexually.\r\n',0,0,0,0,'4.18.197.3','en'),(4084,1099,'2002-03-08 04:50:26',86,'egg to chaya','<p>chaya, please see my email re: the flintstones. i had a \r\ndream last week about flintstone dresses. I dont think thius \r\nhas anything to do with \\\"all pants, all the time\\\". except \r\nthat we could write that on anything. </p>\r\n<p>i would like to mention that i am wearing an empire waist \r\ndress today. </p>\r\n',0,0,0,0,'4.18.197.3','en'),(4085,1099,'2002-03-08 04:50:26',86,'egg to darwin etc.','<p>Im now concerned that my comment above will be taken as a \r\nflippant disregard for gender politics. make no mistake about \r\nit, my position on male-female interaction is decidedly \r\nambiguous and inconsistent.</p>\r\n<p><b>to darwin</b>: go ahead and write about how girls suck. \r\nits not something that isnt said implicitly by most popular \r\nmedia and classical literature. but make sure theres \r\nsomething catchy in it, like, \\\"all pants, all the time.\\\" \r\nsomething the kids can write on their asses.</p>\r\n<p>how about, \\\"all clitoridectemy, all the time\\\"? or what \r\nabout \\\"you can rape me, but you wont go to jail\\\"? or maybe \\\"i \r\nused to love her, but i had to kill her\\\"? oh my, theyve all \r\nbeen done.\r\n',0,0,0,0,'4.18.197.3','en'),(4086,1104,'2002-03-08 04:50:26',86,'egg to bmg','<p>for silicon to wood i would use the <a href=\\\"http://\r\nwww.thistothat.com/cgi-bin/glue.cgi?lang=en&this=Plastic&\r\nthat=Wood\\\">plastic to wood</a> option. but the silicon has to \r\nbe FILTHY CLEAN, i tell you.</p>\r\n',0,0,0,0,'4.18.197.3','en'),(4087,1107,'2001-06-14 16:58:19',0,'maureen','<p