cklisting that appears to be, at the \r\nmoment, not available.  But the promo is not going to be \r\nthe actual album.  I guess that with the super-extended \r\nrelease date, she decided to rearrange the tracklisting.',3,0,0,0,'206.47.244.62','en'),(4733,1214,'2004-07-27 05:13:48',63,'o','i don\\\'t understand the fuss.  i thought the writing was \r\ngood, but i\\\'m pretty easily pleased.',3,0,0,0,'210.8.201.242','en'),(4734,1218,'2002-03-05 01:46:04',17,'austin','<P>i read this in reverse, egg. one paragraph at a time.\r\n</P><P>\r\ni have travelled hundreds of miles at a high rate of speed.\r\n</P><P>\r\ntoday\r\n</P><P>\r\nplanes\r\n</P><P>\r\nfucking suck.  and i never want to do that again.  my karmic \r\naura was a screaming comit ball with a tail half a mile long.\r\n</P><P>\r\nbitches, this is my motherfucking life.\r\n</P><P>\r\nword.\r\n</P>\r\n',4,0,0,0,'64.174.154.199','en'),(4735,1218,'2001-06-28 04:36:21',0,'leonard','this is all very interesting, but are you on your period?\r\n>>>>>>>hi.',6,0,0,0,'209.178.129.201','en'),(4736,1206,'2002-03-04 07:14:25',185,'orion','somehow I don\\\'t see a member of the SS chillin\\\' at Mojo\\\'s. \r\nStarbucks seems more like their sort of place. *drum and\r\ncymbol*',1,0,0,0,'209.163.146.106','en'),(4737,1218,'2002-03-04 07:14:25',185,'orion','<blockquote>I suddenly\r\n                                            felt bad for\r\nstraight men all over the country.</blockquote><br>\r\nWord!  ;^)',1,0,0,0,'209.163.146.106','en'),(4738,1216,'2002-03-05 20:16:36',214,'darwin','<p>\r\n<a href=\\\"http://bible.gospelcom.net/cgi-bin/bible?\r\npassage=GAL+6:6-\r\n8&language=english&version=KJV&showfn=off\\\">Galatians \r\n6:7</a> : </p>\r\n<p>\r\nBe not deceived; God is not mocked: for whatsoever a man \r\nsoweth, that shall he also reap.\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\n-darwin\r\n',6,0,0,0,'24.221.161.16','en'),(4739,1218,'2002-03-08 04:50:26',86,'egg to leonard','<p>why do you ask, leonard? you love jelly donuts?</p>',0,0,0,0,'64.168.