y as driving through downtown or staring out \r\nthe window, are transformed into experiences, with \r\nunimagined subtext and beauty.\r\n',3,0,0,0,'65.84.40.62','en'),(5111,1275,'2001-07-06 20:57:55',0,'green','its all about chopins trio in g minor\r\n\r\n\r\nawwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwwww, beeeee-oooo-tiful',1,0,0,0,'138.23.189.113','en'),(5112,1277,'2001-07-06 21:08:06',0,'essemar to s5',' Whiskers definitely belong to a certain gender, and they \r\nsometimes appear close to a mouth.  Also, if I were \r\nblindfolded and kissed someone (whiskers aside) I\\\'d be able \r\nto tell you if it was a man or a woman.  Men and women just \r\ntend to approach sexuality with very different energies, so \r\neven if the tools that are used are the same, it would \r\nstill feel different because of the approach.',1,0,0,0,'198.45.19.20','en'),(5113,1218,'2001-07-06 21:11:42',0,'green','i have a bob\r\nlets go out?',3,0,0,0,'138.23.189.113','en'),(5114,1277,'2001-07-06 21:27:10',0,'sic','boys who like girls who like girls who like their boys \r\nand their girls...',0,0,0,0,'207.62.162.110','en'),(5115,1279,'2001-07-06 21:28:29',0,'bitchy chick','you better AXX somebody cuz i gotta man!\r\n',6,0,0,0,'63.195.92.218','en'),(5116,1272,'2002-09-05 18:42:54',18,'ix','no, seriously, you might enjoy having a journal. you know, \r\nso people could go \\\"oh hey i want to see what tyler\\\'s been \r\nthinking today\\\" or \\\"i sure like that tyler guy\\\'s writing, i \r\nam glad i can go to tyler.diaryland.com and look at \r\neverything he\\\'s ever written\\\".\r\n',0,0,0,0,'209.228.7.187','en'),(5117,1279,'2001-07-06 21:41:09',0,'green','AXX your momma...did I ever say you didnt have a man??\r\n...besides holding him hostage dont count!',6,0,0,0,'138.23.189.113','en'),(5118,1279,'2001-07-06 22:22:59',0,'bitchy chick','how can you go out the house like that? look, you obviously \r\ndon\\\'t respect yoself and if you don\\\'t respect yoself, HOW \r\nANYBODY ELSE GONNA RESPECT YOU?\r\n',6,0,0,0,'63