 like about this site? i can put \r\n\\\"dahlia\\\" in an article and know somehow that dahlia will \r\nferet it out. that each word can open connections and \r\nrelationships, mirror on mirror, Ramona Forever. i \r\nguess they call it \\\"hypertext\\\" harhar. but not that it has to \r\nbe people who have inside jokes or know each other -- \r\nive had mini-interactions with people here based purely \r\non the text. so anyways, that turns me on. time for noise \r\nand art.',0,0,0,0,'216.175.101.202','en'),(5377,1326,'2002-03-08 04:52:11',66,'Peter','<br>\r\n<tt>\r\nAcckkkk.  all these break-up manoeuverings posted lately \r\n(myself included).  i think i\\\'m going to crack.<br>\r\n<br>\r\nis it the summer heat?  my god, what is it?\r\n</tt>',3,0,0,0,'64.152.169.48','en'),(5378,1326,'2001-07-11 21:33:55',0,'old lady from \\\"annie hall\\\"','love fades.',0,0,0,0,'216.175.101.202','en'),(5379,1318,'2001-07-11 21:54:00',0,'lulu to egg','start throwing shoes at it. it worked for me.',0,0,0,0,'209.178.154.118','en'),(5380,1327,'2001-07-11 22:58:41',0,'adamajah to unknown','trimps are for kids',6,0,0,0,'64.120.104.101','en'),(5381,1320,'2001-07-11 23:00:51',0,'eoj','sigh. dmv. cars. etc.  it is going to be $500 to get my car \r\nout of jail.  silly me.\r\n',1,0,0,0,'64.3.15.93','en'),(5382,1324,'2001-07-11 23:23:16',0,'jerk to stella','well no one else will date you! hahaha!\r\n',4,0,0,0,'63.195.92.218','en'),(5383,1326,'2001-07-11 23:49:39',0,'lonely','sigh\r\n',1,0,0,0,'63.195.92.218','en'),(5384,1326,'2001-07-12 00:49:42',0,'kat','<p>\\\"I was always the stronger one, but ...he could always \r\nbury his pains better than I ever could\\\"</p>\r\n\r\n<p>god do i know this.</p>\r\n',1,0,0,0,'32.102.64.18','en'),(5385,1324,'2001-07-12 00:52:04',0,'pradapanda','Pure Degenerates here.',6,0,0,0,'24.93.61.58','en'),(5386,1326,'2002-03-08 04:50:11',86,'egg','i have sad thoughts sometimes about love, but then i \r\nremember my anger and bitterness and it washes my \r\nsadness away. let\\\'s hope nina sings you a love song \r\ntonight. right now we are drinking wine and I am going \r\nto put on the chet baker version of this song.',0,0,0,0,'216.175.100.55','en'),(5387,1327,'2002-06-12 21:13:52',93,'chiamattt','<p>\r\nok unknown. for one...SHUT THE FUCK UP PLEASE. two, you \r\narent an enemy, you just think the world revolves around you \r\nand thats why you blow every situation out of proportion and \r\nact so reactionary with every situation. i have yet to even \r\nsay anything remotely rude to you and you have said lots. i \r\ndont care if you are gone forever. youll realize how wrong \r\nyou are about so many things one day as will i. however for \r\nnow im trying to work shit out with the rest of my life and \r\nyet you keep coming back, picking fights like you always do. \r\nyouve admitted it. so back off!\r\n</p>\r\n<p>\r\np.s you dont know the people on this site. ive had the \r\npleasure of meeting a couple of them and i can say that they \r\nare not complainers. yes, they may analyze thoughts and \r\ndreams, but so have some of the greatest minds in the world. \r\ni can also say that of the ones i have met, the light of day \r\nis what they love. i dont expect you to think anyone on here \r\nis cool. you are too busy thinking about yourself. ',6,0,0,0,'24.43.182.49','en'),(5388,1327,'2001-07-12 03:22:14',0,'hi','yikes',0,0,0,0,'65.84.40.62','en'),(5389,1327,'2002-03-08 04:50:11',86,'egg','all of the people i know in person who post on this site \r\nare supreme complainers. the key is that they usually \r\nelevate it to an art form.',0,0,0,0,'216.175.100.55','en'),(5390,1327,'2002-03-05 20:15:16',59,'s5','yuck, the outside world.',5,0,0,0,'65.84.40.62','en'),(5391,1327,'2002-03-05 01:46:04',17,'austin','<H1>SUCK IT!<sup>1</sup></H1>\r\n<sub>1. the phrase \\\"SUCK IT\\\" comes from ICB or Internet \r\nCitizen Ban, more specifically from the chat channel known as \r\n\\\"eels\\\" which is usually moderated by the persona of one so \r