ifically of \r\nthe breed Intellectual Teenage Boy, a theory that has been \r\noft-quoted by me over the years: that in its growth this \r\nspecies thinks itself to become first Jesus, then Hamlet, \r\nthen Stepehen Dedalus. As a teenage androgyne, I was of this \r\nbreed myself, and spent many months in the final phase. I \r\nknew myself to be a manly-minded-woman, and like Joyce\\\'s non-\r\nhero, a goddess-fearing control freak, terrified of water, \r\nthe monthly moonly phases, and the livid female mushiness and \r\nleaking that I also knew as Life. Now I hear Egg, who many \r\nyears ago was the archtypal Great Mother for many of my \r\nadolescent breed, describe me as I am, with a mind that leaks \r\nas I struggle to make lists and try to remember where I put \r\nsomething five seconds ago. Self-realization of \r\ntransformation. Man becomes fish becomes bird becomes \r\nfeatherbed mountain. Stephen Dedalus has a mushy mind and \r\nfemale soul.  \r\n',1,0,0,0,'209.86.7.95','en'),(5412,1333,'2002-09-16 21:29:19',82,'simon','when i was last at the bend i got caught in a web of glue and \r\nmonofilament and was pulling it out of my hair at the hotsy \r\ntotsy all evening.\r\n',0,0,0,0,'63.195.92.218','en'),(5413,1333,'2001-07-12 21:33:41',0,'puppy','this has been driving me nuts: what is the \\\"bend?\\\"',0,0,0,0,'192.35.232.99','en'),(5414,700,'2001-07-12 21:53:14',0,'confused vagina','what happens to some of my stories that have dissapeeared\r\n\r\nthey were in the front they were they were!!!',5,0,0,0,'138.23.189.113','en'),(5415,1333,'2001-07-12 22:08:45',0,'the bend:','<br>\r\n<a href=\"http://www.links.net/vita/sf/egg/thebend/pix/view.lg.jpg\"><img \r\nsrc=\"http://www.links.net/vita/sf/egg/thebend/pix/\r\nview.sm.jpg\" width=\"160\" height=\"120\" alt=\"thebendwindow\" \r\nborder=\"0\"></a>\r\n',0,0,0,0,'209.86.7.95','en'),(5416,1333,'2002-03-05 20:15:16',59,'s5','hi. i\\\'m an earth sign. i lose things and walk into walls.',3,0,0,0,'65.84.40.62','en'),(54