e doing all the fiddling and then you \r\nget a lifelong headache. ',0,0,0,0,'209.86.7.131','en'),(5587,1355,'2002-10-18 20:39:20',75,'tyler','you girls just need to get back in the kitchen, cook up \r\nsome grub for the menfolks, and crochet afghans. chi, \r\nschmee.',1,0,0,0,'63.10.151.201','en'),(5588,1355,'2002-10-18 20:39:20',75,'tyler','serious question: if you injure yourself in a chakra area, \r\nis it supposed to interfere with your development? I broke \r\nmy tailbone when i was 12 and hurt the center of my chest \r\nbadly when I was 15 or so.',1,0,0,0,'63.10.151.201','en'),(5589,1355,'2001-07-17 04:41:39',0,'kat to ty','<p>oh i will cook you some grub....right after i tie you up \r\nand make you cry.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>there can be no pleasure, without pain.</p>',1,0,0,0,'32.102.91.85','en'),(5590,1355,'2002-10-18 20:39:20',75,'tyler','kat: my love for you grows each day.',1,0,0,0,'63.10.151.201','en'),(5591,1355,'2002-10-18 20:39:20',75,'tyler','matter of fact, it\\\'s growing right now.',1,0,0,0,'63.10.151.201','en'),(5592,1354,'2001-07-17 05:10:32',0,'kat','i want to swallow you<br>\r\nlike green tea ice cream</p>\r\n\r\n<p>sliding down the back of my throat<br>\r\na Summer moment<br>\r\nspicy, sweet, growing things<br>\r\nleaving<br>\r\ncondensation rings on my skin</p>\r\n\r\n<p>oh damn...ate you too fast<br>\r\nteeth grinding headache<br>\r\nensues</p>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n<p>gimme more!</p>\r\n',4,0,0,0,'32.102.91.85','en'),(5593,1355,'2001-07-17 05:16:32',0,'nottastalker!','Damnit, it\\\'s <b>CAITLIN DARFLER</b>. :(',0,0,0,0,'216.150.228.226','en'),(5594,1355,'2001-07-17 06:01:40',0,'my little pony','that\\\'s a bowl of greasy donky dick to you.',0,0,0,0,'216.103.215.241','en'),(5595,1355,'2001-07-17 06:08:05',0,'auntie','nottastalker - thank you for making the spawn of my loins \r\nlaugh in public.  everyone should laugh aloud in quiet \r\nplaces, it helps sweep out the despair that often comes to \r\nlive there.<br><br>\r\n\r\neveryone should now go to 