ar who didnt shower very much. \r\nhe did it not to ward off girls but to get them. he had this \r\ntheory that girls were attracted to the natural smells, oils, \r\nand all that junk that nature gave us to emit. he said that \r\nwhen he didnt shower, more girls would pay attention to him. \r\nyou might be doing yourself harm by not showering or washing \r\nyour hair le. you should really just put some BRUT or ADIDAS \r\non or some other bad cologne. the king bee doesn\\\'t want a \r\nking bee smellin girl. \r\n',6,0,0,0,'142.214.129.50','en'),(5602,1355,'2001-07-17 13:34:42',0,'eyehurt','I wonder what things we would get if we posted our address \r\nin our posts. Someone send me some Passion Fruit Ice Cream.',1,0,0,0,'207.8.101.10','en'),(5603,1353,'2001-07-17 15:30:33',0,'leonard to egg','tulum is nice. the ruins are nice. the food gave me the \r\nruns. maybe, if you go, you\\\'ll shit in your pants and think \r\nof leonard.',4,0,0,0,'64.210.3.222','en'),(5604,15,'2001-07-17 15:32:40',0,'leonard','did you mean your own backend? that\\\'s not like you to say \r\nsuch things. i thought you enjoyed people playing around in \r\nyour backend?',2,0,0,0,'64.210.3.222','en'),(5605,1356,'2003-05-10 16:09:14',79,'yeti','Congratulations! :)',1,0,0,0,'64.51.232.102','en'),(5606,1353,'2001-07-17 15:57:02',0,'axl rose','aaaaiiiiiiiiiiiyyyyiiiiiiiiiaaaaaaaaaaaaiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiiii',0,0,0,0,'216.15.97.21','en'),(5607,1353,'2001-07-17 16:57:35',0,'kat','or shit your pants and think of fernando.',4,0,0,0,'32.102.109.40','en'),(5608,1355,'2001-07-17 17:05:43',0,'kat','<p>i have one of those mail box thingys too...but all that \r\ni ever find in there is insurance bills. *sigh*</p>\r\n\r\n<p>i would be more than willing to send out an addy via \r\nemail in the hopes that an exchange of objects might take \r\nplace. im a giver. [ha ha...ty? do you hear me ty? that was \r\nfor you]</p>\r\n\r\n<p>this just reminded me...<br>\r\nread of an ongoing international journal project where \r\nf