43',0,'kat to jo','<i></i>\r\n<p>sorry for the slop. we were being silly and having fun. \r\nit must have been the coke egg let us snort off her \r\nbreasts.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>either that or we just had way too many jelly donuts and \r\nDr. Peppers.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>the sugar high is killing me</p>',4,0,0,0,'32.102.64.212','en'),(6037,1425,'2001-07-25 20:26:07',0,'kat','<p>old war wounds stab me<br>\r\nso i soak solo hottub<br>\r\nthinking of your heat</p>',4,0,0,0,'32.102.64.212','en'),(6038,1426,'2001-07-25 20:38:20',0,'benadam','<pre>\r\nI love everyone, silly',2,0,0,0,'24.221.161.16','en'),(6039,1416,'2004-07-09 19:12:25',72,'essemar','<P>Actually, I think I was suffering from heat stroke this \r\nmorning.  I was definitely feeling giddy.</P><P>It\\\'s \r\nfucking muggy around here today.  I woke up last night at \r\n1:30am drenched in sweat, couldn\\\'t go back to sleep.  \r\nJumped in the shower and blasted myself with cold water \r\nuntil I induced a little hypothermia.  Passed right out.  \r\nIt\\\'s the only way to deal with the heat sans aircondioner, \r\nespecially considering I don\\\'t have any windows in my room, \r\nso it\\\'s rather oven-esque.</P>',0,0,0,0,'198.45.19.20','en'),(6040,1428,'2001-07-25 20:42:24',0,'kat','<p>my mother is the master of guilty mindfucks.</p>\r\n\r\n<p style=\\\"margin-left: 10\\\">witness:<br>\r\n\\\"I\\\'m sorry to say I\\\'m feeling sad and depressed lately. I \r\nhate to say it, but what triggered it is that I feel \r\ncheated, since I read your last message. I feel sad that \r\nyou have not wanted to spend time with me doing the same \r\nkind of things. You won\\\'t spend the night anymore, so there \r\ndoesn\\\'t seem to be enough time to just sit and talk and/or \r\ngo out to lunch together or go shopping, etc., (are you \r\nembarrassed to be seen in Public with me)? It seems like \r\nyou only want to be with me when H\\\'s family is around, \r\nwhich means there is barely any time for us to even talk. \r\nH\\\'s daughters have spent a lot of time with their Mom. \r\nSometimes when she is not doing well they take her to the \r\ndoctor or hospital; and when she feels better they take her \r\nto places that she likes to go to. They have spent extra \r\ntime with her, because they feel each year could be their \r\nlast year of having her as their Mom. Time is a precious \r\ngift, that we shouldn\\\'t waste, because we will never get it \r\nback. I\\\'m glad that you want to get to know H\\\'s kids, since \r\nthey are your Step Sisters and Step Brother, and his \r\nGrandsons are your Step Nephews. But I don\\\'t want our \r\nfamily get-togethers with them to take the place of you and \r\nI spending time together. I already have gone thru losing \r\nmy only Son, so I couldn\\\'t bear losing my only Daughter \r\ntoo. Life is too hard sometimes; it\\\'s bad enough I have to \r\nlive with pain in my body all the time; but it hurts my \r\nheart even more when my own kids don\\\'t want to be with me. \r\nLove you very much, Mom\\\"</p>\r\n\r\n<p>please note that my brother is not dead...just a jerkwad \r\nwho never calls anybody. i don\\\'t think i\\\'ve talked to him \r\nin three years. i\\\'m convinced that this has blown the \r\nheadtrip ratios out of proportion for my mother....so not \r\nonly do i get my quota of guilt, but his as well.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>ps: i love my mom dearly, and i told her so after i got \r\nthis. she later blamed this email on her meds.</p>',4,0,0,0,'32.102.64.212','en'),(6041,1426,'2004-07-09 19:12:25',72,'essemar','<P>I have a friend who likes to \\\'nudge\\\' boys with her \r\nboobies.  She calls it, \\\"Boobie Dry Humping.\\\"<br>...<br>I \r\nguess it\\\'s less of a nudge and more of a hurling herself at \r\nsomeone boob first.</P>',0,0,0,0,'198.45.19.20','en'),(6042,1426,'2001-07-25 20:53:12',0,'kat to burt','i have no respect for men who are obsessed with whether \r\ntheir partner O\\\'s or not! wanting to please is obviously \r\nnice...but if all you can think about is lighting up the \r\nwinner\\\'s board like it was a State Fair carny game then \r\nyou\\\'re missing the point and don\\\'t even deserve to be \r\nfucked.',6,0,0,0,'32.102.64.212','en'),(6043,1426,'2001-07-25 20:56:37',0,'jo','</i></i>&#60;/i&#62;',1,0,0,0,'216.141.109.62','en'),(6044,1426,'2001-07-25 20:58:14',0,'jo','</font></font></pre>oh and &#60;/pre&#62; &#60;/font&#62;',1,0,0,0,'216.141.109.62','en'),(6045,1430,'2001-07-25 21:14:58',0,'kat','<p>oh god, thank you. i will be wearing a smile on my face \r\nthe rest of today because of this post.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>[an official hola and welcome to you! dont worry about \r\nfitting in, i AM the biggest dork this side of the \r\nMississippi...aside from my friend <a \r\nhref=\\\"http://swinney.org/journals/userpages.phtml?\r\nusername=lush\\\">lush</a> that is. he does a mean chicken \r\ndance, or so i hear.]</p>',1,0,0,0,'32.102.64.212','en'),(6046,79,'2002-03-05 01:46:04',17,'austin','<P>crap fucking shit. time to go out drinking. goddamnit.\r\noff to oakland. i snorted some paxil and i\\\'m ready to have\r\nfun!</P>\r\n',2,0,0,0,'205.179.19.31','en'),(6047,1430,'2001-07-25 22:50:07',0,'felicity','Thanks Kat!  I feel more welcome already.  BTW-which side of \r\nthe Mississippi is that, because I\\\'m pretty sure I\\\'ve staked \r\nthe supreme dorkiness claim on the eastern half of this \r\ngreat land we call home.',3,0,0,0,'216.42.125.249','en'),(6048,1431,'2001-07-25 22:59:05',0,'GOD','<BR>\r\n<img\r\nsrc=\\\"http://www.conceptimages.com/a_Images/pcf/PCF01-08-16.JPG\\\"><BR><BR>\r\nyou and joker...',3,0,0,0,'205.179.19.31','en'),(6049,1416,'2001-07-25 23:05:36',0,'stella','<P>*pout*</P>\r\n<P> I live in NY too.</P>',0,0,0,0,'168.100.203.247','en'),(6050,1431,'2002-03-05 01:46:04',17,'austin','i hope it doesnt pop out and bite your face off!',4,0,0,0,'205.179.19.31','en'),(6051,1431,'2001-07-25 23:14:18',0,'SSJ3 Gostu','oooh! reminds me of the teardrop video.',0,0,0,0,'208.58.87.82','en'),(6052,1430,'2001-07-25