riends who still live in and around and i \r\nwill not recall the different clubs, good radio, museums, \r\ngreat film festivals and the jacked up roads.<P>but then \r\nswinney presents some random text, written long ago by a \r\nvisitor to detroit and it leaves me thinking, \\\'fuck, who am \r\ni to abstain?\\\'<P>thank you natasha and austin swinney \r\nreaching out and messing with me personally today.  i love \r\nyou guys. ',1,0,0,0,'216.82.34.12','en'),(6271,1471,'2001-07-31 21:55:54',0,'jo','it\\\'s interesting that the way to avoid having your car \r\nbroken into is to make it look already broken into.',1,0,0,0,'216.141.109.62','en'),(6272,1474,'2001-07-31 22:16:29',0,'leonard','robert <a href=\\\"http://www.csulb.edu/%7Erroden/rodent.html\\\" \r\ntarget=\\\"_blank\\\"><b>roden</b></a>||||||||||||||||||',3,0,0,0,'64.210.3.222','en'),(6273,1468,'2001-07-31 22:58:39',0,'deb','essemar, i can\\\'t dance but i\\\'m inspired by tango; sight and \r\nsound. makes one want to learn...',2,0,0,0,'205.188.197.24','en'),(6274,1473,'2001-07-31 23:01:14',0,'deb','reality shows are anything but...',2,0,0,0,'205.188.197.24','en'),(6275,1466,'2001-07-31 23:07:37',0,'deb','8th and Market: where the homeless live outside the doors \r\nof the burger king begging for coffee that they don\\\'t \r\nreally want. ',2,0,0,0,'205.188.197.24','en'),(6276,1471,'2001-07-31 23:36:04',0,'fool','<p>Buying beer at safeway always seemed strange to me - back \r\nhome, you couldn\\\'t get it there. <br><br>But here, in the \r\nmidwest, you can get all that and more - hard liquor\\\'s going \r\ncheap, right there on aisle 6. ',3,0,0,0,'206.97.79.187','en'),(6277,1477,'2001-08-01 00:49:06',0,'<p>joker','it\\\'s good to have another goal...it\\\'s \r\ncalled:</p><blockquote><p>\r\nyou can take it with you!!!!</p></blockquote>',2,0,0,0,'66.25.186.181','en'),(6278,1477,'2002-03-08 04:50:11',86,'egg','im going to be in thailand for a wedding. how far is thailand \r\nfrom australia? its like right next 