tailed studies on chomping labias.  i\\\'ll let \r\nyou know when the paper is published.\r\n<p>\r\n<img href=\\\"http://www.brentronics.com/dentata.gif\\\">\r\n',3,0,0,0,'64.81.72.119','en'),(6553,1515,'2001-08-07 22:54:46',0,'liver','i mean:\r\n<br>\r\n<img src=\\\"http://www.brentronics.com/dentata.gif\\\">',3,0,0,0,'64.81.72.119','en'),(6554,1515,'2001-08-07 23:06:21',0,'scared','<br><i> hold me</i>',0,0,0,0,'64.160.46.81','en'),(6555,1529,'2002-03-05 01:46:04',17,'austin','how dare you mentions mcsweeney\\\'s on this site.  how dare you.',3,0,0,0,'205.179.19.31','en'),(6556,1517,'2004-07-27 05:13:48',63,'o','<p>people sometimes call me livy.</p>',4,0,0,0,'210.8.201.242','en'),(6557,1515,'2001-08-08 00:29:45',0,'o to le','<p>i recently bought a pair of black see-through panties \r\nwith hot pink lacy rows of ruffles on the arse.  the sort \r\nyou\\\'d expect can-can dancers to wear, except a little more \r\nlo-fi.  i think they qualify as fancy-pants.</p>',4,0,0,0,'210.8.201.242','en'),(6558,1515,'2002-03-08 04:50:26',86,'egg to o','WHERE',0,0,0,0,'216.243.8.245','en'),(6559,1529,'2002-03-08 04:50:11',86,'egg','i mentioned mcsweeney\\\'s <a \r\nhref=\\\"http://swinney.org/journals/article.phtml?id=1512.txt\\\"\r\n>just yesterday</a>',0,0,0,0,'216.243.8.245','en'),(6560,1515,'2001-08-08 00:42:44',0,'kat','my god. and here i was just getting ready to do some  \r\nexploration of girl flesh. well, you just scared that idea \r\nright outta me. course i seem to have an overabundance of \r\nfemales asking me out...and NO boys, so damn what\\\'s this \r\ngeeky tomboy to do???',4,0,0,0,'32.102.109.109','en'),(6561,1529,'2001-08-08 01:31:24',0,'deb','it happened today, in new jersey, too.  i was with a friend \r\nfrom work in a store; she wanted to have a frame engraved \r\nfor her boyfriend\\\'s birthday.  the lady waiting in line \r\njust started telling us all about the frame she had \r\nengraved for HER boyfriend... because his dog had just died \r\nand she had a beautiful picture of him and the dog on the \r\nbeach that she wanted to give him... they were both \\\'dog \r\nlovers.\\\'\r\n',2,0,0,0,'64.12.102.39','en'),(6562,1529,'2001-08-08 02:16:16',0,'squarepusher','McSweeney\\\'s is such a fad.\r\n',6,0,0,0,'24.27.26.77','en'),(6563,1529,'2002-03-08 04:59:53',174,'Mad Moll','<p>It\\\'s going to take a lot more than hiphop and sketch \r\ncomedy to turn this boat around, son, but I guess you got \r\nto start somewhere, right?</p>',6,0,0,0,'152.163.197.199','en'),(6564,1519,'2002-03-08 04:50:26',86,'egg to peter','<p>nietzche\\\'s two dollah theory on reincarnation is that if \r\nyou were to quantify personality traits, even at a very \r\nspecific level, then there would only be a finite possible \r\nnumber of combinations of all those personality traits, \r\nwhich would result in the repetition of certain whole \r\npersons.</p>\r\n<p>thats how swinney.org sneaks into your psyche. math. if \r\nenough dipshits write enough minute details about their \r\nlives on this web site and enough other dipshits read it, \r\none dipshit is bound to have experienced or said the same \r\nthing as another dipshit. ix, you wanna get in on this with \r\nthe probability/statistics?</p>',0,0,0,0,'216.243.8.25','en'),(6565,1522,'2001-08-08 03:04:33',0,'miss world','i wake up at 551am every morning.  there\\\'s something \r\nimportant about not waking up at an even \r\ntime.<Br><br><Br>also, it makes me very grouchy to wake up \r\nso early.  but i am being a grown-up about \r\nit.<br><Br><Br><br><Br><br>also: mitchell is The Man, and i \r\n<b>know</b> you don\\\'t work for mitchell.',0,0,0,0,'206.40.244.66','en'),(6566,1517,'2001-08-08 03:10:15',0,'mr. happy','ok, make that two olivia\\\'s.',0,0,0,0,'66.68.76.248','en'),(6567,1529,'2001-08-08 03:30:50',0,'jo','YOUR MOM IS A FAD.<BR>\r\ni will hear no foul words towards mcsweeney\\\'s, jerks.',1,0,0,0,'64.12.96.200','en'),(6568,1529,'2001-08-08 03:40:11',0,'David Byrne','Eggers is lame and forgettable to some. you can\\\'t expect \r\nall people with taste to like it. live with it. Different \r\nStrokes..',6,0,0,0,'24.27.26.77','en'),(6569,1526,'2001-08-08 03:42:05',0,'gloom','I WANT MY MONEY BACK!',6,0,0,0,'209.179.131.202','en'),(6570,404,'2002-03-08 04:50:11',86,'egg','weeb, my Eve does silkscreeing, if you can wait until \r\noctober for her to come over and show you. also, my \r\nroommate wants to set up silkscreening shop in our loft. so \r\nwhy dont we start a business. I dont have anywhere to be.',0,0,0,0,'216.243.8.25','en'),(6571,1517,'2002-03-05 20:15:16',59,'s5','ert calls me fivey.',3,0,0,0,'65.84.40.62','en'),(6572,1519,'2002-03-08 04:50:11',86,'egg','<br>lulu, i feel you deep in my panties today.\r\n<p><img src=\\\"http://www.saturn5.com/egg/lulu.jpg\\\" \r\nwidth=\\\"300\\\" height=\\\"290\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" alt=\\\"new freedom\\\">\r\nsoon, we can have it all again, if you lend me the money \r\nfor a man in vegas. you can snort coke off my used maxi \r\npads.</p>',1,0,0,0,'216.243.8.25','en'),(6573,404,'2001-08-08 04:02:56',0,'kat','<p>damn. i wanna do that. i will pitch in with what i can \r\nif you\\\'ll let me come over n do stuff. i\\\'ve been wanting to \r\ndo some shirts. fuck if im going to pay twenty bucks just \r\nto have \\\'ratbastard.com\\\' on my chest. i am not the one you \r\nneed to show you standard printing techniques...but i\\\'ve \r\ndone some pretty bizarre shit that i can share.</p>\r\n\r\n<img \r\nsrc=\\\"http://www.lefteyelazy.com/images/misc/blasted.jpg\\\">\r\n\r\n<p>my serigraphy prof hated me cause i never colored in the \r\nlines. hee hee</p>\r\n\r\n\r\n',3,0,0,0,'32.102.64.43','en'),(6574,1529,'2001-08-08 04:07:02',0,'kat','i didn\\\'t talk to anyone in the store today, but i did catch \r\nmyself dancing in isle 10 to the bad musak. damn i need to \r\nget out and shake the booty more often.',1,0,0,0,'32.102.64.43','en'),(6575,1517,'2002-03-08 04:50:11',86,'egg','I like to add \\\"y\\\"s to other words. \\\"Fucky\\\