to my everyday colors. \r\nyou could play around with your clothing too, maybe \r\nstart wearing the same exact thing that ann wears, but \r\nthe day after. Bring a pillow from home for your chair, \r\nbut with a transformer cartoon pillow case. get a IBM \r\ndouble-click keyboard, to annoy those around you. Eat \r\nyour lunch at your desk, microwave fish-sticks. you don\\\'t \r\nhave to eat them, just cook em\\\' so everyone knows who \r\nis eating stinky fish sticks - offer them to ann. Exchange \r\nthe coffee mug for an old style beer mug with pictures \r\nof Castles on it. Wear t-shirts that say, \\\"Foam Frenzy II - \r\nAlpha Omega 99!\\\" or your old UT orange hooded \r\nsweatshirt. ',0,0,0,0,'66.68.76.248','en'),(6777,1555,'2001-08-09 22:29:07',0,'bmg','I simply adore Puppy\\\'s head... and what is inside of it is \r\nreally cool too! Hi Puppy, long time no talk to you! I miss \r\nhanging out with ya! I think i will write you an email now.',1,0,0,0,'66.68.76.248','en'),(6778,1555,'2001-08-09 22:33:17',0,'green','Weeb you are beautiful...we share the same do now and Im \r\nnot answering my phone noe. HA! Im getting fired and Im \r\nbald!',1,0,0,0,'198.81.16.167','en'),(6779,1557,'2001-08-09 22:57:14',0,'bmg','my life is like a non-profit org. no one gets paid, yet I still \r\nseem to have a roof over my head, the phone and the \r\ninternet is allways paid for, and i allways have beans to \r\neat... why is that? Would anybody like to donate their \r\ntime to my life? I have good hours, and we can do \r\nwhatever you like. Wanna go swimming, camping or \r\nhow about a nice walk throuh the park? Lets make \r\nanimal figures out of the clouds, and talk about \r\nsunsets. No letters to stamp, no canvasing the \r\nneighborhood - less you would like to recruit more \r\npeople to join my non-profit! Drinking is encouraged on \r\nthe job, no pee tests and definately no tv. ',0,0,0,0,'66.68.76.248','en'),(6780,1555,'2001-08-09 23:06:31',0,'chi chi','oh god, if i had clippers on me i\\\'d shave my head right \r\nnow. i miss 2minute showers, and not conditioning, i \r\nhate having to try to detangle curly-curly hair for 20 \r\nminutes, and hair bands that break and snap your \r\nfingers, and hair that falls out, and gets in your eyes \r\nand mouth.',0,0,0,0,'64.165.201.206','en'),(6781,1551,'2002-06-12 21:13:52',93,'chiamattt','well i guess humanity has to leave the cave. once we leave \r\nthe cave as a whole, earth will be blue again.',1,0,0,0,'24.43.182.49','en'),(6782,1552,'2002-03-08 04:50:11',86,'egg','im laughing heartily with a beer in my hand. i miss you. i \r\nmiss ann. I dont even know her and I just want to take her \r\nin my arms and let her know that she should take better \r\nadvantage of your gifts and get into some trouble.',0,0,0,0,'216.243.8.234','en'),(6783,1550,'2002-03-08 04:50:11',86,'egg','can i just say. that whenever you see a picture of chan she \r\nis looking all glam and pretty, but that when you see her \r\nshe has whiskey dribbling down her face, which you cant \r\nreally see because it is covered in hair-band layered \r\nshaggy hair. and that my friend andy the other night \r\nbragged to me that he had sex with her \\\"stylist\\\". I mean, \r\nplease! like she needs to pay someone to tell her to wear a \r\nwhite button down shirt.',0,0,0,0,'216.243.8.234','en'),(6784,1557,'2002-03-08 04:50:11',86,'egg','if she\\\'ll have me, Im going to work off the raspberry hat. \r\nbut i doubt it. I think ive bought her absence with my sin.',0,0,0,0,'216.243.8.234','en'),(6785,1557,'2001-08-09 23:55:50',0,'chi chi','hmmm, that\\\'s a sound plan. maybe i can borrow some \r\nfamily heirloom and loose it. then she\\\'ll never call me \r\nagain!',0,0,0,0,'64.165.201.206','en'),(6786,1477,'2001-08-10 00:21:45',0,'alana','come see the little city again le. \r\ni didn\\\'t see you but i\\\'m sure the city would like to see \r\nyou again. \r\nthe water is warm and the nights are so hot sometimes that \r\nyou need to sleep at the beach. \r\ni like.',3,0,0,0,'202.67.109.191','en'),(6787,1537,'2001-08-10 00:30:20',0,'deb','oh, for the sake of humanity. god damn braless hippies ;)',2,0,0,0,'205.188.196.37','en'),(6788,1555,'2001-08-10 00:36:34',0,'Bobby','Weeb, you are a sweet little Weebie.  Where do you keep the \r\nbatteries for that shirt?\r\n',1,0,0,0,'209.208.77.222','en'),(6789,1551,'2002-03-08 04:52:11',66,'Peter','<br><tt>...but it seems we can\\\'t get outta the cave.  too \r\nmany pretty shadows being cast on teh walls.</tt>',3,0,0,0,'209.244.103.31','en'),(6790,1539,'2001-08-10 00:40:56',0,'deb','how was the demon? it\\\'s hard to spend time w/ people you \r\ndon\\\'t think you like... it\\\'s harder to get past what you \r\nthink you know to see what really is...',2,0,0,0,'205.188.196.37','en'),(6791,1552,'2002-03-08 04:52:11',66,'peter to austin','<br><tt>i dunno, but if you asked me, i think you should eat \r\nmore beans for breakfast to add more color to the \r\ndialogue</tt>',1,0,0,0,'209.244.103.31','en'),(6792,1553,'2002-03-08 04:52:11',66,'Peter','yea, we are.  best friendly.',1,0,0,0,'209.244.103.31','en'),(6793,1555,'2002-03-08 04:52:11',66,'Peter','<img src=\"http://www.rhodamine.org/pics/peterpromised.jpg\"><br>Once, I had 6.17$ in the bank and spent 5 of it on a haircut.',3,0,0,0,'209.244.103.31','en'),(6794,1556,'2002-09-09 00:01:42',195,'matt','<BR><BR>You\\\'ll be, hmm-hmm-hmm-hmm, magnet for \r\nmoney<BR>You\\\'ll be, mm-mm-mm-mm, magnet for love<BR>You\\\'ll \r\nfeel, hmm, light in your body<BR>Now I\\\'m gonna say, gonna \r\nsay these words:<BR><BR>Rompiendo la monotonia del \r\ntiempo<BR>Rompiendo la monotonia del tiempo<BR><BR>It might \r\nhmm-mmm-mm-mm, it might rain money<BR>It might hm-hi-hi-hi, \r\nit might rain fire<BR>Now I\\\'m gonna call, gonna call on \r\nLegba.<BR>Get yourself a sign, Get your love and \r\ndesire.<BR><BR>Rompiendo la monotonia del \r\ntiempo<BR>Rompiendo la monotonia del tiempo<BR><BR>Papa \r\nLegba,<BR>Come and open the gate.<BR>Papa Legba,<BR>To the \r\ncity of camps.<BR>Now, we\\\'re your children<BR>Come and ride \r\nyour horse<BR>In the night, in the night<BR>Come and ride \r\nyour horse<BR><BR>There is a queen, of six sevens and \r\nnines<BR>Dust in your garden, poison in your mind<BR>There \r\nis a king, that will steal your soul<BR>Don\\\'t let him catch \r\nyou, don\\\'t let him get control.<BR><BR>Rompiendo la \r\nmonotonia del tiempo<BR>Rompiendo la monotonia del \r\ntiempo<BR><BR>(d. byrne, 1986)\r\n',1,0,0,0,'209.208.77.222','en'),(6795,1532,'2002-06-12 21:13:52',93,'chiamattt','i have a sick love of combat photography. ',6,0,0,0,'24.43.182.49','en'),(6796,1559,'2002-03-08 04:50:11',86,'egg','brezsny-esque.',0,0,0,0,'216.243.8.234','en'),(6797,1559,'2001-08-10 01:23:59',0,'ps','couldnt we just skip the exam and play foozeball and eat \r\npizza.',0,0,0,0,'216.243.8.234','en'),(6798,1551,'2001-08-10 01:38:21',0,'dza','<i>not closing tags is <b>hep ',0,0,0,0,'64.120.104.101','en'),(6799,1552,'2002-03-05 20:17:36',17,'austin to peter','<P>i left the farts out.  there are lots of farts though. \r\nall it takes is cereal with milk in the morning.</P>\r\n<P>i had icecream at the company birthday celebration.  i\r\nfarted after. often.</P>',3,0,0,0,'205.179.19.31','en'),(6800,1559,'2002-03-05 20:15:16',59,'s5','yes please.',3,0,0,0,'65.84.40.62','en'),(6801,1543,'2001-08-10 01:53:50',0,'deb','trading soda cans w/ homeless men. that\\\'s an interesting \r\nconcept.  i bought a man a cup of coffee once and he didn\\\'t \r\nwant it...after i bought it. he wanted change for orange \r\njuice around the corner. i could have gotten him \\\'orange \r\njuice\\\' in mcdonalds.  there wasn\\\'t a stand around the \r\ncorner.',2,0,0,0,'205.188.196.56','en'),(6802,1544,'2001-08-10 01:57:00',0,'deb','good luck with the raise. i think the beer might help.  ',2,0,0,0,'205.188.196.56','en'),(6803,1545,'2001-08-10 01:59:47',0,'deb','nj is one of the only places like that; but it does create \r\njobs, if you think about it. but i don\\\'t want to get into \r\nan employment conversation.\r\n\r\nthe question: you missed the dog and the pole. did you miss \r\nthe old man too?',2,0,0,0,'205.188.196.56','en'),(6804,1550,'2004-07-27 05:13:48',63,'o','<p>it is a cruel trick of the universe to grant talent and \r\nbeauty to one person.  perhaps also a cruel trick that most \r\nhumans place high value on both.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>does being talented make you grow beautiful?  does \r\ntalent make you beautiful in the eyes of humans?  do we \r\nonly see talented people that are beautiful, standing \r\ntriumphant upon a pile of talented uglies?</p>',4,0,0,0,'210.8.201.242','en'),(6805,1558,'2001-08-10 02:28:44',0,'sawks','<br>\r\n<img src=\\\"http://www.goldteeth.com/images/stylem-Lg.gif\\\" \r\nborder=\\\"1\\\">',3,0,0,0,'210.8.201.242','en'),(6806,1552,'2004-07-27 05:13:48',63,'o','why does everyone have to talk about farts?  i hate farts \r\nand hearing about other peoples farts.  i hate it when \r\nsomeone farts and i have to smell it.  ugh.  farts. FARTS.  \r\nEW.',6,0,0,0,'210.8.201.242','en'),(6807,1552,'2002-03-08 04:52:11',66,'Peter, waxingnostalgic on gas','<br><tt>a friend of mine has a defective pyloric valve and \r\nemits copious quantities of burps and farts, uncontrollably. \r\n its rather sad.  its a gasseous tourettes, of sorts.  she\\\'s \r\nalso profoundly bitter about this, as her twin sister \r\ndoesn\\\'t suffer from said maladay.</tt>',3,0,0,0,'63.210.214.55','en'),(6808,1558,'2002-03-08 04:52:11',66,'Peter','<br><tt>the kind of <a \r\nhref=\\\"http://www.riceboypage.com/\\\">bling</a> you love to \r\nhate...</tt>',3,0,0,0,'63.210.214.55','en'),(6809,1559,'2002-06-12 21:13:52',93,'chiamattt','the answer to all those questions can be found outside. \r\nturn right and then left after the second set of lights. \r\nyou will see a ralphs on the left side. turn left and \r\nyeild. watching for pedestrians head south and turn right \r\nat the corner with a phone booth. the \\\"phone\\\" sign above \r\nthe phone will say \\\"verbs\\\" instead of \\\"phone\\\". no one knows \r\nwhy. legends abound. anyways, head towards the 4-way stop \r\nand take the right side of the fork in the road. you will \r\npass over a small creek. just past the bridge make a hard \r\nleft into oncoming traffic. the first right. make it before \r\nthe cops smell ya. from now on its all gravy. head straight \r\ndown over the two humps in the road towards the tunnel. \r\nthrough the tunnel dont let the lights take your attention \r\naway from the road. they hired genious in this tunnel \r\nproject. halfway through the tunnel there is a hard right. \r\ngrand turismo3 style. just past the tunnel is a water \r\ntower. flanking the water tower are two roads. now you must \r\ndecide which road to take. ',2,0,0,0,'64.231.2.35','en'),(6810,1555,'2001-08-10 02:43:16',0,'me too','<p><a href=\\\"http://oxy.gen.nz/images/olivia/bald/\\\" \r\ntarget=\\\"_blank\\\"><img \r\nsrc=\\\"http://oxy.gen.nz/images/olivia/bald/o_wide_open.jpg\\\" \r\nwidth=\\\"441\\\" height=\\\"287\\\" alt=\\\"yeah\\\" border=\\\"1\\\"></a></p>',3,0,0,0,'210.8.201.242','en'),(6811,1556,'2001-08-10 03:00:54',0,'treetop','Boards on the window\r\nMail by the door\r\nWhat would anybody leave so quickly for?\r\nOphelia\r\nWhere have you gone?\r\n\r\n\r\nThe old neighborhood\r\nJust ain\\\'t the same\r\nNobody knows just what became of\r\nOphelia\r\nTell me, what went wrong\r\n\r\n\r\nWas it somethin\\\' that somebody said?\r\nMama, I know we broke the rules\r\nWas somebody up against the law?\r\nHoney, you know I\\\'d die for you\r\n\r\n\r\nAshes of laughter\r\nThe ghost is clear\r\nWhy do the best things always disappear\r\nLike Ophelia\r\nPlease darken my door\r\n\r\n\r\nWas it somethin\\\' that somebody said?\r\nHoney, you know we broke the rules\r\nWas somebody up against the law?\r\nHoney, you know I\\\'d die for you\r\n\r\n\r\nThey got your number\r\nScared and runnin\\\'\r\nBut I\\\'m still 