attles over\r\npanhandling territory before.',3,0,0,0,'64.229.68.109','en'),(6845,1561,'2001-08-10 12:12:46',0,'Jamazon','<b>Breaking News:</b><BR><BR>\r\nThe A406 and the M25 have moved in together despite \r\nattempts by the M25\\\'s mum to split them up. Church groups \r\nopposed to this gay relationship dismissed this latest move \r\nas un-natural and \\\'against god\\\'s will\\\'<br><br>\r\nA spokesperson for the A406 said<BR><BR>\r\n\\\"They\\\'re just fucking gay\\\"',4,0,0,0,'217.32.124.197','en'),(6846,1561,'2001-08-10 12:15:24',0,'Jamazon','I do know that it\\\'s best to avoid the A1(M) this evening \r\nsouth of Newcastle. There\\\'s a crash that\\\'s been going on \r\nfor several weeks and so far it\\\'s involved 9000 vehicles, \r\nso that\\\'s really deathsville. Good news for drivers however \r\non the M25 - workers have finished cobbling that, so that\\\'s \r\ngreat. The M6 in Liverpool is still at a standstill, that\\\'s \r\ndue to the mad cow hanging from a bridge. The M50 is \r\nclogged up again - that\\\'s not my fault - and the M11 is \r\nslow between junctions 5 and 6 due to some police escorting \r\nsome birds to the coast. That\\\'s about it really.\r\n',3,0,0,0,'217.32.124.197','en'),(6847,1560,'2001-08-10 12:50:58',0,'Jamazon','i\\\'m hungry',2,0,0,0,'217.32.124.197','en'),(6848,1561,'2001-08-10 12:54:59',0,'<b>Herr Doktor</b>','<br>\r\nInbound saloon cars on the A1(M) are subject to the newly \r\narranged One Time Saloon Car Tarriff of Â£10.  They are thus \r\nexempt from crashing, also, as their drivers are, without \r\ncompromise, strung out on junk.  The Royal Society for the \r\nUpkeep of Motorways has entered a co-innitiative with the \r\nMinistry of Urban Clearway Renewal to clean diesel residues \r\nfrom the roads and recycle them as fast-food \r\npreservatives.  Their efforts have just discovered that the \r\ncause of the aforementioned pile-up was a dingy pair of the \r\nQueen Mother\\\'s underpants.  Flown as a victory flag from a \r\nCruising Rig\\\'s antennae, they became unharnesed, from \r\nwhence they fell to the road surface, at which point they \r\nbecame ensnarred in the bendix aperature of a close-\r\nfollowing CitroÃ«n C5. Traffic has slowed to a creep on the \r\nM6, but that is probably merely due to the fact that \r\nLiverpoolers are a set of dense lackeys.  Rumors still \r\nabound.\r\n',1,0,0,0,'204.168.247.48','en'),(6849,1558,'2001-08-10 13:00:24',0,'Jamazon','Bling Bling baby. Bling Bling.',4,0,0,0,'217.32.124.197','en'),(6850,1560,'2002-03-08 04:52:11',66,'Peter','<br><tt><b>The Aftermath of Said Tamales:</b> I woke up at \r\n5:03am from the most terrible dream that my significant \r\nother had left me to tryst with my identical clone.  In the \r\ndream, she told me she had fallen in love with him because \r\nhe was so similar to me.  Soon after, I made an immediate \r\ndash for the bathroom, where irony struck- as I went about \r\nmy tamale-expunging, quiet salsa music drifted in from the \r\napartment below.</tt>',3,0,0,0,'204.168.247.48','en'),(6851,1558,'2001-08-10 13:02:54',0,'Jamazon','<img src=\\\"http://www.goldteeth.com/images/style-i-Lg.jpg\\\">',1,0,0,0,'217.32.124.197','en'),(6852,1564,'2001-08-10 13:06:35',0,'Herr Doktor','sperm dripping down cheek<br>\r\nlet me drink it til i sleep<br>\r\nlove dick, i\\\'m a ho<br>\r\n',1,0,0,0,'204.168.247.48','en'),(6853,1564,'2001-08-10 13:12:01',0,'Jamazon','That\\\'s a nice haiku<br>\r\nThough it has a rather lewd<br>\r\nPornographic theme.',4,0,0,0,'217.32.124.197','en'),(6854,1561,'2001-08-10 13:15:01',0,'Jamazon','Perhaps you meant Liverpudlians?',4,0,0,0,'217.32.124.197','en'),(6855,1563,'2001-08-10 13:18:05',0,'LURKERdaddy','you two girls: why don\\\'t u just write her directly with yer \r\nsuggestion instead of publicly telling her to bugger off? \r\nif that\\\'s not what u meant fine, but it appeared that way \r\ninstead of being just a friendly suggestion.',3,0,0,0,'207.8.101.10','en'),(6856,1563,'2001-08-10 13:24:1