f sniff. gie me sympathy \r\ndammit</tt>',1,0,0,0,'206.133.180.168','en'),(7315,1628,'2001-08-19 04:07:53',0,'bmg','nice',0,0,0,0,'66.68.76.248','en'),(7316,1623,'2001-08-19 04:13:45',0,'lou to maria','i have ALWAYS enjoyed going to bed bath & beyond.',5,0,0,0,'165.247.55.211','en'),(7317,1628,'2001-08-19 04:23:10',0,'Inu-Yasha','I don\\\'t see nothin',6,0,0,0,'24.27.26.62','en'),(7318,1624,'2004-07-09 19:12:25',72,'essemar','FuckNut!  give me a fucking call and tell me where you \r\nare.  Suddenly, i find myself having nothing better to do \r\ntonight then spend three hours on NJ \r\ntransit.<br><br>917.586.4483',5,0,0,0,'128.59.6.185','en'),(7319,1628,'2001-08-19 04:47:59',0,'colby','err\r\nHi.\r\n\r\n',6,0,0,0,'64.168.252.86','en'),(7320,1628,'2002-03-05 20:17:36',17,'austin to scott','<PRE>\r\nrobotec9: christ dude\r\nrobotec9: spent the entire day in a boat\r\nrobotec9: thinking a FUCKING SHARK\r\nrobotec9: was going to eat me\r\nrobotec9: HAHAHA\r\nrobotec9: save me\r\n</PRE>',4,0,0,0,'65.84.40.62','en'),(7321,1624,'2002-03-05 01:46:04',17,'austin','i cant think.<BR>\r\ni feel like rappin and s5 is NOT HERE.<BR>\r\ni am ready to cut a track and s5 NOT HERE.<BR>\r\ni set off an alarm and s5 is NOT HERE.<BR>\r\nhtml is so tedius.  somebody get rid of it.<BR>\r\n',5,0,0,0,'65.84.40.62','en'),(7322,1628,'2001-08-19 06:08:18',0,'bmg','this is the most thought provoking thing I have read all  \r\nmy life. cheers.',0,0,0,0,'66.68.76.248','en'),(7323,1623,'2001-08-19 06:19:09',0,'maria','you are a DEVIANT. ',6,0,0,0,'172.162.220.196','en'),(7324,1623,'2001-08-19 06:19:33',0,'maria','that last comment was to lou, of course. \r\n\r\n',6,0,0,0,'172.162.220.196','en'),(7325,1631,'2001-08-19 06:22:47',0,'maria','that dude is going to have to try a little harder to get me \r\nto send him a \\\"what up\\\".\r\n\r\n',6,0,0,0,'172.162.220.196','en'),(7326,1630,'2001-08-19 06:25:41',0,'maria','you know, call me jaded, but i would much rather receive a \r\nmix tape and some home made chocolate chip cookies from a \r\ncute boy than a flower. even if it *is* the gesture, it \r\njust seems so contrived and silly.\r\n\r\n<br>\r\nknow what i mean?\r\n\r\n',2,0,0,0,'172.162.220.196','en'),(7327,1630,'2002-10-18 20:39:20',75,'tyler','let\\\'s talk a little more about what the girls can do for \r\nthe guys. what kind of gesture have you ladies made for \r\nyour man lately?',1,0,0,0,'63.10.151.214','en'),(7328,1628,'2002-03-05 01:46:04',17,'austin','ok, the image thing is not working.  nobody panic.  i know \r\nwhat i am doing.  i\\\'ll fix it tomorrow.   or monday.',4,0,0,0,'216.175.91.21','en'),(7329,1630,'2002-03-05 01:46:04',17,'austin','i find polaroids in my clothes.<BR><BR>also emails in my \r\nbox.<BR><BR>depends on the girl.  some are great \r\nthough.<BR><BR>p.s. always stop to smell the roses.  \r\nsometimes they smell different.',4,0,0,0,'216.175.91.21','en'),(7330,1631,'2002-03-04 07:14:25',185,'orion','the old whole earth store in austin, back behind\r\ntexadelphia, had the most entertaining bathroom graphitti in\r\nthe little shitter under the stairway',3,0,0,0,'209.163.146.106','en'),(7331,1624,'2002-03-08 04:50:11',86,'egg','i just got home and its 330 AM. is it too late to get on \r\njersey transit',0,0,0,0,'64.152.167.26','en'),(7332,1623,'2001-08-19 07:36:20',0,'lou to maria','really, all comments are to me. it\\\'s just a \r\nsecret.<br><br><font size=1>also, am i a deviant because i \r\nwrite on my shoes...or do i write on my shoes because i am \r\na deviant? you\\\'ve brought me back to the questions posed to \r\nme in 1995 without even playing expose and mary j blige and \r\ntlc! props!</font>',6,0,0,0,'165.247.55.211','en'),(7333,1630,'2001-08-19 07:39:38',0,'lou','flowers are contrived, but can also be nice--especially if \r\nsaid flower is the type of flower that is appreciated, and \r\nnot just a lame old tired rose. i\\\'d be hit hard if someone--\r\nnot necessarily a boy, either, thank you!--handed me \r\nlavender because s/he noticed i wear lavender \r\nperfume.<br><br>and to austin: i want polaroids in my \r\nclothing. lucky.',6,0,0,0,'165.247.55.211','en'),(7334,1624,'2001-08-19 07:49:24',0,'maria','okay. how ANNOYING is it that new jersey transit only runs \r\ntill 1.35 AM on the weekdays? and 12/1 AM on the weekends?\r\n\r\n<br><BR>\r\nas my boy paul would say, they think that all commuters are \r\npart of the worker culture and only go out on the weekdays. \r\n<BR><BR>\r\ngrr. way to make me riled up.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n',4,0,0,0,'172.162.220.196','en'),(7335,1630,'2002-03-08 04:50:11',86,'egg','pick a rose from someone else\\\'s garden. it still smells as \r\nsweet',0,0,0,0,'64.152.167.26','en'),(7336,1630,'2001-08-19 08:10:18',0,'also:','flowers are dead genitals. i heard somewhere that giving a \r\ngirl cut flowers is a sign of impending death (possibly the \r\nfigurative \\\"death\\\" of her affection?). youth cut off in its \r\nprime and a',0,0,0,0,'64.152.167.26','en'),(7337,1631,'2001-08-19 08:12:00',0,'ashley','overheard at the Bend:\r\n\\\"these pomme frites aren\\\'t like JAYS\\\"',2,0,0,0,'216.175.91.21','en'),(7338,1630,'2001-08-19 14:55:15',0,'deb','see, but that\\\'s not exactly what i mean. some of those \r\ngirls could have bought roses too.  the real interesting \r\npart of the evening was hearing the negative remarks they \r\nmade towards each other.  it was incredible...',4,0,0,0,'64.12.103.29','en'),(7339,1630,'2001-08-19 16:19:33',0,'jo','i\\\'m also fond of: postcards, weird packages (once had an \r\nempty non-dairy creamer container mailed to me without \r\nexplanation), voicemail and answering machine messages \r\nwhere they just talk/ramble, anything hand-made, oh and \r\nneckkisses. i\\\'m mostly very fond of neckkisses.',1,0,0,0,'172.135.80.17','en'),(7340,1630,'2001-08-19 18:54:53',0,'maria','neckkisses are the best. \r\n\r\n<br><Br>\r\nhope you\\\'re taking notes, boys..',5,0,0,0,'205.188.200.202','en'),(7341,1630,'2001-08-19 20:46:31',0,'bmg','boys like neckkisses too, girls...',0,0,0,0,'66.68.76.248','en'),(7342,1630,'2001-08-19 22:32:14',0,'stella','I like to leave little love notes in my honey\\\'s wallet :)',0,0,0,0,'168.100.203.247','en'),(7343,1630,'2001-08-19 22:52:46',0,'deb','exactly. this is what i\\\'m talking about.  i used to leave \r\ncards around, etc. sometimes it\\\'s hard just to convice them \r\nto hold your hand...',2,0,0,0,'64.12.103.29','en'),(7344,1630,'2001-08-20 01:04:23',0,'bmg','how come girls don\\\'t ask guys out on dates?\r\n',0,0,0,0,'66.68.76.248','en'),(7345,1630,'2001-08-20 01:30:50',0,'dr. helmer','b/c women seem to dig their own steretypes. only women on \r\ntv ask guys out.',5,0,0,0,'24.27.26.62','en'),(7346,1630,'2002-03-08 04:50:26',86,'egg to bmg','um, ive been responsible for every single instance of me \r\ngetting the Luv. I am always the one doing the aksing. and \r\nIm a girl! Im a real girl! with boobies and everything!',0,0,0,0,'24.164.150.193','en'),(7347,1627,'2002-03-08 04:52:53',65,'le','is it really that color?',0,0,0,0,'216.15.97.21','en'),(7348,1630,'2001-08-20 02:36:14',0,'kat','<i>how come girls don\\\'t ask guys out on dates</i>\r\n\r\n<p>i am not in the mood for this kind of misconception. \r\ntake note: four out of five times it is ME asking the guy \r\nout. it is ME instigating any kind of connection. in fact i \r\nhave noticed guys do not even ask people out on dates \r\nanymore...they say things like: \\\'hey wanna come over and \r\nrent a movie?\\\' or: \\\'hey, im going to have dinner at blah \r\nblah thai place. wanna come?\\\'<p>\r\n\r\n<p>this is NOT a date! [deleted expletive]</p>\r\n\r\n<p>i am waiting for the man that has the courage to look me \r\nin the eye. for the one who wont hesitate to hold my hand. \r\nor ask me to dance. the guy who\\\'s willing to call and \r\nsay...\\\'let\\\'s escape\\\' even if it\\\'s only to spend an \r\nafternoon sitting in front of the Rothko at SFMOMA. someone \r\nwho says i have something to tell you...and, this is our \r\nsecret... and asks, what does this mean? a man that can \r\nlisten without pounding out advice and protocol. who \r\nrealizes that sometimes i just need a shoulder to cry \r\non.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>is that a lot to ask of a date?<br>\r\nmaybe. it\\\'s been so long since i felt like i\\\'ve had one \r\nthat the bank account is overdrawn.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>it would nice<br>\r\nto have a hot boy<br>\r\nwanting to show me his world.</p>',4,0,0,0,'32.102.64.146','en'),(7349,1630,'2001-08-20 02:48:06',0,'and ps','maybe i get no dates cause im ugly? i dont think i am. mmm, \r\ntoo intense? or just possibly a vortex of possibilities. i \r\nfeel so misunderstood.',4,0,0,0,'32.102.64.146','en'),(7350,1627,'2002-10-06 17:40:35',261,'sine','when I was 11 years old, I was dragged behind a horse. To \r\nmake a long story short, I hit a fencepost on my right side \r\nlike hitting a small sack of potatoes with a baseball bat. \r\nIt cracked my liver, nearly in half, cleaved it almost down \r\nto the portal vein. I shoulda been dead, really. Since you \r\ncan\\\'t really sew liver back together, they just kept me \r\ndrugged and sedated and not moving until it sealed itself \r\nup again. \r\n\r\nstill, if I drink too much, which is very rarely, it aches \r\nthe next day. be nice to your liver. it likes water.',1,0,0,0,'64.81.65.205','en'),(7351,1630,'2001-08-20 04:01:36',0,'bmg','yah there are times that girls ask guys out on dates. I \r\nhave been asked out three times, come to think.  I \r\nagree, kat, that it would be nice to have someone look \r\nme in the eye and tell ask me to go with them \r\nsomewhere, on a date. One of the dates I had, where I \r\nwas asked out, took me out to dinner. I noticed as we \r\ngot out of the car that she left her purse in the car. \r\nImmediately I realized that I would be the one paying for \r\nthe date, I felt cheated - I had agreed to be taken out \r\nand assumed it was her treat... I think this happened to \r\nmr swinney once too. Another date I had, she asked me \r\nwhere I wanted to go, again I felt cheated. I would like to \r\nhave a date, where I am not the one deciding the place \r\nor the venue. On a positive note, for valentines day a girl \r\nI was dating took me on a long drive out into the \r\ncountry. We stopped at a park and had a romantic \r\npicnic. This was all her idea, and I was swept away. I \r\nget wrapped up in trying not to live up to my male \r\nstereotype, and I am attracted to those that don\\\'t fit into \r\nthe roles that men and women are sometimes lodged \r\ninto.',0,0,0,0,'66.68.76.248','en'),(7352,1627,'2001-08-20 04:51:04',0,'liver','goddamn!  that sure is some sexy porn.\r\n<p>\r\n<b>sine:</b><br>\r\nthat\\\'s really tragic.  i feel your pain.  glad to hear it \r\nsealed up ok and you\\\'re still here.  yay drugs!\r\n<p>\r\n<b>colby:</b><br>\r\nTHAT\\\'S PROPRIETARY INFORMATION AND I\\\'M GONNA SUE YOUR \r\nMOTHERFUCKIN\\\' ASS!\r\n',4,0,0,0,'64.81.72.119','en'),(7353,1635,'2001-08-20 04:51:37',0,'dj1luna','BMG has been righteous as of late. He fancies himself a \r\nguru me thinks. I don\\\'t cave in. ha ha.',1,0,0,0,'24.27.26.62','en'),(7354,1635,'2001-08-20 04:53:24',0,'bmg','oh pah-leaze, hush juan... ',5,0,0,0,'66.68.76.248','en'),(7355,1635,'2001-08-20 05:01:18',0,'me','yah, juan stay out of this, this between Me and BMG.',0,0,0,0,'66.68.76.248','en'),(7356,1635,'2001-08-20 05:12:33',0,'jo','christopher, your haircut is sassy. let\\\'s go to spider \r\nhouse and pick you out a fine young lady on which to \r\npractice your smooth moves.',1,0,0,0,'172.150.35.199','en'),(7357,1635,'2001-08-20 05:14:06',0,'jo','(also, no more pictures of you yelling. you don\\\'t yell; you \r\nlaugh and inspire and tell fantastic stories. you\\\'re not \r\nfooling anyone!!)',1,0,0,0,'172.150.35.199','en'),(7358,1635,'2001-08-20 06:05:35',0,'benjamin','my initials are bmg.  and then i was glad it wasn\\\'t me.',4,0,0,0,'168.100.206.143','en'),(7359,1635,'2001-08-20 07:10:26',0,'ghost','romance=poetryinyourinbox',4,0,0,0,'32.102.64.124','en'),(7360,1630,'2002-10-03 18:45:24',70,'Fuzzy','Be <a href=\\\"http://www.hax0rs.com/jeff/alivisit/12.jpg\\\"\r\ntarget=\\\"new\\\">unorthodox</a>.<br><br>Surprises are good.',3,0,0,0,'64.229.65.227','en'),(7361,1630,'2001-08-20 13:23:52',0,'jo','i have definitely done the cheesy initiating romantic \r\novertures in most of my relationships. i was more speaking \r\nto the gestures that couples make, once together, to keep \r\nthings good. it\\\'s easy to win someone\\\'s heart once, that\\\'s \r\nno big feat. it\\\'s doing the little things all the time that \r\nremind them why they\\\'re still with you. that\\\'s where most \r\npeople fuck up.',1,0,0,0,'172.150.35.199','en'),(7362,1630,'2001-08-20 13:28:12',0,'jo to bmg','and HEY! i know boys like neckkisses. i give just as \r\nhappily as i receive.<BR>\r\nmmmm neckkisses.',1,0,0,0,'172.150.35.199','en'),(7363,1624,'2002-03-08 04:52:11',66,'Peter','<br><tt>i\'m home. hi. nj transit sucks and was 20 minutes \r\nlate last night coming back, leaving me sitting in the \r\nrain. yuck. what a wasted weekend. any of you in nyc are \r\nwelcome to come party with me soon to cheer me up, ha</tt>',1,0,0,0,'204.168.247.48','en'),(7364,1626,'2002-03-08 04:52:11',66,'Peter','<br><tt>oooh, green gets down n\\\' lyrical... you go, girl!\r\n</tt>',1,0,0,0,'204.168.247.48','en'),(7365,1627,'2002-03-08 04:52:11',66,'Peter','<br><tt>after getting edjumakated in biology, and spending \r\nthe past year doing liver research, i can\\\'t tell you how \r\ngrossed out i get when the southern members of my family \r\nindulge in eating fried chicken livers.  besides the actual \r\nidea of eating bacon-wrapped, fried by-product, i can\\\'t \r\nstand being able to identify the morphology of \r\ndinner... \\\"Oooh, look mom, the hepatic portal vein! the \r\nbile duct! ooh, just <i>look</i> at that ripe, golden \r\nmedulla! mmm, mmm, mmmmmm!\\\"<tt>',1,0,0,0,'204.168.247.48','en'),(7366,1630,'2002-03-08 04:52:11',66,'Peter','<br><tt>mmm. neck-kisses</tt>',1,0,0,0,'204.168.247.48','en'),(7367,1631,'2002-03-08 04:52:11',66,'Peter','<br><tt>Graffiti seen on the wall at The Vault, in Chelsea: \r\n<i>\"Shit on my face, <b>bitch!</b>\"</i>. I took a picture of it, for posterity.</tt>',1,0,0,0,'204.168.247.48','en'),(7368,1636,'2001-08-20 13:48:45',0,'hehe','gosh damn!',0,0,0,0,'66.68.76.248','en'),(7369,1634,'2002-03-08 04:52:11',66,'Peter','<br><tt>ok. not to digress, but a query for all: i haven\\\'t \r\nbeen sleeping well for the past week, an can think of no \r\ncause- stresses/work/relationships are business as usual, \r\nkind of... does anyone have some good advice to achieve \r\ndeeper sleep? just thought i\\\'d ask the holistically \r\ninclined of you...</tt>',1,0,0,0,'204.168.247.48','en'),(7370,1636,'2002-03-08 04:52:11',66,'Peter','<br><tt>Amen.</tt>',1,0,0,0,'204.168.247.48','en'),(7371,1635,'2001-08-20 13:57:15',0,'bmg','<p>jo: okay, okay, you are right - I don\\\'t yell, but \r\nsometimes I scream! Last night a raccoon ran right \r\nunder me, i jumped and screamed. It was frightening! \r\nSpider house is busy now, college kids are back. I am \r\ngame to go there any night, but not to trap the pretty \r\nspiders that lurk there! I will hang out with you, and we \r\nwill tell stories, and laugh and stuff... </p>\r\n<p>benjammin: i am proud to adopt your initials, i\\\'ll give \r\nem back to you when I am done.</p>\r\n<p>ghost: you sneaky little ghost! I look for you in my \r\nhouse, but I cannot see you. Do you wear a sheet, with \r\neyes cut out? I don\\\'t think that you are scarey, you don\\\'t \r\nfrighten me! Though your email made me shiver with \r\ndelight.</p>',0,0,0,0,'66.68.76.248','en'),(7372,1635,'2002-03-08 04:50:11',86,'egg','hubba hubba',0,0,0,0,'64.152.169.136','en'),(7373,1635,'2001-08-20 14:14:38',0,'bmg','to luna:<br>\r\nI offer you \"righteous\" comments because these things \r\nhelp me, battle myself. Little demons lurk everywhere it \r\nseems. I am defeated more times than i win. \r\nsometimes I find myself unable to break habits, such \r\nas lethargy, and i find myself in a world of pain; usually \r\ncaused by myself. I don\'t think of myself as a guru, far \r\nfrom it. i think of people like austin, kyrsten, and my \r\nfriend jebro as guru\'s because they are able to keep \r\ntheir minds clear of such demons and self inflicted \r\npain. i listen to them, when they speak about their lives \r\nand how they battle themselves, and it helps me in my \r\nown battles.  I cave in, almost all the time, to the advice of my friends.',0,0,0,0,'66.68.76.248','en'),(7374,1630,'2004-07-09 19:12:25',72,'essemar','Mmmmm.... lower back kisses..... but the absolute best: \r\ninside the bicep.  Dear lord....',0,0,0,0,'198.45.19.20','en'),(7375,1635,'2004-07-09 19:12:25',72,'essemar','No shit.... Hey, BMG, you wanna come to my place and yell \r\nin my face like a drill sergent to get me out of bed in the \r\nmorning?',0,0,0,0,'198.45.19.20','en'),(7376,1638,'2002-03-08 04:52:11',66,'Peter','<br><tt><i>Slick Poppa</i> is still confused, his \r\nsober exchanges shattering his drunken eloquence.  Your \r\nteenage debonaire emails: \\\"hey man, are you guys still in \r\ntown, and that girl, too? i bet the play sucked\\\", \\\"she \r\ndidn\\\'t really go to that allen ginsberg school in idaho. \r\nshit, i can\\\'t remember exactly what it was, some place where \r\nthey make you stay a virgin\\\"...</tt>',1,0,0,0,'209.246.83.224','en'),(7377,1635,'2002-03-08 04:52:11',66,'Peter to es','<br><tt>you mean that big-ass dog of yours doesn\\\'t do the \r\ntrick?</tt> ',2,0,0,0,'209.246.83.224','en'),(7378,1630,'2001-08-20 16:16:10',0,'Horny Doktor','Nein, behind the EAR on the neck kissies are best.',6,0,0,0,'209.246.83.224','en'),(7379,1634,'2002-09-09 00:01:42',195,'matt','exercise. and not before bedtime.\r\n',1,0,0,0,'209.208.5.120','en'),(7380,1635,'2001-08-20 19:11:07',0,'adamajah to bmg','cheese burger & 