 Steamed clams, opened up by the heat, their \r\nmeaty innards ready for swallowing up.  I noticed a pile of \r\nshells accumulating as the happy family bellied up to the \r\nsteamer pot, though, and felt bad.  I felt like I should do \r\nsomething with the shells, even though they smelled like \r\nthe sea and were a dirty shade of matte gray.  I grabbed a \r\nfew to toy with later.  Yesterday, I cleaned them off, and \r\nbegan etching their surfaces with my Dremmel tool.  The \r\nbeauty of what likes right under the encrusted surface is \r\nsurprising.  Golden, milky caramel layers of opalescent \r\nivory, sparkly irradescent seams, translucent surfaces, \r\nshiny smooth beauty.  $4 for a dozen steamers, including a \r\npriceless pile of shiny jewels and arty bits.</tt>',1,0,0,0,'204.168.247.48','en'),(7422,1643,'2002-03-08 04:52:11',66,'Peter','<br><tt>Go check your email, Mister Doktor</tt>',1,0,0,0,'204.168.247.48','en'),(7423,1644,'2001-08-21 15:01:51',0,'Doktor','It looks to me that she has large, succulent breasts.  why \r\nare you complaining? those hoops are worth jumping through.',1,0,0,0,'204.168.247.48','en'),(7424,1644,'2001-08-21 15:05:09',0,'Jamazon','r u looking at my girlfreinds boobs? u wanna fight mister?',6,0,0,0,'217.32.127.245','en'),(7425,1641,'2001-08-21 15:10:51',0,'Jamazon','heh I just looove those Dremmel Multi-Tool infomercials. \r\nInfomercials are my life. My current favourite is the Oxy \r\nClean one i watch M7 Liberty TV. \\\"Oxy Clean contains NO \r\nBLEACH - Oxy Clean is not harmful to the environment \r\nbecause it COMES from the environment!\\\"',3,0,0,0,'217.32.127.245','en'),(7426,1644,'2001-08-21 15:37:58',0,'UB Jesus','well, we are all looking buddy.',1,0,0,0,'207.8.101.10','en'),(7427,1640,'2002-03-05 01:46:04',17,'austin','<P>yes it is good enough cause.  especially because i will\r\nbe picking her up at the gate instead.</P>',3,0,0,0,'205.179.19.31','en'),(7428,1644,'2001-08-21 15:46:08',0,'Doktor','Yes, she is quite attrac