mall prop planes that \r\nservice rural airports, they do have absolute passenger + \r\nbaggage weight limits.  If they filled one of those planes \r\nwith two-seat asses squeezed into one seat, then it \r\nwouldn\\\'t have enough power to take off.',3,0,0,0,'198.45.19.20','en'),(7516,1642,'2002-09-05 18:42:54',18,'ix','yeah, it looks like my comment was censored.',0,0,0,0,'216.15.97.21','en'),(7517,1642,'2001-08-22 17:39:32',0,'jo','\\\"creative\\\" is debatable. i wouldn\\\'t publicly attack any \r\nwriting that i think the person spent more time, thought, \r\nor energy on than the time it took to type the words.',1,0,0,0,'216.141.109.62','en'),(7518,1642,'2004-07-09 19:12:25',72,'essemar','Ive been reading through all these comments, \r\nand....<br><br>I like this piece, especially the jokey \r\npilot.  And that whole wondering if the plane would be able \r\nto take off is something I would totally ponder.  In fact, \r\nI\\\'d prolly spend the rest of the flight figuring out force \r\nof lift and ratios between passenger mass vs. plane mass.',0,0,0,0,'198.45.19.20','en'),(7519,1642,'2001-08-22 18:14:06',0,'UB Jesus','fact: some people are sensitive. Would an editor approve \r\nthe post if it was about a minority instead of overweights \r\npeople?',6,0,0,0,'207.8.101.10','en'),(7520,1642,'2001-08-22 18:16:50',0,'jo','for the record: my comments had nothing to do with this \r\npost in particular but with posts, in general, on swinney \r\nthe last few months.',1,0,0,0,'216.141.109.62','en'),(7521,1649,'2001-08-22 19:16:40',0,'treetop','</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<font face=\\\"Tahoma\\\"></font>&nbsp;\r\n<br><font face=\\\"Tahoma\\\"><font color=\\\"#3333FF\\\">When you \r\nclear away all of\r\nthe underbrush</font></font>\r\n<br><font face=\\\"Tahoma\\\"><font color=\\\"#3333FF\\\">when you go \r\nback and back</font></font>\r\n<br><font face=\\\"Tahoma\\\"><font color=\\\"#3333FF\\\">not for the \r\nfun of it</font></font>\r\n<br><font face=\\\"Tahoma\\\"><font color=\\