r at takeoff than if it were \r\nfull of single-ass-sized folks and their bags. UH! double-\r\nup UH! UH!\r\n<p>\r\nMan, I\\\'m tired of being right.',1,0,0,0,'63.10.151.252','en'),(7538,1642,'2001-08-23 04:28:49',0,'kat','i am bursting with awesome fat sushi goodness right now. \r\npink godzilla addicts represent!',4,0,0,0,'32.102.109.177','en'),(7539,1642,'2001-08-23 04:33:14',0,'bmg','I especially like green tamatillo salsa on my tacos. \r\nsometimes i lace my tacos with green chiles and a \r\nslight accompanyment of tomatos and garlic cloves. I \r\neat them with urgency, because I like them when they \r\nare still hot. Sometimes I garnish them with spring leaf \r\nlettuce, it adds a bit of class to the taco. Usually I drink \r\nwater with the taco, mainly because in our household \r\nwe buy our water in 5 gallon bottles that cost more that \r\npetrol  - and there is the fact that I like to think that I am \r\nbeing healthy. I follow up my taco with a smoke on the \r\nfront porch. Most of the time I do this alone, but there \r\nare rare occasions that I have a friend over that would \r\nlike to have a tasty taco. I believe that a good taco is \r\nmade with love, therefore I don\\\'t go to taco bell for my \r\naddiction. A summer beer goes nicely with tacos, FYI.',5,0,0,0,'66.68.76.248','en'),(7540,1653,'2001-08-23 04:46:49',0,'ghost','well didya use it in yer mouth...or was it used somewhere \r\nelse???',4,0,0,0,'32.102.109.177','en'),(7541,1653,'2001-08-23 04:48:35',0,'bmg','because of your honesty and humility, I must make a \r\nconfession as well. For weeks I, unknowingly, used \r\naustin\\\'s Mach 3 razor. Once I realized this, I \r\nimmediately threw out the tainted razor and replaced it \r\nwithout his knowing. I admit this now, after three blood \r\ntests and a physical, because I am ashamed and \r\nhumbled by your honesty, Olivia. Thank you for sharing. \r\n(I won\\\'t be talking about the sheets at this point in our \r\ndiscussion.)',1,0,0,0,'66.68.76.24