,1686,'2001-08-31 16:39:46',0,'crowboy','<p>No, it\\\'s not really a crow-- it\\\'s some other bird, but \r\nthrough the magic of mistranslation the outside world calls \r\nus (if they call us at all) \\\"Crow.\\\"</p>\r\n<p>The long beaked bird referred to in the tribe\\\'s name for \r\nitself \\\"Absarokee\\\", is said to be some sort of waterbird \r\nwith a long beak-- thought to be extinct.</p>\r\n\r\n',3,0,0,0,'156.153.254.41','en'),(7928,1686,'2001-08-31 16:41:37',0,'crowboy','i hardly speak \\\"Absarokee\\\" (mostly just the swear words) \r\nbut it is true that the Crow and Hidatsa were once the same \r\ntribe. My father says he can understand Hidatsa (he is a \r\nCrow speaker)-- he likens it to a French speaker hearing \r\nanother Romance Language.',2,0,0,0,'156.153.254.41','en'),(7929,1693,'2001-08-31 19:46:49',0,'lou reed','ohh such words make me want to shoot Andy Warhol',1,0,0,0,'207.8.101.10','en'),(7930,1694,'2001-08-31 19:49:03',0,'artistiko','Doesn\\\'t everyone want to travel? who would say NO? mostly \r\ncost and work is what stops us.',4,0,0,0,'207.8.101.10','en'),(7931,1673,'2001-08-31 20:01:06',0,'joni','sheila e. covered it, too. i need to call my manager. or \r\nmaybe i won\\\'t.\r\n',1,0,0,0,'209.208.9.150','en'),(7932,1673,'2001-08-31 20:02:21',0,'joni','that was supposed to be a question: \\\"sheila e. covered it, \r\ntoo?\\\"\r\n',1,0,0,0,'209.208.9.150','en'),(7933,1673,'2001-08-31 20:24:54',0,'coyoboy','no, not sheila e., some other prince girl, scottish, sang \r\nthat one song about a morning train?',4,0,0,0,'156.153.254.41','en'),(7934,1673,'2001-08-31 20:56:49',0,'lisa','wendy?\r\n',0,0,0,0,'63.195.92.218','en'),(7935,1673,'2001-08-31 20:56:57',0,'wendy','yes, lisa?\r\n',0,0,0,0,'63.195.92.218','en'),(7936,1693,'2001-08-31 22:14:54',0,'gerard','oh shut up, lou or i\\\'ll <blink>WHIP</blink> you!\r\n',0,0,0,0,'63.195.92.218','en'),(7937,1689,'2001-08-31 22:26:25',0,'deb','\\\'i am not a pretty girl. that is not what i do..\\\' ;)\r\nsh