 with someone if i didn\\\'t \r\nwant to touch them or be close with them afterwards.\r\n\r\nwhat\\\'s the point?\r\nyou may as well masturbate.',0,0,0,0,'210.55.167.126','en'),(8043,1711,'2001-09-05 06:39:32',0,'etienne','you call that a short story?  its pulp, at best.',6,0,0,0,'210.55.167.126','en'),(8044,1710,'2002-03-08 04:50:26',86,'egg to mojo kat','it must have been all the hooters you saw. i saw a lot of \r\nhooters in vegas, and promptly thought of you. oh man, \r\nI never wanna see another hooter again.',0,0,0,0,'216.175.94.241','en'),(8045,1709,'2001-09-05 08:05:12',0,'whisper','yes?',0,0,0,0,'172.167.33.91','en'),(8046,1711,'2002-03-05 20:15:16',59,'s5','whether or not she\\\'s virtuous, the character is \r\nbelievable. sex and intimacy are not automatically \r\nlinked for everyone, and it sounds like there\\\'s a story \r\nhere. i want to hear more about her motivations.',3,0,0,0,'65.84.40.62','en'),(8047,1698,'2001-09-05 08:34:50',0,'resident','</head>\r\n<body>\r\n\r\n<center>hi\r\n<br><img \r\nSRC=\\\"http://members.aol.com/trentwall/images/window.jpg\\\" \r\nNOSAVE height=201 width=299></center>\r\n\r\n</body>\r\n</html>',0,0,0,0,'172.167.33.91','en'),(8048,1711,'2001-09-05 09:16:17',0,'Shane','I think that she deserves a happy ending or one that can be \r\nthought of as somewhat happy.  Intimacy is not for \r\neveryone, but I think her motives need to be told before I \r\nset my opinion in stone.',3,0,0,0,'210.221.103.234','en'),(8049,1711,'2001-09-05 10:33:06',0,'Joanna','I cut the whole story down by like 3000 words, and I think \r\nin that process the character lost a little of her \r\nmotivation and also a lot of her redeeming qualities (but \r\nmaybe she doesn\\\'t deserve redemption).  I\\\'ll post part 2 \r\nsometime. ',1,0,0,0,'203.97.2.242','en'),(8050,1711,'2001-09-05 12:23:07',0,'Doktor','oh of course, \\\'tis fiction. it fooled some of us, so it \r\nmust be good, ableit a bit fantastic that anyone would act \r\nas such. lets see the rest, or better yet, the uncut \r\nversion- everyoen prefers uncut versions of good things.',1,0,0,0,'204.168.247.48','en'),(8051,1712,'2002-03-08 04:52:11',66,'Peter','<br><tt>yes, yes, yes.  For some reason, this post made me \r\ngiddy this morning- I likes it alot. I always wondered what \r\nwas in the mind of my kitty. I started to understand after \r\nreading <a \r\nhref=\"http://www.mycathatesyou.com/\">this</a> link, which also made me want to change my name to <i>\"Lulu \'Jive-Turkey\' Jones\"</i>, but thats another story, completely.</tt>',1,0,0,0,'204.168.247.48','en'),(8052,1711,'2001-09-05 12:30:22',0,'*cough*','yeah, i definitely prefer uncut...\r\n',0,0,0,0,'210.54.102.50','en'),(8053,1711,'2001-09-05 12:33:49',0,'Vladimir','Yas, zat is vat all ze laydez zay about my uncut Vlad man-\r\nmeat.  Feast on my beef-dinner.',1,0,0,0,'204.168.247.48','en'),(8054,1694,'2001-09-05 12:59:35',0,'kini','<p>waking up on an old wooden boat, rolling over and seeing \r\na breathtaking sunrise, rolling the other way and seeing \r\nthe brilliant red cliffs of komodo.\r\n<br>not being able to wash for days on end, climbing a \r\nvolcano in the darkness, sitting on a crater lip and \r\nwatching the sun come up over the mountains.\r\n<br>swimming with humpback whales. exploring underwater \r\ncaves. sharing a bus with chickens and goats. forcing \r\nyourself to stay awake just so you can listen to a \r\nconversation in a language you don\\\'t understand.\r\n<p>that\\\'s what it\\\'s about.\r\n<p>hi, again.',1,0,0,0,'61.8.19.57','en'),(8055,1694,'2001-09-05 13:07:18',0,'Doktor','hi. waking up or not waking up. smoothing out wrinkles in \r\nmy pants with a hot iron. seeing the sunset, or not seeing \r\nit if i\\\'m asleep or there\\\'s too much smog. eating a \r\nsmoothie. stepping up to the edge and taking a breath of \r\nthe future, turning left and right and spinning until i\\\'m \r\ndizzy. eating fresh scallops. eating vegan cheese. drinking \r\nalot and sleeping or not sleeping.',1,0,0,0,'204.168.247.48','en'),(8056,1549,'2001-09-05 13:12:05',0,'Miss Manners','Now <i><b>THIS</i></b> is writing.',1,0,0,0,'204.168.247.48','en'),(8057,1713,'2001-09-05 14:23:48',0,'Jamazon','<br>\\\"No New York Times\\\" - Four syllables',1,0,0,0,'217.32.131.129','en'),(8058,1713,'2001-09-05 14:32:46',0,'\\\"anal retentive\\\"',' - five syllables.\r\n',1,0,0,0,'209.208.9.140','en'),(8059,1712,'2001-09-05 14:37:19',0,'Jamazon','This is one hell of a piece of creative writing. More please',1,0,0,0,'217.32.131.129','en'),(8060,1713,'2001-09-05 14:39:27',0,'Penile Dysfunction','- Five syllables',6,0,0,0,'217.32.131.129','en'),(8061,1712,'2001-09-05 14:45:17',0,'jo','peter, that is the best site in the history of time.',1,0,0,0,'216.141.109.62','en'),(8062,1712,'2002-03-08 04:52:11',66,'Peter to jo','<br><tt>yes!  there are a few cats in my life that i must \r\nadd, also- one <i>fat</i> black kitty that hates people, \r\nand one matted long-hair that stinks to high heaven and \r\nloves people.</tt>',1,0,0,0,'204.168.247.48','en'),(8063,1713,'2001-09-05 15:23:11',0,'tree top','Gleich um die Ecke',0,0,0,0,'172.167.33.91','en'),(8064,1713,'2001-09-05 15:26:39',0,'Doktor','Direkt um die Ecke von was, ScheiÃŸekopf?\r\n',1,0,0,0,'204.168.247.48','en'),(8065,1713,'2002-03-08 04:52:11',66,'Peter','<br><tt>WÃ¼rfel Ecke Gleich<br>\r\ndie MannschÃ¼sse auf seinen<br> \r\nziehen mir wurst ein.</tt> \r\n',1,0,0,0,'204.168.247.48','en'),(8066,1713,'2001-09-05 15:32:51',0,'Jamazon','Qu\\\'est directement autour du coin?',1,0,0,0,'217.32.131.129','en'),(8067,1713,'2001-09-05 15:33:54',0,'Jamazon to Peter','Cubes equal corner the man shots on its draw in me sausage?',1,0,0,0,'217.32.131.129','en'),(8068,1713,'2002-03-08 04:52:11',66,'Peter (p.s:)','<br><tt>ich denke nicht, daÃŸ viele Leute auf swiney.org \r\nDeutsch sprechen (oder Franzosen). ich denke, daÃŸ wir \r\nEnglisch vermutlich sprechen sollten, ja?</tt> ',1,0,0,0,'204.168.247.48','en'),(8069,1713,'2001-09-05 15:34:28'