 mo \r\nsukoshi duranki desu yo.',1,0,0,0,'203.97.2.242','en'),(8185,1723,'2001-09-07 15:32:58',0,'bmg','maybe cause she knows that you put those boobie \r\npictures of her on the net!',0,0,0,0,'66.68.76.248','en'),(8186,1723,'2001-09-07 15:47:10',0,'Jamazon','Yeah well she <a href=\\\"http://www.jamazon.co.uk/index.php?\r\narticle=30\\\">broke my camera</a>. She started it.',1,0,0,0,'217.32.133.115','en'),(8187,1723,'2003-03-07 17:56:26',69,'starlajo','she knows = rhinoceros',0,0,0,0,'210.55.126.18','en'),(8188,1722,'2001-09-07 15:52:34',0,'Jamazon','<p><tt>Humans come in two types with two types of \\\'engine\\\'. \r\nThose with an \\\'engine\\\' which can burn either type of fat \r\nand those whose \\\'engine\\\' is tuned to run at its most \r\nefficient on animal fat alone. How do you tell which type \r\nof \\\'engine\\\' your body has? If you have the former, you get \r\nan equal pleasure response when you eat either butter (an \r\nanimal fat) or margarine (a vegatable oil) and if you are \r\nthe later you prefer the taste of butter. There is an \r\nactual difference in physical response too. The former \r\nsalivate over the taste of either fat and the later only \r\nsalivate over the taste of animal fat. Because the latter \r\ntype run on animal fat and animals come in two types, \r\ndiurnal and nocturnal, this has led to all the weight \r\nproblems. People who have weight problems prefer the taste \r\nof animal fats and have been advised to eat the lower \r\ncaloried vegetable fats because they have put on weight \r\nwhen they ate the food they preferred. That was the wrong \r\nanswer! They two fall into two catagories, diurnal and \r\nnocturnal. To find out which, simply ask them when they \r\nwould prefer to go out for a special meal, lunchtime or in \r\nthe evening for dinner. Diurnals choose lunch and should \r\nnever eat after dark and nocturnals choose evening and \r\nshould only eat after dark. Were they to only eat the food \r\nthe like at those times of day, they have as perfect \r\na \\\'built-in\\\' weight control system as any of the former \r\ntype with the bodies tuned to run on either type of fat, \r\ni.e. thin people.</tt></p>',1,0,0,0,'217.32.133.115','en'),(8189,1723,'2001-09-07 15:56:47',0,'Jamazon','Rhinoceros?',4,0,0,0,'217.32.133.115','en'),(8190,1722,'2001-09-07 16:04:12',0,'suspicious','can we get sources for this information? every book or \r\narticle i\\\'ve ever read has advised against eating after 8 \r\nPM because there simply isn\\\'t enough physical activity to \r\nburn those calories. i find it hard to believe that this \r\nwas the wrong advice for half the population.',1,0,0,0,'216.141.109.62','en'),(8191,1722,'2001-09-07 16:17:20',0,'hmmm','\\\"People who have weight problems prefer the taste of animal \r\nfats and have been advised to eat the lower caloried \r\nvegetable fats because they have put on weight when they \r\nate the food they preferred.\\\" that is way too much of a \r\ngeneralization. i know plenty of overweight people who \r\ndislike the taste of animal fats and always have. i know \r\nplenty of skinny people who could gorge on steak all day \r\nlong. ',1,0,0,0,'216.141.109.62','en'),(8192,1728,'2002-03-08 04:50:11',86,'egg','why celery? it tastes like nothing but subtle bitterness. i \r\nbeg mama not to put it in his pasta sauce and he says, \r\n\\\"you wont even taste it.\\\" eh?! i have always hated celery. \r\nbut if you are going to bring kundera into it, I might try \r\nagain. ',0,0,0,0,'209.86.7.43','en'),(8193,1728,'2002-09-01 23:16:03',57,'weeb','you have to be kind to it. gently sipping of it\\\'s warm \r\nessence, staying away from the raw reality. come over, and \r\ni\\\'ll introduce the two of you. i\\\'m sure you\\\'ll be charmed \r\nout of your hotpants and into the soup!',1,0,0,0,'63.197.69.58','en'),(8194,1728,'2001-09-07 17:36:39',0,'sic','i guess it musta been hangin out wiht vegetarians all \r\nsummer but now im totally down with veggies...apples are \r\nlike candy...salads are the bomb...sometimes it scares me \r\nhow much i love em',0,0,0,0,'172.158.83.101','en'),(8195,1722,'2001-09-07 17:39:13',0,'oooo','<font face=\\\"Verdana\\\">child<br>\r\n  things are gonna get easier<br>\r\n  oooo child<br>\r\n  things\\\'ll get brighter</font><br>',0,0,0,0,'216.201.202.217','en'),(8196,1728,'2004-08-24 18:01:43',83,'adamajah','this reminds me of my friend natasha\\\'s dad, tom.  before he \r\nretired to his mountainside in ecuador, he lived in the \r\ngood township of south pasadena.  when i would visit he \r\nwould be doing one of four things: 1)juicing 2)composting 3)\r\nrolfing 4)<i>making celery soup</i>.  he said that celery \r\nis high in salt and that it provides all the salt necesary \r\nfor a good soup.  i tasted it.  it was bland and watery, \r\nbut healthy, i\\\'m sure.  i said \\\"mmm, good.\\\"',2,0,0,0,'64.120.104.101','en'),(8197,1722,'2001-09-07 18:02:26',0,'adam','o/`  one day, we\\\'ll walk in the rays of the beautiful su-\r\nun, one day, when the world is bri-ighter o/`',1,0,0,0,'64.120.104.101','en'),(8198,1726,'2001-09-07 18:30:48',0,'jo','\\\"I find Peppermint Schnapps at the bar, which is \r\npractically the same thing as mouthwash.\\\"<BR>\r\nthat is <b>such</b> a nice line.',1,0,0,0,'216.141.109.62','en'),(8199,1716,'2001-09-07 18:31:06',0,'keuch2','just forget about it; drag it to the trash can.',1,0,0,0,'129.130.29.89','en'),(8200,1716,'2001-09-07 18:39:08',0,'bmg','i\\\'ve been using a mac for the past year, and it took me a \r\nwhile to realize how to ctrl-z mac style... now I have a pc \r\nlaptop, and i cant figure out how to ctrl-z on a pc... even \r\ntho it is written right there on the keyboard.\r\n',0,0,0,0,'66.68.76.248','en'),(8201,1728,'2001-09-07 20:12:07',0,'jo','...<BR>\r\nwhat\\\'s rolfing?',1,0,0,0,'216.141.109.62','en'),(8202,1728,'2001-09-07 20:21:00',0,'kat','<p><a href=\\\"http://www.rolf.org/about/\\\" \r\ntarget=\\\"_blank\\\">about rolfing...</a></p>',1,0,0,0,'32.100.69.