oose to spread the Love Contagious.  ',3,0,0,0,'66.68.76.248','en'),(8463,1754,'2001-09-14 06:19:44',0,'Mohandas Karamchand Gandhi','</head>\r\n<body>\r\n<font color=\\\"#3333FF\\\"></font>&nbsp;\r\n<br><font color=\\\"#3333FF\\\">\\\"When I despair, I remember that \r\nall through\r\nhistory, the way of truth and love has always won. There \r\nhave been murderers\r\nand tyrants, and for a time they can seem invincible. But \r\nin the end they\r\nalways fall. Think of it, \r\nalways.\\\"&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; (1869-1948)</font>\r\n<br><font color=\\\"#3333FF\\\"></font>&nbsp;\r\n<br><font color=\\\"#CCFFFF\\\"></font>&nbsp;\r\n</body>\r\n</html>',0,0,0,0,'172.147.67.186','en'),(8464,1754,'2001-09-14 06:26:10',0,'hope','*smiles*',1,0,0,0,'66.68.76.248','en'),(8465,1754,'2001-09-14 08:24:51',0,'paul kantner and david crosby','if you smile at me, i will understand, \\\'cause that\\\'s \r\nsomething everybody everywhere does in the same language:)\r\n',1,0,0,0,'209.208.77.169','en'),(8466,1755,'2001-09-14 11:38:17',0,'Gavin Cruickshank','by the way, i just heard about what happened in america. \r\nyou poor americans! we are so sympathetic and sorry for you \r\nover here!',1,0,0,0,'204.168.247.48','en'),(8467,1755,'2001-09-14 11:43:43',0,'...','did you miss the numerous posts about it right here on this \r\nsite?',1,0,0,0,'216.141.109.62','en'),(8468,1755,'2001-09-14 12:04:22',0,'Jamazon','Well i guess that\\\'s the life of a Finnish Lumberjack, cut \r\noff from the outside world.',1,0,0,0,'217.32.146.208','en'),(8469,1753,'2001-09-14 12:07:33',0,'Jamazon','<p>\r\n<font size=\\\"+3\\\" face=\\\"arial\\\" color=\\\"#FF0000\\\">\r\nRub his belly<br>\r\nSee him smile<br>\r\nMake him happy<br>\r\nFor a while\r\n</font>\r\n</p>',1,0,0,0,'217.32.146.208','en'),(8470,1755,'2001-09-14 12:21:31',0,'Gavin','yes, i dont have internet out in the field!',1,0,0,0,'204.168.247.48','en'),(8471,1756,'2002-03-08 04:52:11',66,'Peter','<br><tt><i>\"Rock it over London, Rock it over 