 he reset the bone.  \r\nI also remember those words today as I think about what our \r\ncountry has gone through.',0,0,0,0,'172.157.185.134','en'),(8524,1753,'2001-09-16 00:05:34',0,'Beck','</head>\r\n<body>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<p>I\\\'ll be your chauffeur on a midnight drive\r\n<br>It takes a miracle just to survive\r\n<p>Buried animals call you name\r\n<br>You keep on sleeping through the poignant rain\r\n<p>I think were going crazy\r\n<br>her left eye is lazy\r\n<br>she looks so Israeli\r\n<br>nicotine and gravy\r\n<p>I\\\'ll feed you fruit that don\\\'t exist\r\n<br>I\\\'ll leave graffiti where you\\\'ve never been kissed\r\n<p>I\\\'ll do you laundry\r\n<br>massage you soul\r\n<br>I\\\'ll turn you over to the highway patrole\r\n<p>I think were going crazy\r\n<br>her left eye is lazy\r\n</body>\r\n</html>',0,0,0,0,'172.157.185.134','en'),(8525,1742,'2001-09-16 02:06:44',0,'treetop to loenard','<a href=\\\"http://www.idiom.com/~kalin/thumbs1.html\\\">Here is \r\nsome more wacky\r\nstuff</a>',0,0,0,0,'172.135.53.85','en'),(8526,1742,'2002-09-09 00:01:42',195,'matt','boy, i told you youze on drugs. ain\\\'t no denyin\\\' it now.\r\n',1,0,0,0,'209.208.9.253','en'),(8527,1761,'2002-09-09 00:01:42',195,'matt','i think the only electronic music i\\\'ve ever heard is brian \r\neno, if that qualifies. where is a good place to start?  is \r\nolder stuff like neu and can any good?  then again, i listen \r\nto \\\"dots and loops\\\" over and over, but that strikes me as \r\nkind of jazz.  it\\\'s got a jazz spirit to me, for some \r\nreason.<BR><BR>i\\\'ve done half a tablet of ecstasy in my \r\nlife. if i start now, at the tender age of 31, rolling and \r\nspending all night dancing, do you think that would be a \r\ngood thing or a bad thing?  i\\\'m already a little crazy in my \r\nheart, if you haven\\\'t noticed. do you think trying to \r\nreprogram myself like this would be therapeutic?\r\n',1,0,0,0,'209.208.9.253','en'),(8528,1763,'2001-09-16 04:07:16',0,'jake t.','Forget him. He is <I><B>SOOOOO</B></I> yesterday. Come to \r\nwhere the flavor is. I\\\'ll rub your head and feed you \r\nlollipops.\r\n',1,0,0,0,'209.208.9.253','en'),(8529,1763,'2001-09-16 05:30:58',0,'thought','If you look back and read what you have written in the \r\npast...and then read it again, you might notice that you \r\nare misdirecting a lot of life\\\'s frustrations towards this \r\nperson you call your lover. Yes, life is tough and we all \r\nhope that those close to us can help or hold us or pick up \r\nthe slack....but ultimately they are not there for this. Is \r\nlove not about WHO that person is? Or should we expect this \r\nto always include only WHAT they do for us? They too \r\nstruggle, and can give only so much. <i>If you don\\\'t \r\nremember to refill the glass after drinking, it will \r\neventually be empty.</i>',4,0,0,0,'32.102.64.197','en'),(8530,1761,'2001-09-16 05:43:27',0,'ghost to matt','your comments made me laugh. a knowing laugh. i never \r\nreally did drugs till i turned thirty. and then not very  \r\nmuch. i just wanted to experiment a bit. i found that on \r\noccasion it\\\'s enjoyable, but really i don\\\'t need it. in \r\nfact my level of substance consumption has decreased to \r\nalmost nothing. the older i get the happier i am...even \r\nwhen i am unhappy. and the older i get the more open i am \r\nto bizarre thoughts and spontaneous actions [no synthetic \r\ncatalyst necessary at all].',4,0,0,0,'32.102.64.197','en'),(8531,1753,'2001-09-16 05:45:58',0,'ghost to Beck','hi!  :]',1,0,0,0,'32.102.64.197','en'),(8532,1762,'2001-09-16 06:53:24',0,'jerry falwell','\"I really believe that the pagans, and the abortionists, \r\nand the feminists, and the gays and the lesbians who \r\nare actively trying to make that an alternative lifestyle, \r\nthe ACLU, People For the American Way, all of them \r\nwho have tried to secularize America. I point the finger \r\nin their face and say you helped this happen.\"',0,0,0,0,'66.68.76.248','en'),(8533