','en'),(8661,1761,'2001-09-18 08:47:11',0,'ebay...','hey dirty...baby i got your money!',4,0,0,0,'32.102.109.220','en'),(8662,1761,'2001-09-18 08:50:13',0,'kat','i do not have this long green that you speak of. or rather \r\nlet us say that i do, only that after much wailing and \r\ndebating i have decided to spend it elsewhere. [can i talk \r\nhim into going to Toronto?]',4,0,0,0,'32.102.109.220','en'),(8663,1773,'2002-03-08 04:52:11',66,'Peter to s5','<br><tt>s5, i thought of you this morning; I was on my way \r\nto work, waiting for the cross-town bus.  The m5 bus, which \r\nruns to lower manhattan (i,e: wtc ground-zero) has had to \r\nbe <i>slightly</i> re-routed.  when bus services are \r\ntemporarily changed, they replace the \\\'m\\\' (\\\'m\\\'anhattan bus) \r\nwith an \\\'s\\\' for \\\'s\\\'pecial service.  ergo, the m5 is now the \r\n<b>s5</b> bus. so, according to the mta, you now offically \r\nrun from west end avenue/72nd street to greenwich \r\nvillage/houston street, and are a <i>special bus</i>.</tt> ',1,0,0,0,'204.168.247.48','en'),(8664,1766,'2001-09-18 12:14:29',0,'Jamie','Do you want me to want it to be?',1,0,0,0,'217.32.148.85','en'),(8665,1773,'2001-09-18 12:15:58',0,'Jamie','I wish i was you Gavin.',1,0,0,0,'217.32.148.85','en'),(8666,1773,'2001-09-18 12:17:52',0,'Jamie','Haa! i call my girlfriend <i><b>Special Bus</b></i> when \r\nshe says something stupid.',1,0,0,0,'217.32.148.85','en'),(8667,1773,'2001-09-18 12:41:02',0,'Corky','some <i>special</i> busses are for mentally disadvantaged \r\nfolks. s5 is <i>not</i> mentally disabled, as far as i can \r\ntell, and i dont think thats the kind of bus peter was \r\nreferring to anyway...',1,0,0,0,'204.168.247.48','en'),(8668,1773,'2001-09-18 12:42:01',0,'Gavin Cruickshank','Jamazon: I thought your Girl was a regular Space-Case, a \r\nditz, a dummie? (best friendly)',1,0,0,0,'204.168.247.48','en'),(8669,1766,'2004-07-27 05:00:32',578,'NetfÃ¶ng!','yes, jamie- lets discuss this via email, <i>mmmkay