 from\r\nschool knows a girl who dated my cousin in grade\r\nnine.<br><br>Whackiness.<br><br>You want one of these Bjork\r\ntickets?  Email <a\r\nhref=\\\"mailto:jfilip@idirect.ca?subject=Bjork Tix\\\">me</a>\r\nabout it.',1,0,0,0,'64.229.90.24','en'),(8700,1770,'2001-09-18 18:49:56',0,'you','can still be friends',1,0,0,0,'64.132.148.219','en'),(8701,1761,'2004-07-27 05:00:32',578,'NetfÃ¶ng!  to Fuzz','Small world, yea it is!  Yea, i got lucky finding my flat. \r\nMy dad got it for me; otherwise, i dont think i\\\'d be able to\r\nswing it. ok, ok, so i\\\'m a daddy\\\'s girl. small world yet\r\nagain- i\\\'m at your coffee place <i>quite</i> often as a\r\ngirlfriend of mine lives just around the way from there!!\r\ni\\\'ve probably seen you before and didn\\\'t know it. i should\r\nemail you my pic and see if i look familiar :)  so anyway,\r\nwe should hookup sometime or something, and uh, talk about\r\nswinney orthe weather or bjork or whatever...',1,0,0,0,'66.65.50.255','en'),(8702,1770,'2002-03-08 04:50:26',86,'egg to theresa','i like art.',0,0,0,0,'66.47.229.243','en'),(8703,1761,'2002-10-03 18:45:24',70,'Fuzzy','Well, I just recently began working there, but you never\r\nknow.  <i>Quite</i> often is still quite often, right?  Yes,\r\nyou should and yes, we should.  Working in a coffee shop is\r\ncool because you can go in at any time you like and get free\r\ndrinks and food for half price.',1,0,0,0,'64.229.90.24','en'),(8704,1761,'2002-10-03 18:45:24',70,'Fuzzy','And more towards the discussion regarding magazines and\r\nmusic discs attached with them.  The Kenny Ken mix CD in the\r\nnew issue of <a href=\\\"http://www.knowledgemag.co.uk/\\\"\r\ntarget=\\\"new\\\">Knowledge</a> (listening to said disc at the\r\nmoment) is really good, although I hate when DJ mixes aren\\\'t\r\nsplit up w/ track markers on CDs (grumble).  Like, what\\\'s\r\nwith the second discs on the Fullcycle <i>Through The\r\nEyes</i> albums?<br><br>double-you tee eff.',3,0,0,0,'64.229.90.24