er scent still lingering slightly.  When I\\\'m \r\nwith her, everything is so fucking great, but she doesn\\\'t \r\nhave much time for me.  We talk on the phone a lot, but I \r\njust end up feeling empty afterwards.  Honestly, she makes \r\nme depressed more often than happy just because she has \r\nsuch little time to spend with me.  It\\\'s frustrating as \r\nhell.</p><p>disclaimer: The picture Peter is going to post \r\nwas taken while I was incredibly stoned.  <i>I am one sexy \r\nmotherfucker - shakin\\\' my ass.</i></p>',3,0,0,0,'198.45.19.20','en'),(9218,1840,'2002-03-08 04:50:11',86,'egg','ill tell you about high school boys. its in, and then its \r\nout. but i guess its right back up after a few minutes. so \r\ncheers.',0,0,0,0,'66.32.60.152','en'),(9219,1828,'2001-09-26 21:21:29',0,'critic to jo','Lets see you write something & I will consider the valitidy \r\nof your statement.',0,0,0,0,'172.149.212.102','en'),(9220,1828,'2001-09-26 21:25:20',0,'editor','validity\r\n',0,0,0,0,'63.195.92.218','en'),(9221,1828,'2001-09-26 21:33:03',0,'your missing the point','that Camilla did not post this article...',0,0,0,0,'172.149.212.102','en'),(9222,1828,'2001-09-26 21:34:58',0,'critic','the validity',0,0,0,0,'172.149.212.102','en'),(9223,1840,'2001-09-26 21:54:50',0,'bmg','<p>she said <em>deap dicking</em> HAHAHA!...<br>\r\nsorry, i\\\'m still 17</p>',0,0,0,0,'66.68.76.248','en'),(9224,1840,'2001-09-26 23:28:15',0,'mr webster','i love the word \\\'peevish\\\'',4,0,0,0,'156.153.254.41','en'),(9225,1840,'2001-09-26 23:29:26',0,'joseph smith','like we always say in salt lake \\\"bring \\\'em young, and \r\nbring \\\'em often!!\\\"',5,0,0,0,'156.153.254.41','en'),(9226,1828,'2002-03-05 01:46:04',17,'austin','i really wanted camilla to have posted this.\r\n<BR><BR>\r\n*sigh*',4,0,0,0,'205.179.19.31','en'),(9227,1828,'2001-09-27 00:16:22',0,'jo','let\\\'s see you use punctuation and spelling correctly and \r\nnot hide behind a pseudonym and i <b>still</b> won\\\'t feel \r