ted (but hoping somebody could make sense out of \r\nit).  dreamt i was living back in the house i grew up in.  \r\nthe front door had a window about 10in. squared.  in the \r\nmiddle of the night i was awake and got up to look out the \r\nwindow in the door.  turned to my right, looked down the \r\nstreet - all quiet and dark just like i remembered it to \r\nbe.  turned left to look at what is usually a very busy \r\nstreet to find no cars, no noise and also no light from \r\nstreetlights.  from out of nowhere a beam of light shoots \r\nthrough the dark from somewhere across the street.  not \r\nlike a spotlight but a small powerful light that hits me \r\nsquare between the eyes and instantly i\\\'m scared to death \r\nand i end up stumbling backwards and fall down in the \r\nliving room.  this dream repeated itself almost 20 times \r\nwith me waking up each time almost paralyzed with fear.  i \r\nhave had nightmares every night since i was a child and \r\nwhile almost all of them are very graphic and visual the \r\nfear this dream produced vs. the others was something \r\nentirely different.  what did i eat last night?',1,0,0,0,'24.181.44.135','en'),(9435,1859,'2001-09-29 19:23:19',0,'the year 1994','i didn\\\'t know it was still my year. you are still talking \r\nabout gourmet coffee!? zoinks. maybe we can talk about the \r\ncoming CD-ROM boom next.',0,0,0,0,'216.103.215.241','en'),(9436,1848,'2001-09-29 21:35:38',0,'elton','yeah, george let\\\'s just get some hot glory hole action down \r\nat that adult video shop and get some pnp and some poppers. \r\n\r\nknock three times and sing \\\"Careless Whisper\\\" that will be \r\nour signal.',4,0,0,0,'12.81.85.84','en'),(9437,1861,'2002-03-08 04:52:53',65,'le','<p>\r\ndoes no one edit for content anymore?\r\n</p>\r\n<p>hi tyler.</p>',0,0,0,0,'216.15.97.21','en'),(9438,1861,'2001-09-29 23:30:42',0,'Tom Cruise','Respect the Cock!',6,0,0,0,'208.58.87.82','en'),(9439,1861,'2002-10-18 20:39:20',75,'tyler','content is in th