,0,'63.195.92.218','en'),(9606,1871,'2001-10-02 19:52:52',0,'Alan','this is a question i have battled for many years. to pay the bills, i develop video games.  it has always been more of a passion than a job.  however, it is a VERY time consuming undertaking.  sixty hour weeks are considered downtime and crunch can be 100 plus hours a week for three or more months at a time.\r\n\r\npersonally, i have not found the answer.  for the first ten years of my career i simply didnt ask the question.  i just did it.  everything else could be sacrificed the might god of the game.  now though, i question it more.  how long can i keep going at this pace.  however, the goals are getting more challenging not less.\r\n\r\nman, i dont know why i am writing this.  i have no answers.  right now, i have no real choice but to keep grinding it out.  i have the plus that it is at least cool work and for the most part i get to play creative visionary.  but i hope a different answer avails itself soon.',2,0,0,0,'198.211.32.155','en'),(9607,1871,'2001-10-02 20:51:30',0,'ghost','sometimes you just have to let go. are the things that we have really necessary? i would be happy to live in a treehouse on a farm. to grow my own food. write stories. wash clothes in the river. ...as long as i had someone to be with. sharing is the best part.',4,0,0,0,'32.102.109.82','en'),(9608,1869,'2002-03-05 20:15:16',59,'s5','filtering, much like friendship, is optional. personally i filter no one, but i prefer to have the option.',3,0,0,0,'65.84.40.62','en'),(9609,1872,'2001-10-02 22:46:56',0,'jo','OH MY GOD. I WANT HER! I WANT HER!<BR>\r\n(i\\\'m in austin. BUT OH MY GOD i want her!)',0,0,0,0,'216.141.109.62','en'),(9610,1872,'2001-10-02 23:17:25',0,'bmg','nice finger nails.',0,0,0,0,'66.68.76.248','en'),(9611,1872,'2002-03-08 04:50:11',86,'egg','this is an assault on my rationality. damn you mang.',0,0,0,0,'216.175.90.172','en'),(9612,1872,'2001-10-02 23:51:56',0,'colby','I guess fedex is out of the question...',4,0,0,0,'128.32.92.243','en'),(9613,1872,'2001-10-02 23:55:35',0,'colby','All Pets Hospital claims that she is 4-6 weeks old and in good health.  Shots are scheduled one month from now.  I think that I will keep her until at least that time.',5,0,0,0,'128.32.92.243','en'),(9614,1872,'2001-10-03 00:20:02',0,'colby','Oh yeah, I\\\'m naming her Air Raid.  While sitting in the vet\\\'s office filling out their forms, the air raid sirens were being tested, and she was mewling and it just fit when I got to the Pet\\\'s Name field.',1,0,0,0,'128.32.92.243','en'),(9615,1872,'2002-03-08 04:52:53',65,'le','colby is attached!',0,0,0,0,'66.123.206.136','en'),(9616,1872,'2001-10-03 01:11:30',0,'leonard','<p>first i was like, \"this lady\'s got some hairy knuckles.\" then i saw the shaved head and i knew right then and there that she was german.',4,0,0,0,'64.210.3.222','en'),(9617,1870,'2001-10-03 01:20:19',0,'deb','can i really go to? please? i\\\'m a girl/woman. i work hard. i can donate to the cause. but be nice, or i will learn to use the gun...',2,0,0,0,'205.188.193.167','en'),(9618,1872,'2001-10-03 01:26:50',0,'deb','I would take her but a) i dunno where you are; b) my dad already wants to feed the cats to the people at the chinese restaurant up town; c) see b: he can\\\'t wait till i move back out and take my cats with me again...',3,0,0,0,'205.188.193.167','en'),(9619,1876,'2001-10-03 01:29:49',0,'deb','god damn. i have $150, a microwave, and pay all my bills on time. your room is cheap. where are you? hah. i\\\'m appx 65% serious. percentages could rise depending on location. heheh',2,0,0,0,'205.188.193.167','en'),(9620,1869,'2001-10-03 01:36:50',0,'deb','hmm i\\\'m thinking i can not really tell the difference between the blue and purple, and it only bothers me cause now i have to think about what i\\\'ve read the day before ;)  actually the design is really nice :)',1,0,0,0,'205.188.193.167','en'),(9621,1876,'2001-10-03 02:22:46',0,'bmg','<p>austin, texas. YEEEEHAAA!</p>',0,0,0,0,'66.68.76.248','en'),(9622,1870,'2002-06-27 20:39:15',240,'xep','i\\\'ve been thinking about getting a chicken.  i sometimes really miss eating eggs.  a chicken in sf is pretty unrealistic though.  maybe a chicken in melbourne.  maybe.',0,0,0,0,'209.228.7.6','en'),(9623,1870,'2002-10-18 20:39:20',75,'tyler','yeah, you can come.',1,0,0,0,'63.10.152.78','en'),(9624,1876,'2001-10-03 02:39:23',0,'the one and only good GOD','<a href=\\\"http://www.webcom.com/~pinknoiz/coldwar/microwave.html\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">evil\r\nmachines</a>',1,0,0,0,'32.102.109.58','en'),(9625,1870,'2002-03-08 04:52:11',66,'Peter','<br><tt>someone was raising chickens in the pseudo-empty lot across the street from my place here in nyc... we figured they were doing it for the eggs and such; that is, until we started hearing roosters crow each morning, then <i>lots</i> of roosters. then lots of activity every weekend when they fought said roosters. damn. watching the cops break that scene was one of the most visceral events the upper west side has seen in a while.</tt>',1,0,0,0,'66.65.50.255','en'),(9626,1876,'2001-10-03 02:43:15',0,'the former (evil) roommate','eating supper, I nearly choked on my sacrificial goat when I read the part about seeing my money go bye-bye - not to an idol-licker like that.  love to the bmg, k-d.',1,0,0,0,'207.218.235.242','en'),(9627,633,'2002-03-08 04:52:11',66,'Peter','<br><tt>dark backgrounds are man/boy-ish. Hmm. recent swinney update; note dark title area background. Welcome to swinney.org, the man-page, the place where boys and masculinity writhe!</tt>',1,0,0,0,'66.65.50.255','en'),(9628,1870,'2002-03-08 04:52:53',65,'le','actually, i bet a chicken could live in your backyard ok. if it didn\\\'t get eaten by racoons.',0,0,0,0,'216.27.183.161','en'),(9629,1869,'2001-10-03 03:29:04',0,'jim to jo','the mere thought of you wanting to do a little dance makes me really happy.',6,0,0,0,'66.92.4.146','en'),(9630,1869,'2001-10-03 03:31:28',0,'jim to 