 sure.',6,0,0,0,'66.92.4.146','en'),(9637,1876,'2001-10-03 04:14:59',0,'sean','<p>bmg scores checkmate. the MICROWAVE <em>is</em> a radio for dialogue with the LORD, Ark of the Covenant for the electronic age. Glad your ex-potential-housemate is reinforcing texas and redneck stereotypes for the amusement of all.</p>',1,0,0,0,'158.252.208.181','en'),(9638,1876,'2001-10-03 04:46:52',0,'the Dude','YOU didn,t answer my questions though.questions in my last reply to you.i am very careful with my words.and i always respond to everything said to me with respect incase it should be important to the one from whom it came .i walk in the truth i speak.and i demand that those who have anything to share with me do also or at least respect that.',0,0,0,0,'66.68.76.248','en'),(9639,1876,'2001-10-03 04:48:49',0,'bmg','My previous roommateâ€™s religious affiliation has nothing to do with the room for rent. It is obvious to me that you are not interested in the room, rather starting a conversation. I am not religious, though I was born within a Christian denomination. I honor all religions, and consider myself a spiritual person. Rather than go into the your assumption that meditation is considered â€œsycic,â€ or â€œvodooâ€ or any other variant, I will just stop here and say that the room is not available to you for rent. I am sorry, and I hope you find what you are looking for. May Peace find you \r\n \r\n',0,0,0,0,'66.68.76.248','en'),(9640,1876,'2001-10-03 05:54:57',0,'satan','don\\\'t go all bugshit on me now...',2,0,0,0,'12.81.83.133','en'),(9641,1735,'2002-06-12 21:13:52',93,'chiamattt','i rave to rave music. ',6,0,0,0,'24.43.182.49','en'),(9642,1870,'2004-07-27 05:13:48',63,'o','fuck you, everyone knows that pirates fight only with cutlasses and cannons.  DON\\\'T TRY AND KILL MY DREAM, FUCK KNUCKLE.',0,0,0,0,'65.84.40.62','en'),(9643,1868,'2001-10-03 06:44:47',0,'doom','yeah, also looks like he\\\'s into lbfm\\\'s, if you know what i mean...\r\n<h1>LITTLE BROWN FURRY MONKEY