ad before.',0,0,0,0,'216.141.109.62','en'),(9907,1907,'2002-03-05 20:15:16',59,'s5','ditch this deborah chick. sounds like bad news.',3,0,0,0,'65.84.40.62','en'),(9908,1905,'2002-03-05 20:15:16',59,'s5','my things are the same as o\\\'s.',3,0,0,0,'65.84.40.62','en'),(9909,1905,'2001-10-08 21:50:12',0,'jim','my things are the same as a small red monkey.',6,0,0,0,'66.92.4.146','en'),(9910,1909,'2002-03-05 01:46:04',17,'austin','i just forwarded this to media@exploratorium.edu.  hope you dont mind.',0,0,0,0,'205.179.19.31','en'),(9911,1907,'2002-03-08 04:52:11',66,'Peter','<br><tt>yes, forget deborah. you should have known when you said she was the only girl youve liked more than she liked you. and i like the orange pants. they are, however, no match for my Orange-Stitched Sansabelt Bellbottoms of Doom.</tt> ',1,0,0,0,'66.65.48.127','en'),(9912,1907,'2002-03-05 20:17:36',17,'austin is with peter','if it is obvious to you, then you should not date.',1,0,0,0,'205.179.19.31','en'),(9913,1907,'2002-03-08 04:50:26',86,'egg to chi chi','what is this, i turn my back for two minutes and you\\\'re becoming a Swinney&trade; Comment Ho?',0,0,0,0,'66.47.229.243','en'),(9914,1907,'2004-08-24 18:01:43',83,'adamajah','<p>swin>org:<br>\r\nwhere ordinary good girls turn into <i>Comment Ho\\\'s</i></p>  ',0,0,0,0,'64.120.104.101','en'),(9915,1907,'2001-10-08 23:01:55',0,'chi chi to egg','<br>\r\n<*adam*> eggs are always to blame. but you\\\'re the scape-goat',0,0,0,0,'64.168.23.149','en'),(9916,1907,'2001-10-08 23:03:47',0,'chi chi','for the record:<br>\r\ni\\\'m not a <i>comment ho</i>. just a comment flirt.<br>\r\nnothing wrong with good clean wholesome flirting, now is there?',0,0,0,0,'64.168.23.149','en'),(9917,1907,'2001-10-08 23:06:41',0,'adamajah to chi chi','<p>&lt;*goat*&gt; i blame egg for this.</p>',0,0,0,0,'64.120.104.101','en'),(9918,1901,'2001-10-08 23:40:09',0,'Hallett','well, it\\\'s my middle name, my dad\\\'s middle name and my grandfathers first name.  i think it\\\'s