http://www.rhodamine.org/pics/booth1.jpg\">this</a>? </tt> ',1,0,0,0,'66.65.48.127','en'),(9928,1910,'2002-03-08 04:52:11',66,'Peter','<br><tt>i was using my 9-year-old tennessee license for the longest time, 7 years expired. the bouncers here weren\\\'t really crazy about it, especially since it still pegs me as being 15 years old.  its finally gotten bad enough that im actually comtemplating braving the wild nyc dmv lines to get the situation rectified. speaking of- i\\\'ll pay anyone in the area $100 to wait in line for me and call me when its my turn.</tt>',1,0,0,0,'66.65.48.127','en'),(9929,1910,'2001-10-09 02:40:13',0,'leonard','i got 2 tickets on the same street within a 2 week period. i sold that car and now i take the long way home.',2,0,0,0,'209.179.135.59','en'),(9930,1905,'2001-10-09 02:50:15',0,'deb','1. thinking 2. wishing 3. hoping 4. trying 5. being',0,0,0,0,'205.188.193.153','en'),(9931,1910,'2001-10-09 03:03:29',0,'deb','in my youth, i am almost ashamed to tell you that i am also an insurance specialist. but i will forgive you... for now.  just stay outta jersey ... we have enough uninsured drivers ;)',0,0,0,0,'205.188.193.153','en'),(9932,1910,'2001-10-09 03:05:07',0,'jo','since leasing my little pickup truck a year and a half ago, it has been involved in three accidents: the first when <a href=\\\"http://mr.unpopular.com/~szajic/\\\">mr. zajic</a> got it in a fender bender while taking a friend of ours home, the second when i was hit and run while parked in my apartment complex a few months later, and the third when i was hit and run last tuesday night while inside drinking with my friend <a href=\\\"http://cowbellz.diaryland.com/\\\">kristy</a> on her last night in town.<BR>\r\ni have bad bad car mojo. my insurance keeps rising...',0,0,0,0,'172.130.71.188','en'),(9933,1905,'2001-10-09 03:15:30',0,'Joanna','1. Being a host<BR>\r\n2. Remembering<BR>\r\n3. Staying calm when others aren\\\'t<BR>\r\n4. Loving (or I used to be, I feel number now)<BR>\r\n5. Smiling<BR>',1,0,0,0,'203.97.2.242','en'),(9934,1910,'2001-10-09 03:42:34',0,'auntie','i actually own a car, a 2000 saturn, which i have driven like three times.  i have never had a real drivers license.  i have had a succession of learners permits, the most recent is a still good. but i hate to drive. i bought the car because i needed it, and now mandy has it for a little while until she can buy her own, but i will go back to florida soon and get it and then mark will make me get a license.  i took a drivers test one time and they made me cry.  so i never tried to take the drivers test again, and over the years the fear has paralysed me from trying.  i don\\\'t like to cry much.',4,0,0,0,'24.162.119.106','en'),(9935,1902,'2002-06-27 20:39:15',240,'xep','danny... i know him as daniel.  he wasn\\\'t in the show this time.  haven\\\'t seen him in a while.  he\\\'s way better than the aussie guy in the show on saturday who wasn\\\'t really a contortionist, just a guy who could dislocate his shoulder.  daniel has actual amazing talent.  i once saw him bend over backwards and pick up a dollar bill with his teeth... without using his hands to support himself at all.  crazy stuff.',0,0,0,0,'209.228.7.6','en'),(9936,1910,'2001-10-09 03:57:54',0,'ghost','i quit crying several years ago. couldn\\\'t handle it. then in august i started crying again. it was like hitting rock bottom. i haven\\\'t stopped since...everything makes me cry these days. i cried on the phone last night. i felt like a baby when i did it, i hate crying in front of other people. but it felt really good to know i have a friend i can cry with.',4,0,0,0,'32.102.109.253','en'),(9937,1910,'2001-10-09 03:58:46',0,'ps','i am also tangent girl these days...',1,0,0,0,'32.102.109.253','en'),(9938,1910,'2001-10-09 04:48:05',0,'chi chi','i have gotten two speeding tickets, and being the little good girl i tried to keep them from my mother. too bad my insurance agent is my mom\\\'s and she also lives in the same building.<br>\r\nnot one for stern lectures, my mom reminded me that after i turn 25 my insurence will no longer be a flat rate, but based on my driving record, and will i please drive slower in the future...',0,0,0,0,'64.168.23.149','en'),(9939,1910,'2001-10-09 06:44:18',0,'AUNTIE','driving::austin:math',4,0,0,0,'64.174.155.197','en'),(9940,1906,'2001-10-09 07:16:46',0,'green','so Essemar is the title of your next article in regards to this and Hallet we shall both be adopted by J. NYC crack babies and Essemar is the daddy.\r\n\r\ngood subtle sarcasm there rat B\\\"',1,0,0,0,'198.81.16.47','en'),(9941,1904,'2001-10-09 07:18:19',0,'green to m\\\'89','chill out man',0,0,0,0,'198.81.16.47','en'),(9942,1907,'2001-10-09 07:25:19',0,'Green','AND you wonder? why your phone bill is so high?\r\n\r\nYou do things like this and DUH?\r\n\r\nYou need a short girl.\r\n\r\nFuck models.',6,0,0,0,'198.81.16.47','en'),(9943,1907,'2004-07-09 19:12:25',72,'essemar','<p>The new girl called last night.  The only thing on her mind was when she gets to see me again. (*sigh.....) Why can\\\'t I find anyone who loves me for more than my body?</p><p>I\\\'m kinda sad about the fact that I\\\'ll never talk to Deborah again.  I really wanted to borrow her cat to get rid of all the mice in my apartment.</p> <p>to Kat: Janis Joplin.  You could pull that off like no other.  I\\\'m eagerly awaiting an emailed certificate \\\"good for one <i>free</I> <b>big luvin\\\'</b>\\\"</p>',0,0,0,0,'198.45.19.20','en'),(9944,1907,'2002-03-08 04:52:11',66,'Peter','<br><tt> I love you, ess, but <i>not</i> for your body. I love you for your <i>rat-tail</i>. you and i should sublet a Big Cat from someone. he could warm up on your mice, and fight my garbage rat-monsters for the main event.</tt>',1,0,0,0,'204.168.247.48','en'),(9945,1907,'2004-07-09 19:12:25',72,'essemar','Peter... we\\\'d need a fucking tiger to take out those rats.  Those are the kind of creatures that drag small children into the sewers while leaving a rear guard to fight off the parents.  You\\\'re going to wake up some morning with your leg completely chewed off.',0,0,0,0,'198.45.19.20','en'),(9946,1910,'2004-07-09 19:12:25',72,'essemar','I\\\'ve worked as a pizza delivery driver and driven across this country (Cape Cod -> Portland, OR) twice and not gotten a single ticket or been in any accidents.  I tell this to my passengers as they cower in their seats peeking through fingers clutched over faces.  Hallett said riding in the car with me was one of the scariest experiences of his life, sort of like riding a roller coaster without proper safetly measures.',0,0,0,0,'198.45.19.20','en'),(9947,1910,'2001-10-09 14:47:56',0,'jo','weird that auntie and mandy and elly all have weird driving issues. i actually think that elly would be a good driver because her eye-hand coordination and reflexes are good.',0,0,0,0,'216.141.109.62','en'),(9948,1910,'2002-06-12 21:13:52',93,'chiamattt','i will not sit in a car with le driving. ',6,0,0,0,'24.43.182.49','en'),(9949,1910,'2001-10-09 15:41:20',0,'asstin','i was going to protest le being a good driver but then i remembered, she is all right with stick shift. but then maybe she had prior practice.  there was a time when getting le behind the wheel was a priority.',3,0,0,0,'205.179.19.31','en'),(9950,1912,'2002-09-01 23:16:03',57,'weeb','<p>forget bolts, maybe you need 4\\\" spikes. or barbed wire if you\\\'re reallly serious. or maybe there is a compromise you can make with them? ask them to stay farther away? make a bench for them and put a schrub behind it for a sound barrier? build them a stoop farther away from your window?</p>\r\n\r\n<p>it\\\'s nice that poor people and street kids want to get off drugs and get help for HIV/AIDS, though.</p>',1,0,0,0,'63.197.69.58','en'),(9951,1910,'2002-03-08 04:50:11',86,'egg','<p>The first week that I learned how to drive, I hit a fire hydrant that was hidden on the side of the road. I was swerving. I think some cigarrette ash got on me or something. I didnt have any money to fix the extensive body damage on my 1984 Dodge Aries named Inez so my brother went to the junkyard and found a quarter panel that was the wrong color and fixed it for me. so I drove around for a while looking really classy, with a black quarter panel on a gray car.</p>\r\n<p>Oh, also, I have been pulled over for everything, including not wearing a seat belt as a passenger. the cop saw me put on the seatbelt as we were pulling over, and got really pissed and said \\\"I\\\'ze just gonna give you a warning, but now that you did THAT.\\\" I once let a parking ticket become >$300. or was that a speeding ticket. I dont know, there have been so many.</p>',0,0,0,0,'66.47.229.243','en'),(9952,1912,'2002-03-08 04:52:11',66,'Peter','<br><tt>yes, its good for people to seek help, but this is one of the government-makes-it-mandatory places, so the patrons aren\'t there on personal motivation, thus the swarthy attitudes; if they were, I\'d applaud them and fix them coffee.<br><br>\r\nI\'ve asked them or their administrators, very kindly, daily for a month, no avail. Even while installing the bolts, i was all smiles and small-talk. They don\'t seem to grasp the idea that <i>they just aren\'t welcome</i> to lounge wherever their whims take them, especially if it obstructs my building\'s $2500+/month tennants access/enjoyment of a clean building.  I stopped playing devil\'s advocate a month ago. I totally would put up a bench/shrub/etc but as there\'s only 5\' of sidewalk (which is illegal to obstruct) between building and street and not a spot of dirt or green within a mile, thats not a possibility. I really dont even mind the talking and smoking so much. its just the urination and vomit that i could do without. sigh.</tt>\r\n\r\n',1,0,0,0,'204.168.247.48','en'),(9953,1910,'2002-03-08 04:52:11',66,'Peter','<br><tt>i wonder if there is a correlation between <i>driving record</i> and <i>character</i>?</tt>',1,0,0,0,'204.168.247.48','en'),(9954,1910,'2001-10-09 16:59:18',0,'correlation','<i>we are human</i>',1,0,0,0,'32.102.109.213','en'),(9955,1910,'2001-10-09 17:01:10',0,'question for austin','you have a driver\\\'s license from Montana-- are you from Montana?',0,0,0,0,'156.153.254.42','en'),(9956,1912,'2001-10-09 17:05:32',0,'questionboy','oh my god, \\\'eating disorders\\\'???',0,0,0,0,'156.153.254.42','en'),(9957,1910,'2004-08-24 18:01:43',83,'adamajah','<p>while commuting to my previous job, from south pasadena to agoura hills, along the 101 N., a short, uninsured mexican in a thunderbird changed lanes into my car.  i was going over 70 and my car, not having anti-lock brakes or anything fancy like that, started sliding around like a piece of wood on hard snow.  when we pulled over, two other people pulled over to offer support as witnesses.  a little bit of my faith in humanity was restored because of that.  complete strangers are just like you and me.  they are nice.  anyways, i felt bad because the mexican wanted to settle with me privately, and i understood (since he was uninsured and possibly illegal), but everyone told me to just report him to the insurance company and let them sue him for the two grand it cost to fix the front end of my car.  and that\\\'s what i did.  i am truly sorry, juan.',3,0,0,0,'64.120.104.101','en'),(9958,1912,'2004-07-27 05:00:32',578,'NetfÃ¶ng!','peter, your neighbors are indeed wreched! maybe <i>thats</i> why i didn\'t get any sleep there!',1,0,0,0,'204.168.247.48','en'),(9959,1912,'2004-07-09 19:12:25',72,'essemar','Really?  I thought it was because the two of you were \\\'occupied.\\\'  ;-]',0,0,0,0,'198.45.19.20','en'),(9960,1912,'2001-10-09 18:09:11',0,'ahhhhh','there are so many love triangles, wantings, cravings, jealousies, and unspoken things on swinney. it is frightening and enticing. we should just bust loose with a big orgy and get it all over with once and for all.',1,0,0,0,'32.102.109.213','en'),(9961,1912,'2002-03-08 04:52:11',66,'Peter','<br><