!!!!!\r\n\r\n',1,0,0,0,'132.162.210.54','en'),(9971,1893,'2001-10-09 20:05:38',0,'maria','althought, i must say that while i heart soy, i can\\\'t stand tempeh (unless it is smothered in something else) and that i don\\\'t like soy cheese.\r\n\r\nhowever, i do like tofutti cheese. \r\n\r\nand baked, marinated tofu is the BEST. ',0,0,0,0,'132.162.210.54','en'),(9972,1914,'2002-03-08 04:50:11',86,'egg','dude, there is something in the stars. i have had intestinal discomfort all day, and chi chi complained of something. last night, austin said \\\"i think im having my period\\\". and all around, people i know are having a rough week, hormonally speaking.',0,0,0,0,'66.47.229.243','en'),(9973,1893,'2001-10-09 20:23:28',0,'lou','i don\\\'t like soy, i don\\\'t like tempeh, and i don\\\'t like tofu.  i am down on these products. i like DAIRY.<p>\r\n\r\n<font size=1>(destabilizing.)</font>',4,0,0,0,'207.237.128.1','en'),(9974,1910,'2001-10-09 20:27:41',0,'montana question boy','where? harlem, havre, two dot, worden, roundup, circle, arlee, great falls, billings, bozeman, missoula, lolo, darby, polson, kalipsell, whitefish, many glacier, glasgow, wibaux, west yellowstone, froid, tarkio, trout creek, post creek, mission flats, dog lake, lockwood, pryor, fort belknap, joplin, helena, frenchtown, three forks, lodge grass, wyola, deer lodge, red lodge, decker (or is that wyoming), colstrip, lame deer, st. xavier, winnet, big sandy...',0,0,0,0,'156.153.254.42','en'),(9975,1914,'2002-03-05 20:15:16',59,'s5','my headache has been hurting for days and i\\\'ve been sleeping no more than 4 hours each night. also it\\\'s mercury retrograde. hi everyone.',3,0,0,0,'65.84.40.62','en'),(9976,1914,'2002-03-05 01:46:04',17,'austin','<P>i am on the second day of my period.  head aches.  sleeplessness.  ponderous thoughts about acting like a grown up.  spending money on websites. hi.</P>\r\n',4,0,0,0,'205.179.19.31','en'),(9977,1914,'2002-03-05 20:15:16',59,'s5','acting like a grown-up; i\\\'m