>.<BR>\r\n2) the eyebrow thing is really uncanny. i always thought the principal was sexy. he has a nice voice.',0,0,0,0,'216.141.109.62','en'),(11119,2010,'2001-11-06 16:20:57',0,'green to egg','i must admit that was fucking funny\r\n',1,0,0,0,'198.81.16.181','en'),(11120,2010,'2002-03-08 04:52:11',66,'Peter','<br><tt><a href=\\\"http://www.samsloan.com/fawnhall.htm\\\">fawn hall</a>?',1,0,0,0,'204.168.247.48','en'),(11121,2007,'2004-07-09 19:12:25',72,'essemar','...according to Erisian Liberation Front informants Fallopian Forinicator and John John Dillinger treated Lord Omar to cup of Kool-Aid.  ELF maintains that the Love Vibrations felt throughout Switzerland are actually a result of Dr. Mojo\\\'s efforts which Patamunzo has been attempting to subvert through his connections with the World Trade Organization.',0,0,0,0,'198.45.19.20','en'),(11122,2015,'2001-11-06 17:23:48',0,'shegoestoeleven','<p>Nigel: You see, most blokes, you know, will be playing at ten. You\\\'re on ten here, all the way up, all the way up, all the way up, you\\\'re on ten on your guitar. Where can you go from there? Where? <br>\r\nMarty: I don\\\'t know. <br>\r\nNigel: Nowhere. Exactly. What we do is, if we need that extra push over the cliff, you know what we do? <br>\r\nMarty: Put it up to eleven. <br>\r\nNigel: Eleven. Exactly. One louder.</p>',1,0,0,0,'32.102.64.4','en'),(11123,2015,'2002-03-08 04:52:11',66,'Peter','<br><tt><a href=\\\"http://www.spinaltap.com/video/11_sm.mov\\\">Ours go to <i>eleven</i>...</a></tt>',1,0,0,0,'204.168.247.48','en'),(11124,2022,'2001-11-06 18:09:19',0,'sims to jo','i disagree. i thought that the model\\\'s inc style melrose places were the better ones. like when kimberly comes back from the dead and she goes into the bathroom and pulls of the wig to reveal a SCARY looking head wound.',0,0,0,0,'63.195.92.218','en'),(11125,2022,'2002-03-08 04:50:11',86,'egg','i also prefer when tv is extremely absurd and outrageous. i would watch tv more if there were show