ash too much - that\\\'s what i do for my back. i\\\'m also allergic to california. i blame the leftover east coast bathing habits.',3,0,0,0,'65.84.40.62','en'),(11150,2022,'2002-03-05 20:15:16',59,'s5','i love things that make me stupid. pot and television are often the quickest ways to get there. thank you, cartoon network.',3,0,0,0,'65.84.40.62','en'),(11151,2022,'2002-09-05 18:42:54',18,'ix','hey wasn\\\'t this thread about me?',0,0,0,0,'144.136.17.130','en'),(11152,2016,'2002-09-05 18:42:54',18,'ix','what is up with the pussies hiding behind fake names to diss people? it\\\'s quite ironic that the same person who suggested i eat a dick recently posted a <a href=\\\"http://www.swinney.org/journals/article.phtml?id=1984.txt#11050\\\">comment</a> about his/her generation\\\'s lack of spirituality.',0,0,0,0,'144.136.17.130','en'),(11153,1898,'2001-11-07 10:19:03',0,'no, this is gross','<p>\r\n<img src=\\\"http://www.fahking.com/gay/blile/skullfuck.jpg\\\">',4,0,0,0,'61.9.128.141','en'),(11154,2016,'2002-09-05 18:42:54',18,'ix','chia: care to explain how capitalism leads to increased bureaucracy? if anything it should have the opposite effect, in the name of cutting costs. as opposed to government, which can only exist by perpetuating bloated bureaucracy!',0,0,0,0,'144.136.17.130','en'),(11155,2022,'2002-03-08 04:52:53',65,'le','ix sure is great! when he licks his fingers, instead of putting just one finger in his mouth, he puts a lot of them in at once, which makes him look like a bear cub. and bear cubs are cute.\r\n<br><br>\r\nalso, he\\\'s pretty good at century club, is an aspirant filmmaker, a perl warrior, and a comic book fan. he has cool shoes and a plaster statue of ET. also he listens to symphonic heavy metal and burt bacharach in the same breath! \r\n<br><br>\r\noverall i find him to be a delightful human being. but don\\\'t let that go to your head.\r\n\r\n',4,0,0,0,'209.86.2.240','en'),(11156,2016,'2002-03-05 20:15:16',59,'s5','<b>the wealth of nations</b>, by adam smith, claimed that governments are \\\"spendthrift, irresponsible, and unproductive\\\"; and that monopolies are \\\"in a conspiracy against the public.\\\" but individuals, he said, \\\"from their regard to their own interest are led by an invisible hand\\\" and are \\\"most agreeable to the interest of the whole country.\\\"\r\n<br><br>\r\nsmith was said to have predicted the decline of the british empire. the first volume was printed in 1776.\r\n<br><br>\r\njust a bit of history on the subject. i\\\'m sure karl marx had other things to say.',3,0,0,0,'65.84.40.62','en'),(11157,2024,'2002-10-03 18:45:24',70,'Fuzzy','<i>You should try to get Jesus, he\\\'s like six leprechauns, but a lot harder to catch.  Maybe you should just stick with the leprechaun.</i><br><br><i>The best part about a Gypsy wedding is that I\\\'m not the hariest woman here!</i><br><br><i>See?  Two taps means yes.</i>',1,0,0,0,'64.229.79.200','en'),(11158,2024,'2002-03-08 04:52:11',66,'Peter','<br><tt><i>\"...mmmm! unexplained bacon!\"</i></tt>',1,0,0,0,'204.168.247.48','en'),(11159,2021,'2001-11-07 14:03:04',0,'trouble','funny what you take with you from each job.. i can for instance; lace tennis shoes at a rapid pace and spit the latest street slang at the same time, i can make you a coney island hot dog and chop onions like a fucking maniac, i can clear your table and stack cups, i can sell you a leather jacket without you knowing you <i>need</i> one, i can make you coffee and serve you up a hot muffin, i can rent you a video and give you my semi-expert movie advice, i could make your drink and read your lips while the band plays on stage at decibels probably not safe, i could draw your picture, i could take your kids on a nature walk and talk about birds, i could give you change, i could DJ at your wedding or graduation party, i could run your technical support call center supporting 84k internet subscribers, i could debug your software and teach your customers how to use it and i could still pour molten steel into a mold that i made to make the new prototype manifold for your new luxury sedan your company might want to roll out.  i am 29, i have worked since i was 13... that sure seems like a long time.',1,0,0,0,'216.82.34.12','en'),(11160,2024,'2004-07-09 19:12:25',72,'essemar','I ate a turkey & bacon sandwich on a croissant yesterday.  It was left over from some management lunch meeting.  It was good.<p>I sometimes walk around with my eyes closed openning them briefly every twenty paces to make sure I\\\'m not walking on the grass.</p>',0,0,0,0,'198.45.18.20','en'),(11161,2026,'2002-03-08 04:50:11',86,'egg','gruschenka had her onion, and mitya, a beautiful dream. ',0,0,0,0,'66.47.229.243','en'),(11162,2025,'2001-11-07 17:30:10',0,'leonard','when swinney was working here i always had a rash on my face.',4,0,0,0,'64.210.3.222','en'),(11163,1431,'2001-11-07 18:11:25',0,'stella','I wonder where Puppy went?',0,0,0,0,'168.73.245.56','en'),(11164,2025,'2001-11-07 18:29:40',0,'me','Bikram yoga...sweat out all the bad.  seriously, it works.  my skin never looked better and my health was never better than when i was practicing regularly.  \r\n\r\ntry Kiehl\\\'s products...very soothing and natural.\r\nKiehl\\\'s store on Fillmore @Washington.\r\n',2,0,0,0,'207.189.39.18','en'),(11165,2016,'2001-11-07 18:43:36',0,'that good ol\\\' moebius','It occurs to me that there are certain situations where capitalism engenders increased bureaucracy (man, that\\\'s a hard word to spell--but I think I\\\'m starting to get it down): namely, when it comes to rebates. Especially when they seem to be too good to be true. </p>\r\n\r\n<p>Case in point: any of you ever fall for one of those \\\"Best Buy\\\"-type computer deals where you\\\'re supposed to get a fabulous computer & printer & monitor & webcam & god knows what else for some relatively miniscule price, like 500 bucks? In reality you pay Best Buy close to full price for the entire package--and then you\\\'re supposed to collect rebates from the manufacturers of each individual component in order to realize the great deal you originally saw in the Best Buy advertising supplement. My girlfriend did this. And then we learned you had to jump through a seemingly infinite set of hoops to get each rebate back. Essentially they make the process so torturous that you give up in disgust.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>I think capitalism can breed systems that are models of efficiency--but only as long as they ultimately realize more cash for the \\\"captains of industry\\\" out there. If it looks like you\\\'re getting something for nothing, then you can be sure there\\\'s something else going on. Anyway, for the rest you can take a Macroeconomics 101 course (I didn\\\'t).</p>',1,0,0,0,'148.87.1.170','en'),(11166,2016,'2002-03-15 00:17:55',129,'moebius','oh and by the way: ix (or tuggy or brian or...), as far as I\\\'m personally concerned, you\\\'re hiding behind a fake name, too. Just thought I\\\'d make that small point out. Don\\\'t mean to seem like a smartypants. ',2,0,0,0,'148.87.1.170','en'),(11167,2016,'2002-03-08 04:52:11',66,'Peter','<br><tt>yes, but we all know who \\\'ix\\\' stands for. i think his point was that this is not the case with \\\'i say\\\', etc. anonymous jabs suck.</tt>',1,0,0,0,'66.65.50.61','en'),(11168,2025,'2002-09-01 23:16:03',57,'weeb','i have weird asian skin that likes castile soap and then only massage oil diluted with water as a moisterizer. i am the oily heathen princess. my skin would prolly like pure cocunut oil slathered on it, daily. the more oil the better! perhaps you are not getting enough oil on your skin?',0,0,0,0,'63.197.69.58','en'),(11169,2025,'2001-11-07 20:06:28',0,'jo','i associate <a href=\\\"http://sent.diaryland.com/030401.html\\\">kiehl\\\'s with my friend gregory</a>, who always answers compliments about his beautiful hair with a tribute to the magic of kiehl\\\'s. he actually wrote about it once, maybe for <a href=\\\"http://regarding