s about this today.  they said that they can\\\'t smell themselves, but i can smell myself.  i have a kind of sweet grainy smell that reminds me of fresh-cut hay or wheat.  and i always hear that carnivores smell bad.. bullshit!',0,0,0,0,'24.42.192.253','en'),(13288,2279,'2002-09-17 20:56:11',148,'jeeff','this brings up an interesting thought in my mind.  to have sex with someone while they\\\'re in such a vulnerable state could be bad.  but sex <i>is</i> vulnerability.  where\\\'s the line?  i\\\'m thinking that there probably is no line, but rather a big fuzzy area.  life is confusing.',0,0,0,0,'24.42.192.253','en'),(13289,2277,'2002-01-22 06:40:22',0,'da','the almost but just barely not quite abandoned next boxen that lived in the back room of the u.va engineering computing facility took an awfully, awfully long time to boot.  like, an hour or so. maybe they were just ill tuned and needed a tough chick sysadmin.\r\n\r\naustin, regarding the taking of things and barbarism generally: i think this may be a necessary life skill in california.  most of the people you know are quirky and somewhat unpredictable but basically good communicators, and are thus likely to dispense smackdowns as necessary.\r\n\r\nplus, it\\\'s better to ask forgiveness than permission.  generally.',2,0,0,0,'165.121.125.210','en'),(13290,2282,'2002-01-22 07:03:31',0,'wb','this is like updike\\\'s AP! so she never came back to that carls?',0,0,0,0,'216.103.215.241','en'),(13291,2274,'2002-01-22 07:06:05',0,'drew','good taste is when you like the same kind of music the person you\\\'re talking to likes, or the kind of music that person thinks they <em>should</em> like.',0,0,0,0,'65.12.14.45','en'),(13292,2283,'2002-01-22 07:40:28',0,'so','screw you, i didn\\\'t want to come over, anyway.',0,0,0,0,'203.96.111.200','en'),(13293,2283,'2002-03-08 04:52:53',65,'le','eventually, you\\\'re just talking to yourself, and the object of your upset doesn\\\'t hear it at all anymore. only you. only you.',0,0,0,0,'165.247.204.97','en'),(13294,2285,'2002-01-22 07:50:55',0,'someone','whose boy smells like home... with my arm draped over and my nose tucked into his back, i can smell his lullaby scent and fall asleep.',0,0,0,0,'203.96.111.200','en'),(13295,2285,'2002-01-22 08:06:36',0,'jo','europeans don\\\'t put off as foul as body odor as americans because there aren\\\'t as many hormones in their meat. i don\\\'t remember where i read this but the source was reliable; someone diligent like szajic will google it, i\\\'m sure.<BR>\r\ni smell like any combination of things. usually faint cigarette smoke, peppermint dr. bronner\\\'s, and a non-patchouli essential oil. i have this essential oil that i get every time i go to new orleans: it\\\'s called \\\"come to me\\\" oil. the joke is that the prostitutes in turn of the century n.o. used to wear it to lure in men from the street. i buy it at a tiny little witch store where the woman behind the counter comments on my red hair and when she finds out i\\\'m a cancer, knocks a buck or two off the charge.<BR>\r\nmy last boy smelled like nag champa. this boy smells like freshness. even at the end of the night, he smells clean and dry.',0,0,0,0,'172.129.187.171','en'),(13296,2217,'2002-01-22 08:10:32',0,'jo','two weeks later: we can\\\'t get enough of one another. this one is a keeper, as my mom used to say.',0,0,0,0,'172.129.187.171','en'),(13297,2285,'2002-01-22 08:12:57',0,'science','<a href=\\\"http://www.mirror.co.uk/news/allnews/page.cfm?objectid=11553965&method=full\\\">http://www.mirror.co.uk/news/allnews/page.cfm?objectid=11553965&method=full</a>',2,0,0,0,'66.47.229.243','en'),(13298,2217,'2002-01-22 08:17:13',0,'kat','keepers are good. it is nice to be thought of as a keeper as well. this pony is learning how to pace herself....and enjoying it. arf. arf.',1,0,0,0,'209.239.198.238','en'),(13299,2246,'2002-01-22 08:42:05',0,'norway','ja! and raw horse flesh. it goes with aquavit.',4,0,0,0,'24.205.196.37','en'),(13300,2285,