al, instead of taking a nap.  Nap is Death.\r\n<BR><BR>\r\nI\\\'m glad you are recovering.  That is horrible.  This is horrible affliction week on swinney.  Somebody make a Series.\r\n<BR><BR>\r\n**virtual flowers**',1,329,0,0,'63.80.97.254','en'),(21382,3699,'2004-09-15 18:48:57',74,'jo','whoa.\r\nwhoa.\r\ni am going to stop feeling sorry for myself and my stupid foot RIGHT THIS SECOND.\r\nalana, i am so sorry.',0,118,0,0,'216.142.229.132','en'),(21383,3698,'2004-09-15 23:20:27',175,'Paul G','1-800-HOT-AUSI',1,14,0,0,'131.156.159.222','en'),(21384,40,'2004-09-16 00:12:49',83,'adamajah','First Swintry REPRESENT!',1,24,0,0,'216.206.179.50','en'),(21385,40,'2004-09-16 01:28:58',17,'austin','ah, yeah.  i sorry the dates are all fucked up.  i have the original, they just need to be fixed.',1,97,0,0,'68.6.211.134','en'),(21386,3699,'2004-09-16 14:10:28',231,'alana','matt: it\\\'s been taken care of.\r\njo: nono! your foot hurts! you must nurture your foot and treat it with love and respect. and also feel sad about it. your foot broke. *hugs your foot*.',1,187,0,0,'150.101.156.40','en'),(21387,3699,'2004-09-16 14:27:40',74,'jo','you\\\'re a nicey. ',0,19,231,0,'216.142.229.132','en'),(21388,3701,'2004-09-16 17:59:09',74,'jo','whoa. whoa. ',0,12,0,0,'216.142.229.132','en'),(21389,3701,'2004-09-18 02:27:01',234,'etienne','dude, i\\\'m really sorry to hear that.  it must be a relief in some ways though to have found out what the source of so many years of pain is - a similar thing happened to my friend elissa: she was in a car accident and when they gave her a head scan they discovered tumours.  i hope you are feeling much improved.',1,315,0,0,'219.88.205.78','en'),(21390,3701,'2004-09-19 10:27:12',65,'le','while i was reading this i had a really overwhelming sense of unconditional love for you and thankfulness for all the things in the world. ',4,139,0,0,'67.164.14.63','en'),(21391,3695,'2004-09-20 00:24:19',176,'Scapegoat','Sounds like a career in arbitration to me. Too ba