Too many years with too many tears \r\nAnd too many days with none to say \r\nSo how will we know when there\\\'s nowhere to grow\r\nThe fact of life, life too short oh\r\n</PRE>',1,1283,0,0,'68.107.98.61','en'),(22518,3973,'0000-00-00 00:00:00',66,'Peter','<br><tt><pre>\r\nSlayer Bloodline Lyrics\r\nEternal the kiss I breath\r\nSiphon your blood to me\r\nFeel my wounds of your god\r\nForever rape mortality\r\nI smell of death\r\nI reek of hate\r\nI will live forever\r\nLost child pay the dead\r\nBleeding screams of silence\r\nIn my veins your eternity\r\n\r\nI\'ll kill you and your dreams tonight\r\nBegin new life\r\nBleed your death upon me\r\nLet your bloodline feed my youth\r\n\r\nFirst breath born come alive learn to kill\r\nBloodfest awaits to feed your hunger\r\nDark side has no rival test your faith in blood\r\nNight hides the hunting packs a feeding frenzy</pre</tt>\r\n\r\n',1,673,17,0,'130.219.8.253','en'),(22519,3973,'2006-05-27 00:03:23',17,'austin','DORK.',1,5,66,0,'68.107.98.61','en'),(22520,3972,'2006-06-03 15:30:29',750,'timbre','I just met a very nice black cat yesterday, and saw one on TV the day before that in a documentary on \\\"Shakespeare and Company\\\" on the Sundance channel.\r\n\r\nPerhaps your black kitty is still roaming around in spirit, but making friends this time...',0,253,0,0,'67.190.7.126','en'),(22521,3973,'2006-06-05 20:05:38',727,'netter','Yeah.  That.\r\n\r\nSo sad no Mexico.  So so so sad for the lack of lobsters.  Require take II.',1,91,0,0,'69.227.71.3','en'),(22522,3972,'2006-06-05 20:28:19',727,'netter','this is really, really lovely.',1,30,0,0,'69.227.71.3','en'),(22523,3973,'2006-06-06 05:17:34',66,'Peter','<br><img src=\\\"http://www.rhodamine.org/pics/art/salyer.jpg\\\">',1,66,17,0,'24.45.12.217','en'),(22524,3979,'0000-00-00 00:00:00',66,'Peter','<br><tt>i think that <i>\"...put your sweet lips a little closer to the phone ...\"</i> is a pretty good thing to write on a bathroom wall. once, i wrote <i>\"dont frighten the horses!\"</i> on a bathroom wall.<br><br>one time, when i was in a blackout in south america, i stopped into a small store and inquired about purchasing a candle, or a <i>vela</i> to get me through the dark evening. thanks to my accent, the clerk was certain that i was trying to procure an <i>abuela</i> from him, to get me through the dark evening. hilarity ensued.</tt>',1,482,0,0,'130.219.8.253','en'),(22525,3979,'2006-06-16 15:37:34',82,'simon','haha!',1,5,66,0,'209.21.99.118','en'),(22526,3981,'2006-06-29 18:21:07',195,'matt','when i was the only white guy in the projects in athens, they all thought i was a cop for a good three months.<BR><BR>here, when i started to try to score weed, i was somewhat older and dressed much straighter than the people i was dealing with, and they all thought i was a cop.<BR><BR>both times, i thought, <i>why would the police inject a confidential informant who stood out so much into this situation?</i> ',1,413,0,0,'64.128.136.170','en'),(22527,3981,'2006-06-29 23:02:15',66,'Peter','<br><tt>athens, ga? when did you live there? why did you leave?<br><br>my next swintry is gonna be about why they think im a cop. its a good yarn.</tt>',1,151,195,0,'24.45.12.217','en'),(22528,3981,'2006-07-01 17:45:54',195,'matt','i lived there from august, \\\'97 to june, \\\'98.  i left because i couldn\\\'t hang, as they say.  drugs.',1,107,66,0,'64.128.136.170','en'),(22529,3926,'2006-07-02 06:05:17',120,'joyrider','<p>travel, for me, serves as a transitional axis between life phases.  in my life, long distance travel usually involves moving.  shorter trips can have the same effect: the shock of novelty wakes me up and gets the blood into my head and heart.</p>\r\n\r\n<p>manda, when i would drive from colorado back into arizona, i would feel something similar when i reached <a href=\\\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Monument_Valley\\\">tsé bii\\\' ndzisgaii</a>.</p>',2,452,0,0,'72.194.128.171','en'),(22530,3981,'2006-07-03 22:15:57',251,'jamie','a cop? i just thought you were jewish',0,37,66,0,'85.210.27.56','en'),(22531,3984,'2006-07-06 18:13:32',66,'Peter','<br><tt>i remember you. muahahaha.</tt>',1,39,0,0,'130.219.8.253','en'),(22532,3984,'2006-07-06 21:05:21',754,'Camilla','Hahah. GOD BLESS YOU.',4,21,0,0,'84.202.63.193','en'),(22533,3984,'2006-07-06 21:36:15',86,'egg','i remember too. i think there were a lot of pictures involved.',0,62,0,0,'71.247.212.181','en'),(22534,3984,'2006-07-06 21:38:44',754,'Camilla','Well, that is very possible, as I had (have) a webcam.',3,54,0,0,'84.202.63.193','en'),(22535,3985,'2006-07-08 06:35:15',63,'olivia','I was thinking about you the other day.  I forgot your URL.  You\\\'re all grown up now.  Hi.',0,93,0,0,'64.81.243.90','en'),(22536,3985,'2006-07-08 13:58:55',754,'Camilla','Oh yes, I\\\'m a big girl now. All responsible and boring. My URL is www.wallflower.nu. I forgot your URL as well, actually. Still have a site up?',1,146,0,0,'84.202.63.193','en'),(22537,3981,'2006-07-09 05:36:31',66,'sine','white cop, white cop white cop white copppp boodahbabah!',0,56,0,0,'24.45.12.217','en'),(22538,3940,'2006-07-11 03:04:21',0,'mildew','I really like that kawi centerstand design but they tend to burn under heavy acceleration.',2,90,0,0,'71.102.242.186','en'),(22539,3986,'2006-07-12 20:32:24',195,'matt','if i could buy my reasoning,<BR>i\\\'d pay to lose<BR>one half won\\\'t do<BR>i\\\'ve asked myself<BR>how much do you commit yourself?<BR><BR>funny how i blind myself<BR>i never knew if i was sometimes played upon<BR>afraid to lose<BR>i\\\'d tell myself what good you do<BR>convince myself<BR><BR>it\\\'s my life<BR>don\\\'t you forget<BR>it\\\'s my life<BR>it never ends',1,371,0,0,'64.128.136.170','en'),(22540,3984,'2006-07-13 02:30:12',756,'mildew','your right, i don\\\'t remember you.  come to think of it, i can\\\'t remember myself.',0,86,0,0,'71.102.242.186','en'),(22541,3972,'2006-07-13 03:38:39',756,'mildew','I love black\r\nI hate cats\r\nit\\\'s a sort \r\nof paradoxical\