acked because for one, they acted brutallytowards women and didnt let them have the same rights as men. even now though, women are still not on the streets of kabul. why? well it wasnt like one day the taliban was in power and said \\\"no women\\\". the pashtun\\\'s havebeen brutal towards women for a very long time. hundreds of years. one of their proverbs is \\\'women have no nose, they will eat shit\\\". lets understand that the taliban are no worse towards women now then previous generations of afghanis. open your eyes and see that the invasion has done little for women. lets stop using it as a reason for death and destruction. ',0,'61.37.53.59','en'),(22049,'2002-09-06 05:08:30',57,'weeb','pictures from burning man!',0,'63.197.69.58','en'),(22050,'2002-09-06 05:23:35',62,'o','<img src=\\\"http://saturn5.com/olivia/images/events/bman2k2/DSCN4078.jpg\\\" width=\\\"150\\\" height=\\\"112\\\" border=\\\"0\\\" alt=\\\"wish you were here\\\">',0,'64.81.243.3','en'),(22051,'2002-09-06 06:57:52',234,'etienne','friday night in the city',0,'210.54.120.200','en'),(22052,'2002-09-06 07:25:26',17,'austin','CRETAN CRETAN',0,'64.174.154.35','en'),(22053,'2002-09-06 08:18:11',17,'austin','hang on -- a little bit longer',0,'64.174.154.35','en'),(22054,'2002-09-06 08:20:30',196,'jasonp','Most likely a toad somewhere just jumped into a cold murky pond. Why can\\\'t I be that toad? Pinned on the perimeter of bright sunlight concrete once again.',0,'68.8.65.87','en'),(22055,'2002-09-06 08:27:05',17,'austin','sittin here in queens, eating refried beans.  im actually kind of happy in a lonely sort of way.  our friend is not the president, or friend is not the pope.  im being layed off and that is ok.  the ocean is good.  i have whiskey which i should probably hide since this is the third night in a row.  where are a happy family.   and the question of moving to marfa is becoming curiously clearer.  bark bark bark.',0,'64.174.154.35','en'),(22056,'2002-09-06 08:28:21',17,'austin','now