\'ve lived your entire life believing in an \\\"american way of life\\\", believing in certain roles, believing in \\\"the family\\\", believing in God, and in what you believe God said should be; and then, all of a sudden, there are these artists, minorities, homosexuals and rockers -- these perverts -- saying that there are other ways to live in American and furthermore who believe their way is great, beautiful true and good -- then you\\\'re threatened, and the very fabric of what this country is supposed to be made up of -- in the eyes of the quintessential republican -- is being threatened by the opposition. They didn\\\'t vote for Bush\\\'s tax cuts or Bush\\\'s lies and they don\\\'t care about the war in Iraq -- they fearfully voted for the preservation of their way of life. ',0,'','en'),(34497,'2004-11-03 22:18:23',195,'matt','yeah, i do contradict myself.<BR>thanks for pointing that out for us.',0,'','en'),(34498,'2004-11-03 22:31:19',154,'ryan','<img src=\\\"http://saturn5.com/ryan/ole0.jpg\\\">',0,'','en'),(34499,'2004-11-04 06:01:00',370,'ralph nader','there. you happy now?',0,'24.85.233.195','en'),(34500,'2004-11-04 15:09:46',71,'dj1_luna','<a href=\\\"http://www.commondreams.org/views04/1103-28.htm\\\">Ten Reasons Not to Move to Canada </a>',0,'207.8.101.10','en'),(34501,'2004-11-04 15:14:23',66,'Peter','<img src=\\\"http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v186/poisonblonde/assholebush.gif\\\">',0,'','en'),(34502,'2004-11-04 15:14:41',66,'Peter','<img src=\\\"http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v186/poisonblonde/assholebush.gif\\\">',0,'130.219.136.216','en'),(34503,'2004-11-04 15:14:50',66,'Peter','ugh.',0,'130.219.136.216','en'),(34504,'2004-11-04 15:14:59',66,'Peter','http://img.photobucket.com/albums/v186/poisonblonde/assholebush.gif',0,'130.219.136.216','en'),(34505,'2004-11-04 17:04:16',154,'ryan','there is only really one reason not to move out of the US -- who would want to be the victim of our foreign policy?',0,'206.228.191.195','en'),(34506,'2004-11-04 20:59:22',74,'jo','<a href=\\\"http://www.swinney.org/journals/article.phtml?id=1897\\\">you have become what you thought was dumb</a>.',0,'216.142.229.132','en'),(34507,'2004-11-04 21:00:11',74,'jo','this week on swinney: jo just links to old swinney articles, possibly as meta-commentary that no one says anything new, possibly because she\\\'s just fucking bored.',0,'216.142.229.132','en'),(34508,'2004-11-04 22:36:18',195,'matt','an international commune based in amsterdam (branch offices as required).  we would have to have some sort of income, maybe manufacturing.  <A HREF=\\\"http://www.christiania.org/main/lan/?lan=gb\\\">christiania</A> makes bicycles and cast-iron stoves.<BR><BR>(or we could just move to christiania.)',0,'','en'),(34509,'2004-11-05 02:55:25',195,'matt','rise of the nephilim',0,'','en'),(34510,'2004-11-05 03:15:36',231,'alana','<img src=\\\"http://jonze.org/new_map.jpg\\\"/>',0,'','en'),(34511,'2004-11-05 03:18:19',231,'alana','<a href=\\\"http://idisk.mac.com/glwebb-public/new_map.jpg\\\">in fact</a>',0,'150.101.150.203','en'),(34512,'2004-11-05 05:53:27',610,'wasabimon','Life is not a matter of holding good cards, but sometimes, playing a poor hand well.',0,'66.93.224.138','en'),(34513,'2004-11-05 18:18:07',154,'ryan','FUCK THIS SHIT',0,'206.228.191.195','en'),(34514,'2004-11-05 18:41:42',370,'seanthecon','americans just got fucked over on so many levels most can\\\'t even figure out what just happened to them. don\\\'t let the anger turn into depressed sulkiness. the system is corrupt. you were bamboozled.',0,'24.85.233.195','en'),(34515,'2004-11-05 20:34:03',534,'griece','actually, we *can* figure out what just happened to us. were not stupid. also: we know the system is corrupt. were not stupid. also, we werent bamboozled. its the dumbass middleamerican rednecks that did it. again, were not stupid.',0,'','en'),(34516,'2004-11-05 20:37:05',534,'griece','im sorry, but im getting really fucking sick of everyone in teh world telling me a