ed. ',0,'211.202.80.222','en'),(34524,'2004-11-06 08:17:32',93,'chiamattt','seanthecon.  where are you?',0,'211.202.80.222','en'),(34525,'2004-11-06 11:13:15',74,'jo','also he won the popular and the electoral vote. this isn\\\'t 2000 where there was some seriously fucking shady shit about which to be outraged. most of the people i know feel as if they have been broken up with, it feels to them like a very private grieving. many of my friends, myself included, have donated money and time to senate and presidential campaigns that lost. give us a few days to mourn. i promise you that when the jon stewarts and michael moores and al frankens get over feeling like they were bitch-slapped, they will come back louder and stronger than ever.',0,'66.68.108.105','en'),(34526,'2004-11-06 11:15:36',74,'jo','<em>seriously fucking shady shit</em> we weren\\\'t already aware of, that is. obviously a former coke user and drunk driver winning an election where the primary reason for choosing him was touted as being \\\"moral superiority\\\" is some seriously fucking shady shit, but whatever.',0,'66.68.108.105','en'),(34527,'2004-11-06 15:39:53',231,'alana','hey everyone. think of the kittens! and the puppies and the baby ducks!',0,'150.101.150.203','en'),(34528,'2004-11-06 17:00:11',195,'matt','someday, this will all be the stuff of myth, and someday after that, it will be forgotten.  elections and lies can\\\'t touch what matters - the Human Spirit we all share, no matter how we voted.  one day, justice will prevail.  karma cannot be denied.',0,'','en'),(34529,'2004-11-06 17:06:37',195,'matt','remember, though:  pray to god, but keep rowing towards the shore.',0,'','en'),(34530,'2004-11-06 18:03:05',195,'matt','look at how much shit <A HREF=\\\"http://www.imdb.com/name/nm0000108/\\\">luc besson</A>\\\'s producing right now.  and four projects in pricipal photography at the same time.  he must have mad people working for him.',0,'','en'),(34531,'2004-11-06 22:46:49',93,'chiamattt','