e burger also.  aparently the seals &hearts; veggie burgers. <BR><BR>i am going crazy.  things that shouldnt bother me at all are throwing me all over the place like a 350lb gorilla might throw me around if he thought it was fun.  <BR><BR> life and love in san diego, sub title: FUCK ME HARDER.  i have not had sex in a very long time.  just that alone, JUST THAT, is enough to drive me insane.  in addition, i am also without any friends.  there is only one person in the entire city who knows my name is Austin and is not a coworker.  that is Lou, the grill master at Nunu\'s.  and can he cook.  tonight he gave me a pat on the back when he delivered the food.  he knows my plight.  he knows why I am at Nunu\'s ordering a burger from him on a thursday night, just like i did on a wednesday night.  because there is no one else to cook me a burger.  no other place where somebody like Lou knows my name.  i have no where but work and Nunu\'s.  <BR><BR> at this point, i dont even think i can relate to people outside a hamburger and beer and a work order.  i work all day. i create work for Lou.  Lou delivers and gives me a pat on the back.  Lou is somewhere between 50 and 100.  lou knows what philly blunts and black pussy (or lack of) can do to a man.  that is what the pat means.  \'i know.\'',0,'','en'),(35236,'2005-01-14 05:28:36',17,'austin','i guess this means it is time to start the novella.',0,'','en'),(35237,'2005-01-14 14:10:22',82,'simon','yeah what a nut',0,'24.215.232.163','en'),(35238,'2005-01-14 14:35:10',74,'jo','austin, why are you having trouble getting laid? you\'re a cute fellow. what\'s the problem? can\'t you scrounge up some ex sex, even? ',0,'66.68.108.105','en'),(35239,'2005-01-14 14:36:08',66,'Peter','hahaha boards of canada isnt scary at all. i have often fallen askeep listening to them. i highly reccommend them.',0,'130.219.136.217','en'),(35240,'2005-01-14 16:18:50',508,'edward','hm.',0,'','en'),(35241,'2005-01-14 16:20:17',508,'edward','things will pro