BR>the voices in your head are calling.<BR>stop wasting your time - there\'s nothing coming.<BR>only a fool would think someone could save you.<BR>the men at the factory are old and cunning.<BR>you don\'t owe nothing, so boy get runnin\'.<BR>it\'s the best years of your life they want to steal.<BR><BR>you grow up and you calm down.<BR>you\'re working for the clampdown.<BR>you start wearing the blue and brown.<BR>you\'re working for the clampdown.<BR>so you got someone to boss around -<BR>it makes you feel big now.<BR>you drift until you brutalize.<BR>you made your first kill now.<BR><BR>in these days of evil presidentes<BR>working for the clampdown....<BR>but lately one or two has fully paid their due<BR>for working for the clampdown.<BR>but ha!  gitalong!  gitalong!<BR><BR>and i\'ve given away no secret.<BR>who\'s barmy now?',0,'24.92.185.89','en'),(35352,'2005-01-20 22:16:36',83,'adamajah','Bubba, bring your helmet',0,'66.77.144.5','en'),(35353,'2005-01-21 02:31:28',82,'simon','hey adam what up dog',0,'','en'),(35354,'2005-01-21 02:39:52',195,'matt','i have discovered an anomaly.  i distinctly remember him using the phrase \"new order of the ages\" in his speech, towards the end.  i don\'t know if the transcript on <A HREF=\"http://www.cnn.com/ALLPOLITICS/inauguration/2001/transcripts/template.html\">the cnn website</A> is purported to be unabridged, but the phrase is absent from it.',0,'24.92.185.89','en'),(35355,'2005-01-21 02:40:11',83,'adamajah','yo simon.  you and bubba should meet in the middle: LA  ;p',0,'66.77.144.5','en'),(35356,'2005-01-21 02:58:20',195,'matt','uh, nevermind.  i was looking at his first inaugural speech.  i\'m an airhead.  a paranoid one.',0,'24.92.185.89','en'),(35357,'2005-01-21 04:57:50',82,'simon','ya adam. i\'m in ny so if me and bubs met in the middle, our asses would be in kansas. i\'m fixing to come to la to see some people at the end of febs maybe. bubs can meet me there.',0,'','en'),(35358,'2005-01-21 14:14:09',66,'Peter','kans