talking about it, and the only ones to confront her (karyssa) were - surprise, surprise - the jesus freaks.  everybody else was willing to let it slide.<BR><BR>you know, christians preach love and forgiveness, but i have found that they\'re often judgmental and vindictive and think they\'re the arbiters and enforcers of god\'s will on earth.  my mother has often told me that she forgives, but she doesn\'t forget.  that\'s her policy.<BR><BR>karyssa says nothing will happen to her.  she\'s the one bringing in most of the money.',0,'','en');
