 what.  flowers?  i couldn\'t think of anything else.<BR><BR>but i cook for her all the time, and even if it was a grand meal, it would be eaten off of tv trays like all the rest of them.<BR><BR>i\'d been saving a restaurant for something special and decided this was it.  it\'s on the other side of the county, in dade city.  she had no idea it was there.  it was quite romantic,  and the food was wonderful.  i don\'t know how romantic it was when she had to cover what the twenty bucks didn\'t.  i tried, anyway.<BR><BR>then we came back here and watched <B><I>the unbearable lightness of being</B></I>.  i picked it out all by myself.  it was romantic as all get out.  picked up whatever slack there was left.  it was also muy erotico, which didn\'t hurt any.',0,'','en'),(35678,'2005-02-15 08:11:48',17,'austin','sounds good.',0,'','en'),(35679,'2005-02-15 08:12:02',17,'austin','i am not that romantic.',0,'','en'),(35680,'2005-02-15 13:31:18',195,'matt','i\'m up at eight a.m.  i guess that\'s progress, anyway.  now, quel horror, i\'m off to the gym.  i wonder if it\'s still there.<BR><BR>(i\'ll be off to the gym at a little after nine, anyway.  must let the window close.)',0,'','en'),(35681,'2005-02-15 14:35:58',82,'simon','ugh, it\'s morning',0,'','en'),(35682,'2005-02-15 14:36:58',82,'simon','me and L were so busy, we barely saw each other yesterday. i took a cab from a ballet gala to her band\'s show. then at 2 am we came home and shared a beer and some snacks then passed out.',0,'','en'),(35683,'2005-02-15 21:52:32',17,'austin','matt, i sent you eml.',0,'','en'),(35684,'2005-02-15 21:52:43',17,'austin','plz to respnd.',0,'','en'),(35685,'2005-02-15 22:25:42',195,'matt','<A HREF=\"http://story.news.yahoo.com/news?tmpl=story&u=/afp/20050215/en_afp/portugalreligionlucia\">veja-o mais tarde</A>',0,'','en'),(35686,'2005-02-15 22:35:25',195,'matt','well, i\'ll be damned if i know where you sent it to.  i have three yahoo accounts:<BR>sixessevensandnines<BR>mccord679<BR><BR>and the supersecret:<BR>cthulhuraiser<BR><BR>those are the only accounts i maintain.<BR>i think.<BR>there might be a hotmail one i haven\'t looked at in two or three years.',0,'','en'),(35687,'2005-02-15 22:48:26',17,'austin','i sent again to sixessevensandnines',0,'','en'),(35688,'2005-02-15 23:07:53',195,'matt','yeah, it showed up that time.<BR><BR>replied  talk to you later on.',0,'','en'),(35689,'2005-02-16 00:21:10',195,'matt','i didn\'t name that account that.  that was somebody\'s idea of a joke.  you would have to understand their sense of humor.<BR><BR>i\'m not about the horror at all.',0,'','en'),(35690,'2005-02-16 00:43:19',82,'simon','blah blah. i\'m full of food.',0,'','en'),(35691,'2005-02-16 16:52:23',66,'Peter','<img src=\"http://www.thinkgeek.com/images/products/front/geek_love_poem.jpg\">',0,'','en'),(35692,'2005-02-16 17:10:06',82,'simon','dork!!',0,'','en'),(35693,'2005-02-16 17:33:50',66,'Peter','peen!',0,'130.219.136.217','en'),(35694,'2005-02-16 19:04:21',195,'matt','i think the assassination of the lebanese former prime minister was carried out by agents provocateurs working for the u.s. (or whatever shadow group coordinates these things) to contribute to a case against syria.  just to put a little something in the pipeline to tackle after iran.<BR><BR>(i don\'t know if a.p. is the correct term for what i\'m talking about, but, you know, i sure enjoyed pulling it out of my ass.)',0,'','en'),(35695,'2005-02-16 20:51:54',82,'simon','dude, you called me a peen!',0,'','en'),(35696,'2005-02-17 01:22:49',66,'Peter','p33n. its the word of the week!',0,'','en'),(35697,'2005-02-17 01:23:18',66,'Peter','i think im coming down with a cold. hmm. better go chug a bottle o\' nyquil.',0,'','en'),(35698,'2005-02-17 01:26:06',82,'simon','hi ass head',0,'','en'),(35699,'2005-02-17 03:05:02',66,'Peter','someone broke into our car and stole our stereo and fucked up the driver\'s side door. and our battery is dead. and i havea cold. whwo, what a great day today is