a like that, and if they did, they shouldn\'t be people whose opinions you value, anyway.</I><BR><BR>it sure would be nice to rub a few faces in it, though.  man, i\'m fucked up, huh?<BR><BR>and then, in the dream this morning, i was pursuing this girl who was completely unattainable in high school.  i finally got her number.  (but then again, that\'s funny.  i had her number then.  we were semi-best friends.)<BR><BR>she\'s an obstetrician now.',0,'','en'),(35727,'2005-02-20 20:12:17',17,'austin','alana: no, i dont go by ebay.',0,'','en'),(35728,'2005-02-20 20:12:43',17,'austin','in other news, ramblin\' jack elliot is trippy as hell.  1/3 of his songs are about shooting women but he sounds like raffi.',0,'','en'),(35729,'2005-02-20 23:58:06',17,'austin','my motorcycle is pissing me off.',0,'','en'),(35730,'2005-02-21 05:50:00',175,'Paul G','hst...',0,'','en'),(35731,'2005-02-21 06:18:09',154,'ryan','RIP Hunter',0,'','en'),(35732,'2005-02-21 07:02:42',195,'matt','wow, sandra dee and hunter s. thompson died on the same day.  just about as diametrically opposed as two people can be.',0,'','en'),(35733,'2005-02-21 07:10:06',195,'matt','who would have thought he\'d do that?  who would have thought the story would have ended that way?  wow.  why are so many exemplary people on the list of suicides?',0,'','en'),(35734,'2005-02-21 07:18:04',195,'matt','<A HREF=\"http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/List_of_suicides\">a list</A>',0,'','en'),(35735,'2005-02-21 11:10:33',63,'treo','treo <3 swinney',0,'','en'),(35736,'2005-02-21 11:11:33',63,'treo','&hearts;  swinney',0,'','en'),(35737,'2005-02-21 16:35:10',17,'austin','treo.  i can have one now with my service.  so indulgent though, and do i really want computers to follow me around?  no.  but the cam phone would be fun...',0,'','en'),(35738,'2005-02-21 16:38:07',17,'austin','also there is that element that you COULD become organized with one.  and that might manifest itself as guilt that i would not be using it to its full organizat