anny Swindle','i\'ve had some <a href=\"http://www.citynoise.org/article/815\">thoughts</a>',0,'','en'),(35992,'2005-03-26 00:16:42',17,'austin','i\'m going to raise jesus!',0,'','en'),(35993,'2005-03-26 06:41:38',240,'xep','overheard tonight: well, this was back when the smurfs were popular.',0,'','en'),(35994,'2005-03-26 06:53:29',82,'simon','tonight i hung out with debbi harry back stage. it was kinda awesome',0,'','en'),(35995,'2005-03-26 18:53:41',195,'matt','i think i can.',0,'','en'),(35996,'2005-03-26 19:56:02',66,'Peter','cool. im kicking it with jean-michael basquiat tomorrow.',0,'','en'),(35997,'2005-03-26 20:48:46',496,'chemicalpilate','I don\'t know any celebrities.',0,'','en'),(35998,'2005-03-26 21:16:46',175,'Paul G','haha.  last night i borrowed a cd because it contained \"heart of glass.\"  i had a huge crush on her in 1979...the ladies from abba, too...sigh.',0,'','en'),(35999,'2005-03-26 22:34:13',234,'etienne','i have a massive poster of her on my wall',0,'','en'),(36000,'2005-03-26 22:34:21',234,'etienne','she is my patron saint',0,'','en'),(36001,'2005-03-27 20:42:58',195,'matt','a stick.  a stone.  it\'s the end of the road.  it\'s feeling alone.  it\'s the weight of your load.  it\'s a sliver of glass.  it\'s life.  it\'s the sun.  it\'s night.  it\'s death.  it\'s a knife.  it\'s a gun.<BR><BR>a flower that blooms.  a fox in the brush.  a knot in the wood.  the song of the thrush.  the mystery of life.  steps in the hall.  the sound of the wind and the waterfall.<BR><BR>it\'s the moon floating free.  it\'s the curve of the slope.  it\'s an egg.  it\'s a bee.  it\'s a reason for hope.  and the river bank sings of the waters of march.  it\'s the promise of spring.  it\'s the joy in your heart.<BR><BR>a spear.  a spike.  a stake.  a nail.  it\'s a drip.  it\'s a drop.  it\'s the end of the tale.  the dew on the leaf in the morning light.  the shot of a gun in the dead of the night.<BR><BR>a mile.  a must.  a thrust.  a bump.  it\'s the will to survive.  it\'s a jolt.  it\'s a jump.  blueprint of a house.  a body in bed.  a car stuck in the mud.  it\'s the mud.  it\'s the mud.<BR><BR>a fish.  a flash.  a wish.  a wing.  it\'s a hawk.  it\'s a dove.  it\'s the promise of spring.  and the river bank sings of the waters of march.  it\'s the end of despair.  it\'s the joy in your heart.<BR><BR>a stick.  a stone.  it\'s the end of the road.  the stump of a tree.  it\'s a frog.  it\'s a toad.  a sigh.  a breath.  a walk.  a run.  a life.  a death.  a rain.  a sun.<BR><BR>and the river bank sings of the waters of march.  it\'s the promise of life.  it\'s the joy in your heart.<BR><BR><RIGHT>- antonio carlos jobim</RIGHT>',0,'','en'),(36002,'2005-03-27 21:02:20',17,'austin','my eyeballs hurt!',0,'','en'),(36003,'2005-03-28 03:56:22',82,'simon','heh, load.',0,'','en'),(36004,'2005-03-28 05:18:11',496,'chemicalpilate','Here is something I wrote and saved somewhere else but I will share with you because I can: my mom and dad are asleep on an inflatable mattress in my living room.  Also, my dad snores.',0,'','en'),(36005,'2005-03-28 07:57:13',17,'austin','this would mean you motorcycle is here.',0,'','en'),(36006,'2005-03-28 13:58:44',496,'chemicalpilate','Dear Austin,<br><br>Exactly.<br><br>Sincerely,<br>Steve',0,'','en'),(36007,'2005-03-28 17:23:50',604,'jdfalk','National Poetry Month starts soon.',0,'','en'),(36008,'2005-03-28 17:23:58',604,'jdfalk','(I\'m just sayin\')',0,'','en'),(36009,'2005-03-29 04:31:03',17,'austin','i\'m just sprayin\'',0,'','en'),(36010,'2005-03-29 19:29:14',66,'Peter','2 legit 2 quit',0,'','en'),(36011,'2005-03-29 19:58:59',496,'chemicalpilate','Walking in to work carrying your motorcycle helmet = yeah.',0,'','en'),(36012,'2005-03-30 01:34:07',67,'trouble','motherfuck that drive from jersey to detroit',0,'','en'),(36013,'2005-03-30 02:48:42',83,'adamajah','Circumventing the parking lot gate on your moto = yeah.',0,'','en'),(36014,'2005-03-30 16:24:56',66,'Peter','http://saturn5.com/~peter/