CENTER><br><br>when i got home, i called the city dept. of parks and recreation and asked if my tax money had paid to erect it.  evidently not; the local republican committee did.<BR><BR>i\\\'m thinking about sneaking over there in the dead of night and defacing it.  which markers are weatherproof?  and what should i write under the inscription?  i was considering:<BR><BR><CENTER>MUCH TO OUR SHAME</CENTER><br><br>i dunno.<BR><BR>if i had the means, i\\\'d blow it up.',0,'71.98.174.77','en'),(37400,'2005-11-16 21:33:47',66,'Peter','id use somethign sharp and scratch/etch it in. much more permanent than marker.',0,'130.219.8.253','en'),(37401,'2005-11-16 21:34:06',66,'Peter','but i agree. that thing is begging to be defaced. its your duty as a liberal floridian, matt.',0,'130.219.8.253','en'),(37402,'2005-11-17 06:10:42',154,'ryan','GODDAMN',0,'67.171.154.38','en'),(37403,'2005-11-17 07:25:32',400,'elaine','it would be good if you could do it in a similar \\\'official\\\' looking style',0,'62.56.51.42','en'),(37404,'2005-11-17 08:22:24',195,'matt','i sigilled it just now.  BOO-YA.  enough said.<BR><BR>a higher sort of politics.<BR><BR><I><BLOCKQUOTE>in the space between our house<BR>some bones have been discovered<BR>but our procession lurches on as if we have recovered<BR><BR>draconian winter unforetold<BR>one solar day, suddenly you\\\'re old<BR>your little envelope just makes me feel cold<BR>makes destination start to unfold<BR><BR>our documents are useless, or forged beyond believing<BR>page forty-seven is unsigned, I need it by this evening<BR>in the space between our cities, a storm is slowly forming<BR>something eating up our days, i feed it every morning<BR>destination, destination<BR><BR>it\\\'s not a religion, it\\\'s just a technique</BLOCKQUOTE></I>',0,'71.98.174.77','en'),(37405,'2005-11-17 15:39:53',66,'Peter','<img src=\\\"http://www.saturn5.com/~peter/ljphoto/duh/showhair.gif\\\" width=\\\"260\\\">',0,'130.219.8.253','en'),(37406,'2005-11-17 17:04:17',