e for ya man. ',0,'58.226.158.76','en'),(38199,'2006-01-31 12:53:22',195,'matt','i appreciate it.',0,'71.99.163.87','en'),(38200,'2006-01-31 13:43:05',93,'chiamattt','what\\\'s family for?',0,'58.226.158.76','en'),(38201,'2006-01-31 13:55:28',82,'simon','hi buttheads',0,'24.193.38.191','en'),(38202,'2006-01-31 14:41:16',66,'Peter','\\\"...haters wanna hate, lovers wanna love... i dont wanna do none of the above, i wanna pee on you. i pee on you i pee on you ill piss on you...\\\" --r. kelly',0,'130.219.8.253','en'),(38203,'2006-01-31 15:15:25',496,'chemicalpilate','gnash gnash',0,'69.17.112.117','en'),(38204,'2006-01-31 15:34:32',82,'simon','i\\\'m feelin on your booooooty, peter.',0,'209.21.99.118','en'),(38205,'2006-01-31 15:39:22',66,'Peter','ballaz wanna ball, yall!',0,'130.219.8.253','en'),(38206,'2006-01-31 15:45:45',251,'jamie','i feel obscure',0,'213.249.154.99','en'),(38207,'2006-01-31 16:28:34',66,'Peter','the now infamous post is being discussed on the radio now <a href=\\\"http://www.cfrb.com/player/player\\\">listen in</a>...',0,'130.219.8.253','en'),(38208,'2006-01-31 16:57:06',148,'jeeff','matt, you could investigate from here till doomsday.  i\\\'ve been there while adam\\\'s taken many of his photos, seeing as we\\\'re roommates and friends.  you\\\'re being a complete weiner.  and the photos ran on the front page of today\\\'s toronto star, with the globe and mail (national newspaper) lined up for the weekend.  better get your detective hat on.  on a not so happy note, our phone has been ringing off the hook since 7:30am =(',0,'70.24.130.3','en'),(38209,'2006-01-31 17:04:36',148,'jeeff','<img src=\\\"http://www.modernhistory.org/temp/hool_notfake.jpg\\\"> here, i have updated one of hool\\\'s photos so that it will not look fake and won\\\'t offend your photographic sensibilities',0,'70.24.130.3','en'),(38210,'2006-01-31 17:14:58',82,'lilwayne','yo, my hoes got hoes, for real.',0,'209.21.99.118','en'),(38211,'2006-01-31 17:36:28',66,'Peter','imagin