me. (*) take you phony congrats; (**) and your \\\"creepiest non-sequitur;\\\" (***) and go fuck yourself; (****) i\\\'m sick of you and other douchebags talking shit about me instead of talking to me.',0,'76.209.238.208','en'),(40350,'2008-06-19 02:17:42',66,'Peter','another choice example. not too sure about the ',0,'24.188.229.135','en'),(40351,'2008-06-19 02:20:39',66,'Peter','not too sure about the \\\"talking to you\\\" thing, as i addressed my comment to you. i dont mean any offense, man. i just happen to think its weird to carry on some disjointed-and-vaguely-offensive reply across flickr/swinney/etc. you pop up with stuff like this from time to time, and the paranoia, and namecalling and injecting snippets of nebulous dialog thats impossible to follow... i dunno, man. i find it creepy. again, no offense to you. you make a fine (and very interesting) internet pal.',0,'24.188.229.135','en'),(40352,'2008-06-20 17:24:06',66,'Peter','y',0,'130.219.8.253','en'),(40353,'2008-06-20 17:24:10',66,'Peter','a',0,'130.219.8.253','en'),(40354,'2008-06-20 17:24:12',66,'Peter','w',0,'130.219.8.253','en'),(40355,'2008-06-20 17:24:16',66,'Peter','y',0,'130.219.8.253','en'),(40356,'2008-06-20 17:24:20',66,'Peter','n',0,'130.219.8.253','en'),(40357,'2008-06-20 17:24:23',66,'Peter','a',0,'130.219.8.253','en'),(40358,'2008-06-20 18:37:53',195,'matt','it gets worse<BR>in the summer<BR>when the nights are hot and long',0,'64.128.136.170','en'),(40359,'2008-06-20 22:29:48',82,'simon','ho hum',0,'64.131.211.20','en'),(40360,'2008-06-21 04:35:27',66,'Peter','i just walked across the williamsburg bridge. for the fourth time this week.',0,'24.188.229.135','en'),(40361,'2008-06-21 18:28:28',195,'matt','don\\\'t jump.',0,'64.128.136.170','en'),(40362,'2008-06-23 01:15:23',66,'Peter','ha. i might fall, but definitely not off of the bridge.',0,'24.188.229.135','en'),(40363,'2008-06-24 22:30:31',195,'matt','the drunkness?',0,'64.128.136.170','en'),(40364,'2008-06-25 01:30:02',66,'Peter','no