at chess, though, so i don\\\'t know.',0,'64.128.136.170','en'),(40403,'2008-07-24 17:51:37',195,'matt','<a href=\\\"http://news.yahoo.com/s/ap/20080724/ap_on_re_au_an/new_zealand_bizarre_names\\\">Yeah Detroit.  Sex Fruit.</a>  ahahahahahaha.  that\\\'s great.',0,'64.128.136.170','en'),(40404,'2008-07-25 00:18:43',66,'Peter','number 16 bus shelter!',0,'24.188.229.135','en'),(40405,'2008-07-25 00:19:28',66,'Peter','is someone named \\\"Rob Murfitt\\\" fit to judge the wuality of passable names? hmm.',0,'24.188.229.135','en'),(40406,'2008-07-25 01:41:43',66,'Peter','ooh <a href=\\\"http://newyork.craigslist.org/stn/mis/768890668.html\\\">the crazies are stirring tonight</a>...',0,'24.188.229.135','en'),(40407,'2008-07-25 17:05:52',195,'matt','it\\\'s been pulled.  what did it say?',0,'64.128.136.170','en'),(40408,'2008-07-25 18:25:13',66,'Peter','some crazy lady on staten island going progressively nuts about some random guy she doesnt even know. the good ones are getting flagged left and right cause theyre bizarre and scary but there are a <a href=\\\"http://newyork.craigslist.org/search/mis?query=waterloo&minAsk=min&maxAsk=max\\\">few</a> around still.',0,'130.219.8.253','en'),(40409,'2008-07-26 16:41:29',195,'matt','the scary part is that the crazies think they have the purest of intentions, and they aren\\\'t able to look at their situation objectively.  people who haven\\\'t been on that ride really can\\\'t begin to imagine what it\\\'s like to believe certain things are true which are patently delusional.  i had a particularly florid episode that lasted about three weeks during which i believed all the humans i saw were really gods or emissaries thereof who were observing my behavior in order to eventually pass judgment.  not a lot of fun, but i believed it to be the absolute truth.<BR><BR>(something in the hopper.  later - gotta scoot.)',0,'64.128.136.170','en'),(40410,'2008-07-28 21:11:28',66,'Peter','you should write more of your stories, matt. its been a w