rticular venue, people are always entertained.</tt>',0,'24.188.229.135','en'),(40427,'2008-08-08 18:45:15',195,'matt','<a href=\\\"http://www.stickfellow.com/rawhide.html\\\"><i>Mysteriously a number of fellows materialized in my garage with my completed LP.</i></a><BR><BR>ha.  i don\\\'t know that that\\\'s an accurate translation of the lyrics, but i think that\\\'s jesse\\\'s mindset these days.  i don\\\'t think he really believes that this is all happening.  all this was inside us.  at this point, everything either samples or is stuck together with dub.  i\\\'ll bet king tubby is rolling and rolling.  forgive us....',0,'64.128.136.170','en'),(40428,'2008-08-08 18:45:50',195,'matt','<i>not much going down in hermopolis magna outside el ashmunein</i>',0,'64.128.136.170','en'),(40429,'2008-08-08 21:57:40',496,'chemicalpilate','fighting food to find transcendence',0,'137.131.205.145','en'),(40430,'2008-08-11 04:30:28',66,'Peter','all city crew',0,'24.188.229.135','en'),(40431,'2008-08-11 16:44:44',155,'blue stocking','i miss this place',0,'74.14.228.170','en'),(40432,'2008-08-11 23:54:58',496,'chemicalpilate','I\\\'ve got something to say but nothing comes.',0,'137.131.205.145','en'),(40433,'2008-08-13 20:30:31',195,'matt','reminds me of paxil.',0,'64.128.136.170','en'),(40434,'2008-08-14 02:45:51',66,'Peter','and its all true, because i have the damned documentation here to prove it',0,'24.188.229.135','en'),(40435,'2008-08-14 02:59:19',66,'Peter','how could he know what the fuck he never knew?<br>god-cypher divine come to show and come to prove<br>a mystery god thats the work of ya crew<br>the holy ghost got you scared to death kid boo',0,'24.188.229.135','en'),(40436,'2008-08-14 23:03:45',195,'matt','you arrived like a day and passed like a cloud<BR>i made a wish, i said it out loud<BR>out loud in a crowd<BR>everybody heard<BR>\\\'twas the talk of the town',0,'64.128.136.170','en'),(40437,'2008-08-15 05:47:26',66,'Peter','i just got back fro mqueens. i feel like