es III is the prince of monaco. prince charles\\\' grandfather was george V, who hailed from the german house of saxon. his great grandmother, charlotte of belgium, ruled as empress carlota of mexico. dos equis is still brewed in monterrey, nuevo leon using wilhelm hasse\\\'s original bavarian recipe, including hops grown in the hallertau region of bavaria, southeast germany, right next to the very, very deep lake totenkopf in ingolstadt, a lake which robert anton wilson surmised incubated hordes of hibernating nazi battalions poised to take over the world at a preordained time at which they would reanimate and marche <i>en masse</i> from the lake to siege mortals worldwide. luckily hagbard celine foils the american medical association, an evil rock-and-roll band, and their plan to bring about a mass human sacrifice. leviathan is awakend, eris is hailed, and the world is saved.',0,'24.188.46.194','en'),(40663,'2009-01-15 14:48:53',195,'matt','<i>The Bluebird Report states that in the absence of an iPod, the power of these tuneful cyclic annoyances can also be harnessed to thwart alien electro-paralysis. This technique is called Audio-Morphic Recall (AMR). Numerous documented cases and laboratory tests have demonstrated that by simply recalling certain songs and ‘replaying’ in your mind, you can block alien attempts to paralyse you.</i><BR><BR>(i don\\\'t know what the hell the bluebird report is.  whoever wrote it evidently knew about ipods, though.)',0,'72.187.21.88','en'),(40664,'2009-01-15 14:55:39',195,'matt','my friend mary lou went to rollins with a guy named carlos whose uncle is the king of spain.  his great-great-great grandmother was queen victoria, a fact you\\\'d learn not long after making his acquaintance.  that always amused me.<BR><BR>also, totenkopf means deadhead.  reminds me of <i>blind date</i>, the voytek frykowski character showing the kosinsky stand-in all the dropouts on hollywood boulevard (called them crabs or something), predicting they wo